egible.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀the⠀record⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀stopping⠀point,⠀been⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀left⠀the⠀speaker⠀still⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀early-modern⠀comic-theatrical⠀telling⠀mode.⠀Establish⠀the⠀teller⠀as⠀a⠀performer⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀audience⠀and⠀occasion:⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀recounting⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀court⠀procedure,⠀a⠀household⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀highway⠀inspection,⠀or⠀a⠀market⠀dispute⠀to⠀people⠀who⠀have⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀listen.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀address⠀that⠀audience⠀directly—\"Now⠀you⠀should⠀know⠀that...\"⠀or⠀an⠀equivalent⠀phrase⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀voice—but⠀keep⠀the⠀address⠀the⠀chosen⠀fictional⠀teller's⠀performance,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀manner.⠀No⠀particular⠀accent,⠀scenery,⠀or⠀season⠀is⠀imposed⠀unless⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀comedy⠀from⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀a⠀solemn⠀or⠀official⠀procedure⠀and⠀an⠀ordinary⠀appetite,⠀fear,⠀or⠀fatigue.⠀Show⠀the⠀material⠀cost⠀exactly:⠀a⠀bribe⠀counted⠀coin⠀by⠀coin,⠀a⠀delay⠀measured⠀in⠀missed⠀meals,⠀a⠀mistaken⠀identity⠀that⠀costs⠀someone⠀a⠀day's⠀travel,⠀a⠀face-saving⠀lie⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀second⠀lie.⠀The⠀historical⠀period⠀runs⠀normally;⠀the⠀performance⠀cannot⠀stop⠀the⠀rain,⠀hurry⠀a⠀messenger,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀joke⠀become⠀magic.\n\nApply⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀method⠀through⠀the⠀performed⠀telling.⠀The⠀teller⠀follows⠀one⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀polite⠀answer⠀and⠀points⠀at⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀without⠀moralizing:⠀why⠀must⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀bow⠀three⠀times,⠀what⠀does⠀the⠀inspector⠀actually⠀inspect,⠀who⠀eats⠀the⠀food⠀that⠀was⠀offered⠀and⠀refused.⠀The⠀exaggeration⠀is⠀presentational—a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀drawn-out⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀pompous⠀phrase⠀used⠀three⠀times⠀with⠀slightly⠀different⠀consequences—not⠀a⠀distortion⠀of⠀physical⠀possibility.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀stupidly,⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀social⠀pressure⠀makes⠀the⠀stupid⠀action⠀rational⠀for⠀that⠀person.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀distance⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀performer.⠀A⠀storyteller⠀can⠀summarize⠀and⠀mock;⠀a⠀participating⠀character⠀cannot⠀know⠀another⠀person's⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀laugh,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀next⠀question,⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀the⠀performance⠀has⠀concluded,⠀been⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀left⠀the⠀audience⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀part.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀chronicle⠀or⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Establish⠀the⠀recorder's⠀occasion⠀and⠀method⠀of⠀assembly:⠀the⠀recorder⠀is⠀gathering⠀accounts⠀of⠀a⠀land⠀dispute,⠀a⠀forced⠀move,⠀a⠀labor⠀contract,⠀a⠀quarantine,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀celebration⠀turned⠀into⠀punishment,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀proceeds⠀as⠀an⠀arrangement⠀of⠀attributed⠀reports,⠀written⠀notices,⠀remembered⠀dialogues,⠀and⠀the⠀recorder's⠀own⠀limited⠀observations.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀material⠀is⠀obtained—an⠀interview⠀held⠀in⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀paper⠀borrowed⠀and⠀copied,⠀a⠀conversation⠀interrupted—because⠀those⠀conditions⠀affect⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀trusted.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀account⠀inside⠀its⠀owner's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀social⠀position.⠀A⠀laborer⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀payment⠀schedule⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀landlord's⠀other⠀holdings;⠀an⠀official⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀decree⠀but⠀not⠀its⠀effect⠀in⠀a⠀remote⠀house.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀report⠀at⠀the⠀sentence⠀level:⠀\"according⠀to⠀the⠀clerk,\"⠀\"so⠀I⠀was⠀told,\"⠀\"the⠀document⠀bears⠀the⠀date.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀merge⠀later⠀knowledge⠀into⠀earlier⠀scenes,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀recorder⠀describe⠀what⠀a⠀witness⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀seen.⠀The⠀language,⠀place,⠀and⠀community⠀must⠀remain⠀those⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀world;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀haciendas,⠀revolutions,⠀patron⠀saints,⠀or⠀magical⠀realism⠀unless⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀includes⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recorder⠀apply⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀inquiry⠀to⠀one⠀specific⠀discrepancy⠀in⠀the⠀assembled⠀reports.⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀why⠀was⠀the⠀gate⠀closed⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀day⠀than⠀the⠀order⠀says,⠀who⠀counted⠀the⠀dead⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀could⠀enter,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀receipt⠀mention⠀twelve⠀baskets⠀when⠀the⠀memories⠀agree⠀on⠀nine.⠀Ask⠀the⠀question⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀accounts⠀diverge,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀divergence⠀stand⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀single⠀resolution.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀should⠀be⠀practical,⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀rule⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀cost,⠀not⠀an⠀abstract⠀denunciation⠀of⠀all⠀power.\n\nAllow⠀for⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀conflicting⠀testimony.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀disagreement⠀and⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀solve⠀the⠀event⠀or⠀identify⠀a⠀single⠀villain.⠀The⠀historical⠀moment⠀may⠀be⠀brutal,⠀but⠀the⠀narrative⠀should⠀avoid⠀transforming⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀melodrama—boredom,⠀hunger,⠀laughter,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀affection⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀injustice.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀the⠀recorder⠀has⠀finished⠀one⠀account,⠀secured⠀another⠀interview,⠀or⠀reached⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀records⠀no⠀longer⠀agree.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀through⠀one⠀room,⠀one⠀road,⠀or⠀one⠀counter,⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀visual⠀anchor:⠀the⠀table⠀where⠀the⠀clerk⠀works,⠀the⠀line⠀at⠀the⠀gate,⠀the⠀load⠀waiting⠀on⠀the⠀cart.⠀Render⠀the⠀space⠀through⠀concrete⠀objects⠀and⠀movements—the⠀door,⠀the⠀exact⠀tool,⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀standing⠀posture—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀each⠀spatial⠀change⠀without⠀long⠀description.⠀Keep⠀every⠀object⠀and⠀movement⠀plausible⠀for⠀the⠀supplied⠀period;⠀no⠀modern⠀school⠀setting,⠀speech⠀balloon⠀staging,⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀device⠀is⠀required.\n\nState⠀the⠀relevant⠀rule⠀or⠀practice⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀or⠀posted⠀instruction.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀regulation⠀says,⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀required⠀copies,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀obligation⠀may⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀rule⠀appear⠀naturally⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph.⠀Then⠀carry⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀inquiry⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀say:⠀ask⠀\"then⠀what⠀does⠀the⠀regulation⠀say⠀should⠀happen⠀next?\"⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀absurd⠀answer⠀in⠀concrete⠀consequence—time⠀lost,⠀money⠀spent,⠀a⠀person⠀left⠀outside,⠀a⠀record⠀misplaced.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀carry⠀character⠀thought⠀and⠀argument.⠀A⠀question⠀may⠀create⠀a⠀small⠀pause;⠀someone⠀may⠀laugh,⠀look⠀away,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀finish⠀an⠀irrelevant⠀task.⠀Let⠀each⠀reaction⠀belong⠀to⠀its⠀owner:⠀fear⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀wit,⠀amusement⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀cynicism.⠀The⠀private⠀feeling⠀within⠀a⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀irritated,⠀amused,⠀or⠀numb,⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀the⠀paragraph⠀structure⠀readable,⠀with⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀separated⠀cleanly.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀overall⠀method⠀light⠀in⠀presentation,⠀not⠀in⠀substance.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀several⠀beats⠀quickly,⠀but⠀history⠀still⠀runs:⠀a⠀permit⠀takes⠀days,⠀a⠀message⠀takes⠀travel⠀time,⠀a⠀sealed⠀room⠀remains⠀locked.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀completed⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nGround⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀facts⠀—⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀carry,⠀obtain,⠀sign,⠀or⠀be⠀forbidden⠀—⠀and⠀move⠀through⠀them⠀with⠀sustained⠀rhythm⠀and⠀associative⠀attention.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator's⠀question⠀slips⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀let⠀the⠀slip⠀happen⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀prose:⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeats⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀a⠀sound⠀pattern⠀gathers⠀around⠀an⠀office⠀or⠀workshop⠀until⠀the⠀institution's⠀logic⠀becomes⠀audible,⠀the⠀tempo⠀slows⠀over⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀notice.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀exact.⠀Beauty⠀of⠀sound⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀inquiry,⠀and⠀irreverence⠀does⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀ornament⠀around⠀an⠀argument.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀proper⠀to⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀place;⠀as⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀its⠀use,⠀its⠀cost,⠀or⠀its⠀history,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀lengthen⠀or⠀quicken⠀accordingly.⠀A⠀comparison⠀earns⠀its⠀extension⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀—⠀when⠀the⠀queue⠀outside⠀a⠀records⠀office⠀becomes,⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀one⠀journey⠀made⠀many⠀times,⠀the⠀figure⠀has⠀done⠀intellectual⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀Keep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀this⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀this⠀narrator's⠀associations;⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.\n\nLet⠀plainness⠀carry⠀weight.⠀A⠀dry⠀procedural⠀sentence⠀set⠀against⠀a⠀musical⠀passage⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀the⠀critique:⠀the⠀rule⠀recites⠀itself⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀notices⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀costs.⠀When⠀candor⠀turns⠀private⠀—⠀disappointment,⠀curiosity,⠀an⠀attachment⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀announce⠀—⠀tether⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀things:⠀a⠀coat's⠀weight⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀dust⠀unsettled⠀by⠀a⠀searched⠀drawer.⠀A⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀mid-motion⠀or⠀mid-thought;⠀the⠀shaped⠀rhythm⠀needs⠀no⠀concluding⠀moral⠀to⠀release⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀edits⠀a⠀historical⠀moment⠀makes⠀in⠀ordinary⠀routine:⠀the⠀stall⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀opens,⠀the⠀street⠀cut⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀wall,⠀the⠀phrase⠀everyone⠀once⠀used⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀now⠀explains.⠀Weigh⠀each⠀one⠀honestly⠀rather⠀than⠀mourning⠀by⠀default.⠀Some⠀changes⠀are⠀loss,⠀some⠀are⠀release,⠀some⠀are⠀merely⠀inconvenience,⠀and⠀this⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀so⠀plainly;⠀that⠀candor⠀is⠀what⠀keeps⠀the⠀tenderness⠀real.⠀When⠀a⠀remembered⠀person⠀or⠀occasion⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀matter⠀after⠀an⠀unsentimental⠀accounting⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀actually⠀proves⠀—⠀what⠀people⠀then⠀believed,⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀obtain,⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀promised⠀and⠀withheld.\n\nTreat⠀recollection⠀as⠀evidence⠀with⠀a⠀use.⠀A⠀past⠀argument,⠀meal,⠀or⠀workday⠀enters⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀because⠀it⠀answers⠀a⠀live⠀question:⠀why⠀the⠀narrator⠀takes⠀the⠀long⠀way⠀now,⠀why⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀clerk⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀different⠀name.⠀Make⠀the⠀comparison⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀check⠀—⠀the⠀earlier⠀price,⠀the⠀earlier⠀rule,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀at⠀the⠀window⠀this⠀year.⠀Let⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀voice;⠀someone⠀may⠀joke⠀about⠀the⠀old⠀ration⠀book⠀or⠀the⠀form⠀that⠀took⠀three⠀stamps,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀joke⠀both⠀true⠀and⠀not⠀enough.\n\nKeep⠀what⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀frame⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀gone.⠀The⠀door⠀still⠀has⠀weight;⠀the⠀name⠀is⠀still⠀a⠀name;⠀the⠀meal⠀is⠀still⠀worth⠀eating.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasure⠀inside⠀the⠀reflection,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀may⠀stay⠀unfinished⠀—⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀pause⠀on⠀it⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀attention⠀rests⠀on⠀some⠀coexisting⠀detail,⠀the⠀historical⠀change⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀declared.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀incident⠀through⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀a⠀live⠀audience:⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀trade,⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀relating⠀this⠀today,⠀speaking⠀in⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀or⠀a⠀tea⠀room⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scenario's⠀actual⠀period⠀and⠀community.⠀Draw⠀the⠀telling⠀convention⠀from⠀the⠀tradition⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀—⠀its⠀language,⠀its⠀occasions⠀for⠀public⠀narration,⠀its⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀to⠀whom⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀assembling⠀a⠀generic⠀antique⠀court⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀frame⠀apparatus.⠀The⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀is⠀partial⠀and⠀positioned:⠀they⠀witnessed⠀a⠀fragment,⠀heard⠀a⠀report⠀secondhand,⠀or⠀were⠀told⠀to⠀leave⠀one⠀detail⠀out,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀shows⠀those⠀seams.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀carry⠀the⠀rational⠀work.⠀When⠀the⠀tale⠀reaches⠀a⠀rule⠀whose⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀is⠀the⠀point⠀—⠀a⠀permit⠀required⠀before⠀one⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀loss⠀of⠀a⠀permit,⠀for⠀instance⠀—⠀the⠀listeners⠀become⠀the⠀inquiry:⠀one⠀interrupts⠀to⠀ask⠀who⠀benefits,⠀another⠀supplies⠀the⠀answer⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀permitted⠀inside⠀the⠀office,⠀a⠀third⠀says⠀it⠀has⠀always⠀been⠀so⠀and⠀means⠀it.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀approved⠀stopping⠀point⠀while⠀claiming⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀saw.⠀Distribute⠀the⠀skepticisms:⠀resignation,⠀humor,⠀and⠀threat⠀can⠀sit⠀in⠀different⠀mouths,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀sage⠀dispensing⠀verdicts⠀to⠀a⠀chorus.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀language⠀the⠀author's⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀own;⠀historical⠀specificity⠀arrives⠀through⠀objects,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀routes⠀—⠀a⠀sealed⠀jar,⠀a⠀tax⠀receipt,⠀the⠀hour⠀the⠀water⠀seller⠀passes⠀—⠀not⠀through⠀invented⠀antique⠀diction.⠀Add⠀no⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀honor⠀code,⠀or⠀religious⠀weight⠀the⠀scenario⠀has⠀not⠀supplied.⠀A⠀nested⠀tale⠀may⠀enter⠀only⠀if⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀understand⠀about⠀the⠀frame⠀incident;⠀otherwise⠀the⠀frame⠀carries⠀the⠀telling⠀alone.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀just⠀begun⠀to⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀state⠀them⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses:⠀the⠀courtyard⠀at⠀the⠀hour⠀it⠀fills,⠀the⠀ledger⠀open⠀to⠀its⠀last⠀ruled⠀page,⠀the⠀window⠀that⠀closes⠀at⠀noon.⠀Let⠀one⠀chosen⠀thing⠀carry⠀the⠀institution⠀—⠀the⠀groove⠀worn⠀into⠀an⠀inkstone⠀by⠀years⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀signature,⠀the⠀painted⠀line⠀beyond⠀which⠀goods⠀may⠀not⠀pass.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀absurd,⠀do⠀not⠀name⠀the⠀absurdity;⠀show⠀the⠀official⠀asleep⠀behind⠀his⠀own⠀notice,⠀the⠀applicant⠀copying⠀the⠀same⠀form⠀twice⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀copy⠀used⠀the⠀wrong⠀ink.⠀The⠀reader⠀infers.\n\nKeep⠀rhetoric⠀inside⠀the⠀observation.⠀A⠀dry⠀summary⠀is⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀detail⠀just⠀given⠀and⠀moves⠀the⠀inquiry⠀forward⠀—⠀a⠀flat⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀queue⠀is⠀for⠀can⠀land⠀harder⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀commentary⠀—⠀and⠀understatement⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀black⠀humor:⠀the⠀stamp⠀reads⠀URGENT;⠀the⠀clerk⠀files⠀it⠀under⠀PENDING.⠀Economy⠀is⠀selection,⠀not⠀fragment⠀performance;⠀a⠀precise⠀long⠀sentence⠀serves⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀performed⠀shortness,⠀and⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀runs⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs.\n\nGive⠀each⠀voice⠀its⠀own⠀shape.⠀An⠀old⠀applicant⠀may⠀undo⠀an⠀entire⠀official⠀ceremony⠀with⠀one⠀ordinary⠀sentence;⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀the⠀bureau's⠀borrowed⠀phrases.⠀A⠀brief⠀private⠀thought⠀—⠀another⠀month⠀of⠀this⠀—⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀brush⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀kept⠀to⠀the⠀length⠀that⠀matters⠀and⠀no⠀longer.⠀Omit⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer,⠀never⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀an⠀action.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀exchange⠀continues,⠀the⠀form⠀still⠀uncopied⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀applicant⠀already⠀at⠀the⠀window;⠀the⠀selected⠀facts⠀have⠀already⠀changed⠀what⠀is⠀understood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained,⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀inside⠀the⠀historical⠀moment.⠀Open⠀within⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints⠀immediate⠀—⠀a⠀route⠀checked⠀against⠀a⠀curfew,⠀a⠀family⠀arguing⠀over⠀a⠀new⠀assessment,⠀an⠀official⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀sign⠀without⠀a⠀token⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀without⠀ceremony⠀among⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀authorizes.⠀Orient⠀by⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀recap:⠀the⠀narrator⠀simply⠀looks⠀elsewhere,⠀and⠀the⠀paragraph⠀follows.\n\nLet⠀the⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀something⠀a⠀person⠀does.⠀A⠀discrepancy⠀appears⠀—⠀the⠀posted⠀rule⠀contradicts⠀what⠀the⠀clerk⠀demands,⠀the⠀receipt⠀omits⠀the⠀fee⠀everyone⠀paid⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀follows⠀it:⠀asks⠀the⠀next⠀question,⠀tests⠀the⠀answer,⠀or⠀quietly⠀notes⠀where⠀it⠀fails.⠀Distribute⠀the⠀lucidity.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reach⠀a⠀skeptical⠀conclusion⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀stays⠀cautious,⠀hopeful,⠀or⠀uninterested,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀witty⠀about⠀it.⠀Bureaucratic⠀absurdity⠀registers⠀through⠀concrete⠀interaction⠀—⠀who⠀waits⠀where,⠀which⠀paper⠀changes⠀hands,⠀what⠀the⠀guard's⠀eyes⠀do⠀—⠀not⠀through⠀assembled⠀one-liners.\n\nUse⠀memory⠀and⠀perception⠀as⠀practical⠀knowledge.⠀Recalling⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀last⠀winter's⠀permit⠀line⠀explains⠀the⠀stool⠀brought⠀today;⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀sealed⠀jar⠀or⠀the⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀tells⠀the⠀narrator⠀something⠀about⠀who⠀passes⠀through.⠀Keep⠀the⠀contemporary⠀register⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀pacing⠀and⠀unobtrusive⠀structure,⠀not⠀of⠀attitude:⠀these⠀people⠀hold⠀their⠀period's⠀beliefs⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀modern⠀audience's⠀conclusions.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀mid-errand,⠀mid-conversation,⠀or⠀inside⠀a⠀thought⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀not⠀finished⠀—⠀no⠀lesson⠀owed,⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀material⠀world⠀still⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nWork⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplied,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀particular⠀promise⠀govern⠀which⠀scenes⠀are⠀chosen.⠀Make⠀the⠀bond⠀legible⠀through⠀particulars⠀that⠀accumulate:⠀one⠀person⠀knows⠀which⠀stall⠀sells⠀salt⠀without⠀weighing⠀it⠀first;⠀the⠀other⠀waits⠀a⠀quarter⠀hour⠀past⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀requires⠀and⠀calls⠀it⠀nothing.⠀Private⠀language⠀grows⠀from⠀shared⠀history⠀—⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀a⠀specific⠀official,⠀a⠀gesture⠀meaning⠀not⠀here,⠀a⠀nickname⠀earned⠀in⠀one⠀incident⠀and⠀never⠀used⠀in⠀public.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀friction,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀premise⠀promises,⠀and⠀add⠀none⠀of⠀them⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀has⠀not⠀placed⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀reach⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀concrete⠀obligation⠀and⠀risk.⠀A⠀denied⠀permit⠀separates⠀them⠀for⠀a⠀season;⠀a⠀family⠀expectation⠀imposes⠀a⠀public⠀silence⠀that⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀finds⠀heavier⠀than⠀the⠀other⠀does.⠀Inside⠀that⠀pressure,⠀candor⠀belongs⠀to⠀characters⠀individually:⠀one⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀rational⠀question⠀—⠀why⠀must⠀this⠀be⠀hidden,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀protected⠀by⠀hiding⠀it⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀answers⠀with⠀humor,⠀evasion,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀that⠀keeps⠀them⠀both⠀fed.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀shelter⠀from⠀the⠀period's⠀absurdity;⠀it⠀is⠀where⠀that⠀absurdity⠀is⠀felt,⠀measured,⠀and⠀sometimes⠀privately⠀refused.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀moments⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀circumstances⠀change.⠀A⠀phrase⠀that⠀first⠀gave⠀cover⠀can⠀later⠀sound⠀like⠀an⠀accusation⠀or⠀arrive⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀loyalty;⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀can⠀be⠀ration,⠀celebration,⠀or⠀apology⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀week.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀consist⠀of⠀a⠀returned⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀said⠀once⠀and⠀long⠀remembered.⠀No⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀door⠀shutting,⠀the⠀question⠀withheld,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀obligation⠀already⠀known⠀to⠀both.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nRelate⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀and⠀what⠀came⠀of⠀them,⠀told⠀as⠀something⠀already⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀sets⠀the⠀act⠀in⠀remembered⠀time⠀—⠀in⠀the⠀year⠀the⠀granary⠀closed,⠀a⠀clerk⠀walked⠀the⠀north⠀road⠀alone⠀—⠀and⠀establish⠀each⠀person⠀through⠀compact⠀statement⠀before⠀expanding⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀record⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀incident⠀itself:⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀the⠀road,⠀the⠀hour⠀of⠀the⠀inspection,⠀the⠀knock⠀repeated⠀on⠀the⠀notice⠀board.⠀Return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀second⠀application.\n\nMake⠀the⠀inquiry⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀commentary.⠀The⠀teller⠀sets⠀deed⠀beside⠀deed:⠀the⠀order⠀was⠀posted⠀and⠀the⠀official⠀went⠀home;⠀the⠀village⠀obeyed⠀for⠀a⠀month⠀and⠀then⠀stopped;⠀the⠀fine⠀was⠀entered⠀twice⠀in⠀the⠀ledger.⠀The⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀declared⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀done⠀carries⠀the⠀irony,⠀and⠀no⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀step⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀deliver⠀it.⠀Resist⠀inflation:⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀kept⠀the⠀ledger⠀from⠀burning⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀act⠀in⠀this⠀account,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀duel⠀with⠀fate,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀teller⠀reports⠀a⠀door⠀found⠀open;⠀only⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knows⠀why,⠀and⠀where⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀that⠀knowledge⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle⠀briefly⠀—⠀a⠀remembered⠀key,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀name⠀declined⠀—⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀telling's⠀stride.⠀Not⠀every⠀remembered⠀act⠀is⠀tragic;⠀not⠀every⠀recurrence⠀is⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀consequence⠀still⠀running⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀unpaid,⠀a⠀road⠀not⠀yet⠀walked⠀again⠀—⠀leaving⠀the⠀tale⠀certain⠀to⠀be⠀told⠀once⠀more⠀and⠀told⠀differently.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
