            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-historical_fiction-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Historical Fiction · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == historical_fiction}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Historical Fiction. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-historical_fiction; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaiazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realist⠀route:⠀the⠀story⠀lives⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀communal⠀setting⠀whose⠀customary⠀arrangements⠀regulate⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀do.⠀Establish⠀one⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀pressure⠀point—a⠀levy,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀obligation,⠀a⠀seating⠀custom,⠀a⠀supply⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀marriage⠀expectation—and⠀let⠀ordinary⠀scenes⠀carry⠀it⠀forward⠀through⠀practical⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀debate.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀register⠀as⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀notices⠀when⠀a⠀rule's⠀official⠀form⠀and⠀its⠀household⠀effect⠀diverge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀follow⠀that⠀divergence⠀from⠀a⠀euphemism⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀person⠀who⠀must⠀now⠀pay,⠀wait,⠀write,⠀or⠀lose⠀standing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀nimble⠀and⠀precise,⠀while⠀allowing⠀particular⠀speakers⠀their⠀own⠀habits;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀candor⠀and⠀dry⠀scrutiny⠀need⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀else⠀an⠀ironist.\n\nLet⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀pressure⠀point⠀occur⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀practical⠀condition:⠀the⠀same⠀fee⠀after⠀a⠀harvest⠀shortfall,⠀the⠀same⠀seating⠀rule⠀after⠀a⠀visitor⠀arrives,⠀the⠀same⠀clerk⠀after⠀a⠀new⠀instruction.⠀The⠀new⠀knowledge⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀household's⠀or⠀narrator's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀arrangement.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀institutional⠀collapse;⠀development⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀person's⠀revised⠀expectation,⠀a⠀cost⠀absorbed,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀understands⠀differently.\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realist's⠀weight⠀by⠀showing⠀costs⠀in⠀time,⠀money,⠀comfort,⠀and⠀respectability⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀them.⠀Historical⠀period⠀and⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known,⠀obtained,⠀or⠀expected,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀remains⠀where⠀no⠀source⠀specifies⠀it.⠀Interior⠀thought⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀other⠀members⠀of⠀the⠀household⠀unless⠀their⠀own⠀authorized⠀experience⠀is⠀being⠀rendered.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀assumed⠀atmosphere,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀the⠀local⠀tradition⠀into⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀establish⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀period-specific⠀material⠀fact⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀returned⠀to:⠀a⠀register⠀lying⠀open,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀permit,⠀a⠀quantity⠀of⠀goods⠀visibly⠀loaded,⠀a⠀bench⠀where⠀a⠀person⠀is⠀made⠀to⠀wait.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀observable⠀or⠀audible⠀events;⠀describe⠀the⠀prop,⠀movement,⠀or⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀camera.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inquiry⠀proceed⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀condition⠀whose⠀second⠀appearance⠀dislodges⠀an⠀official⠀account.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀claim⠀the⠀supply⠀was⠀complete⠀while⠀the⠀loading⠀block⠀has⠀shown⠀the⠀count⠀short;⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀cite⠀a⠀permit⠀requirement⠀while⠀the⠀door⠀just⠀admitted⠀someone⠀without⠀one.⠀The⠀mismatch⠀is⠀established⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀made⠀visible,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀narrator's⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀in⠀a⠀character's⠀speech⠀unless⠀that⠀character⠀would⠀articulate⠀it⠀now;⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀notice,⠀ask,⠀or⠀silently⠀measure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀register⠀in⠀particular⠀voices.⠀Let⠀one⠀person⠀press⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀office⠀formula:⠀which⠀shelf,⠀whose⠀signature,⠀how⠀long,⠀at⠀what⠀cost.⠀Another⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀circumlocution,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀be⠀drawn.⠀Shared⠀wit⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀period⠀style;⠀each⠀speaker's⠀candor⠀and⠀evasion⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀role⠀and⠀interest.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀experience⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀contract⠀calls⠀for⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀other⠀characters⠀overhear⠀or⠀as⠀voice-over⠀filler.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀cuts⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀beat⠀already⠀requires⠀that⠀audio⠀cue⠀or⠀transition.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀under⠀new⠀circumstances,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀continuing⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀inquiry⠀before⠀the⠀cutoff,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀an⠀unspecified⠀historical⠀question⠀with⠀an⠀invented⠀bureaucratic⠀template.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀script⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀played:⠀named⠀speakers,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects⠀on⠀the⠀set,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀business⠀the⠀actors⠀can⠀perform.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀set⠀the⠀physical⠀grammar⠀of⠀the⠀stage—who⠀enters⠀first,⠀which⠀door⠀a⠀person⠀of⠀that⠀rank⠀may⠀use,⠀who⠀sits⠀while⠀whom⠀stands,⠀which⠀paper⠀can⠀be⠀touched⠀and⠀by⠀whom,⠀how⠀long⠀a⠀reply⠀takes⠀to⠀come⠀back⠀through⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀channels—and⠀establish⠀these⠀through⠀use⠀in⠀the⠀playing⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanatory⠀speeches.⠀When⠀a⠀historical⠀limit⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀scene,⠀stage⠀it⠀as⠀fact:⠀for⠀example,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀carried⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀stage,⠀a⠀visitor⠀kept⠀standing⠀until⠀spoken⠀to,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀occupies⠀the⠀hands⠀while⠀the⠀talk⠀continues.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀register⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀particular⠀people⠀say⠀and⠀notice.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀observe⠀that⠀a⠀regulation⠀cannot⠀be⠀followed⠀as⠀written,⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀phrase⠀and⠀the⠀visible⠀arrangements⠀do⠀not⠀agree,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀promised⠀fairness⠀quietly⠀moves⠀work⠀onto⠀someone⠀specific.⠀Let⠀the⠀contradiction⠀be⠀playable:⠀a⠀character⠀recites⠀the⠀approved⠀formula⠀while⠀doing⠀what⠀the⠀formula⠀forbids,⠀or⠀fills⠀the⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀hard⠀question⠀with⠀exactly⠀the⠀business⠀that⠀answers⠀it.⠀Humor⠀and⠀candor⠀belong⠀to⠀individual⠀speakers⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀motives;⠀the⠀others⠀may⠀be⠀dull,⠀dutiful,⠀nervous,⠀or⠀plain,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀line⠀need⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.\n\nKeep⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀observable⠀from⠀the⠀stage—no⠀camera⠀angles,⠀no⠀narrated⠀feeling.⠀Private⠀thought⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀clearly⠀attributed;⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀audience,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀thinks.⠀On⠀stage,⠀people⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀shown,⠀or⠀overheard.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀staged⠀result,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀line,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀business⠀resuming.⠀No⠀gathering⠀of⠀the⠀cast,⠀forced⠀revelation,⠀or⠀curtain⠀line⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀historical⠀mind,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀move⠀as⠀that⠀mind⠀moves:⠀present⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀under⠀the⠀breath,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption⠀by⠀whoever⠀has⠀claim⠀on⠀this⠀person's⠀attention,⠀and⠀a⠀concern⠀that⠀keeps⠀returning.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀stream⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀ongoing⠀task,⠀such⠀as⠀waiting⠀outside⠀an⠀office,⠀mending,⠀copying,⠀keeping⠀accounts,⠀or⠀carrying⠀a⠀delivery,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀task⠀supply⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀the⠀thought⠀picks⠀up,⠀breaks⠀off⠀when⠀someone⠀looks⠀over,⠀resumes⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀edge.\n\nGive⠀this⠀mind⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀habit⠀of⠀following⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀arrives⠀by⠀juxtaposition:⠀an⠀edict's⠀solemn⠀phrase⠀set⠀beside⠀the⠀remembered⠀cost⠀of⠀complying⠀with⠀it,⠀a⠀procedure⠀praised⠀as⠀fair⠀against⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀actually⠀paid⠀for⠀that⠀fairness,⠀the⠀same⠀delay⠀met⠀a⠀third⠀time⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀apology.⠀Not⠀every⠀association⠀is⠀an⠀argument;⠀ordinary⠀perception,⠀appetite,⠀boredom,⠀fear,⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀run⠀alongside⠀the⠀institutional⠀question⠀and⠀may⠀take⠀over⠀whole⠀stretches⠀of⠀the⠀stream.\n\nHold⠀the⠀period's⠀limits⠀firmly.⠀This⠀person⠀can⠀recall,⠀know,⠀and⠀imagine⠀only⠀what⠀that⠀time,⠀place,⠀and⠀station⠀make⠀available;⠀other⠀figures⠀appear⠀as⠀this⠀mind's⠀memories,⠀reports,⠀and⠀guesses,⠀never⠀as⠀minds⠀directly⠀entered.⠀Where⠀the⠀source⠀leaves⠀something⠀unspecified,⠀let⠀it⠀stay⠀uncertain⠀instead⠀of⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀borrowed⠀detail.⠀Keep⠀orientation⠀strong⠀enough⠀to⠀separate⠀present⠀perception⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀fantasy—through⠀tense,⠀through⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀task,⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀senses⠀insist⠀on.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀lengthen,⠀loop,⠀or⠀fragment⠀with⠀the⠀associations,⠀but⠀what⠀happened⠀remains⠀what⠀happened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀real⠀written⠀traffic:⠀sender-attributed⠀letters,⠀relayed⠀notes,⠀office⠀copy⠀slips,⠀tally⠀entries,⠀or⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀messaging⠀medium⠀if⠀this⠀setting⠀genuinely⠀has⠀one.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀item⠀to⠀its⠀sender,⠀and⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀features⠀that⠀medium⠀truly⠀offers—for⠀instance,⠀a⠀seal⠀broken⠀or⠀intact,⠀the⠀copy⠀kept⠀before⠀dispatch,⠀a⠀delay⠀measured⠀in⠀days,⠀a⠀formula⠀that⠀recurs⠀across⠀the⠀office,⠀a⠀draft⠀set⠀aside⠀unsent.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀delivery⠀event⠀or⠀tampering⠀the⠀medium⠀cannot⠀produce⠀just⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀each⠀sender⠀be⠀distinct⠀in⠀habit:⠀how⠀they⠀address⠀a⠀superior,⠀what⠀they⠀report,⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out,⠀how⠀exactly⠀they⠀reproduce⠀a⠀form.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀carry⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀an⠀official⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀response⠀it⠀actually⠀gets—one⠀sender's⠀pointed⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀must⠀precede⠀a⠀deadline,⠀another's⠀dry⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀clerk⠀really⠀said,⠀a⠀third's⠀circumlocution⠀that⠀copies⠀the⠀standard⠀form⠀with⠀one⠀small⠀change.⠀Directness,⠀evasion,⠀and⠀dryness⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀people;⠀nobody⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀ironic⠀or⠀articulate.\n\nKeep⠀three⠀registers⠀separate:⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀was⠀sent,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀the⠀sender's⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact—revised,⠀abandoned,⠀kept⠀for⠀later—not⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind⠀streaming.⠀Required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀appears⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀set⠀off⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀sender⠀could⠀read.⠀Brief⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀messages⠀cannot⠀carry⠀it,⠀separated⠀plainly⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀check,⠀work⠀completed,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀read⠀and⠀not⠀yet⠀answered.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀manufactured⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀scenes⠀suited⠀to⠀illustration.⠀Open⠀each⠀one⠀briefly⠀and⠀legibly:⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is,⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀visible⠀details⠀that⠀matter,⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀present.⠀Give⠀dialogue⠀clear⠀attribution,⠀and⠀alternate⠀it⠀with⠀short⠀narrative⠀passages⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀a⠀held⠀image⠀can⠀carry—a⠀line⠀of⠀speech,⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀attention,⠀a⠀reaction,⠀the⠀next⠀exchange.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀direct⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀anything;⠀a⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀raise⠀a⠀question,⠀but⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀settles⠀anything.\n\nPut⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀intellect.⠀This⠀character⠀measures⠀an⠀official⠀instruction⠀against⠀the⠀scene's⠀material⠀conditions:⠀counts⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀demands⠀against⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀on⠀hand,⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀issuing⠀orders⠀has⠀never⠀had⠀to⠀carry⠀them⠀out,⠀holds⠀a⠀retort⠀privately⠀because⠀saying⠀it⠀would⠀cost⠀something⠀particular.⠀The⠀others⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀thinking⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀action.⠀Give⠀the⠀surrounding⠀cast⠀their⠀own⠀stakes—who⠀expects⠀obedience,⠀who⠀wants⠀convenience,⠀who⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀keep⠀an⠀account⠀straight—rather⠀than⠀making⠀them⠀mouths⠀for⠀satire.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀concrete⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀touched,⠀moved,⠀counted,⠀sealed,⠀or⠀withheld⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀period⠀decide⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀obtain.⠀Mark⠀scene⠀changes⠀with⠀a⠀heading⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀transition.⠀No⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀image⠀commands⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀prose.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀on⠀a⠀question⠀still⠀standing,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀visible⠀understanding,⠀without⠀a⠀decision⠀point⠀or⠀a⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nSustain⠀one⠀historical⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀a⠀particular⠀obligation,⠀institution,⠀construction,⠀or⠀practical⠀question.⠀Open⠀each⠀reply⠀by⠀recovering⠀only⠀the⠀prior⠀particular⠀the⠀new⠀events⠀depend⠀on—the⠀payment⠀still⠀missing,⠀the⠀order⠀still⠀delayed,⠀what⠀was⠀promised⠀outside⠀the⠀office,⠀who⠀said⠀the⠀door⠀would⠀be⠀unlocked—and⠀then⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀re-enter⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀keep⠀the⠀question⠀behind⠀that⠀through-line⠀open.⠀Development⠀is⠀earned⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀is⠀met⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀condition:⠀the⠀fee⠀is⠀different⠀this⠀quarter,⠀a⠀new⠀clerk⠀repeats⠀the⠀old⠀formula⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀name⠀signed⠀to⠀it,⠀a⠀household⠀finds⠀that⠀the⠀exception⠀does⠀not⠀reach⠀them,⠀a⠀second⠀visit⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀could⠀not.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work⠀finished,⠀or⠀resources⠀gained;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀case⠀in⠀any⠀given⠀installment.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀ordinary⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known;⠀use⠀a⠀hook⠀when⠀a⠀turn⠀genuinely⠀earns⠀one,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀default.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀period's⠀limits⠀real⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀delay⠀and⠀deny:⠀news⠀travels⠀at⠀the⠀speed⠀of⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀communication,⠀access⠀cannot⠀always⠀be⠀bought,⠀reports⠀arrive⠀incomplete.⠀Where⠀the⠀source⠀does⠀not⠀specify,⠀hold⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀detail.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression⠀mechanics⠀because⠀the⠀format⠀is⠀serial.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀ordinary⠀continuation,⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀practical⠀condition,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀question⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀refuses⠀to⠀drop.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀period⠀details⠀a⠀person⠀would⠀notice⠀under⠀stress.⠀Use⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀anchors—a⠀worn⠀edge,⠀a⠀particular⠀sound,⠀a⠀quality⠀of⠀light—and⠀let⠀each⠀carry⠀an⠀emotional⠀charge⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀fully⠀explain.⠀Compose⠀in⠀short⠀movements:⠀a⠀statement,⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀physical⠀adjustment,⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀avoids⠀or⠀answers⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀said.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀speaking⠀or⠀withholding⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀social⠀positions⠀and⠀the⠀expectations⠀of⠀their⠀setting.⠀A⠀confession⠀may⠀risk⠀reputation,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀future⠀practical⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀only⠀personal⠀embarrassment.⠀If⠀one⠀person⠀apologizes,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀them⠀to⠀do⠀so⠀within⠀those⠀constraints;⠀if⠀they⠀cannot,⠀render⠀the⠀blocked⠀impulse⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀omission.⠀Let⠀a⠀need⠀remain⠀partly⠀unspoken⠀but⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀arranges⠀an⠀object,⠀waits⠀before⠀speaking,⠀or⠀uses⠀a⠀formal⠀or⠀familiar⠀address.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀and⠀gesture⠀historically⠀plausible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀modern⠀therapeutic⠀language⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀self-disclosure.⠀Emotional⠀turbulence⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀period⠀allows⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀or⠀regrets.⠀Allow⠀warmth⠀to⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀difficult⠀exchange⠀affect⠀a⠀later⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀full⠀reconciliation.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀where⠀the⠀emotional⠀state⠀has⠀changed⠀but⠀the⠀underlying⠀issue⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nIn⠀each⠀response,⠀ground⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀period-aware⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀setting:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀lamp,⠀a⠀doorway's⠀shadow,⠀or⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀work⠀object.⠀Use⠀those⠀details⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀scene⠀a⠀specific⠀physical⠀and⠀emotional⠀temperature⠀without⠀slowing⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀Place⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph⠀as⠀the⠀speaker⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀adjoining⠀narrative⠀line,⠀and⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀clearly⠀attributable.\n\nLet⠀the⠀characters⠀move⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀practical⠀and⠀social⠀rules.⠀They⠀may⠀wait⠀to⠀be⠀addressed,⠀observe⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀of⠀service⠀or⠀leave-taking,⠀or⠀notice⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀reveals⠀another's⠀state⠀of⠀mind.⠀Avoid⠀modern⠀idiom⠀and⠀self-analysis;⠀instead⠀let⠀pauses⠀and⠀selected⠀gestures⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀withholding⠀something,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀of⠀hands,⠀a⠀glance,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀formality⠀of⠀address.\n\nBecause⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀continuing⠀roleplay,⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀complete⠀one⠀small⠀exchange⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀scene⠀open⠀for⠀another⠀player's⠀action.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀and⠀agency:⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices,⠀not⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀thinks.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀established⠀a⠀private⠀interval,⠀render⠀its⠀emotion⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀selective⠀detail⠀and⠀uncertain⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀readable⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀active.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀mode.⠀Divide⠀the⠀narrative⠀into⠀short⠀scenes⠀or⠀linked⠀episodes,⠀each⠀focusing⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀encounter⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀historical⠀order⠀exerts⠀pressure⠀on⠀individuals.⠀Open⠀each⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀sight,⠀noise,⠀or⠀physical⠀task⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀place:⠀an⠀account⠀book⠀checked⠀by⠀lamplight,⠀grain⠀weighed⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀yard,⠀a⠀letter⠀carried⠀across⠀a⠀wet⠀street,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀implement⠀repaired⠀at⠀the⠀threshold.⠀Let⠀that⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀carry⠀some⠀of⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀Kawabata's⠀method⠀would⠀normally⠀give⠀to⠀landscape.\n\nWithin⠀an⠀episode,⠀use⠀compressed⠀dialogue⠀and⠀minimal⠀narration.⠀Let⠀characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀concerns⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀ask,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀perform.⠀A⠀servant's⠀observation⠀about⠀a⠀worn⠀sleeve⠀may⠀indicate⠀worry⠀about⠀a⠀patron;⠀a⠀merchant's⠀careful⠀counting⠀may⠀show⠀fear⠀of⠀a⠀creditor.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀End⠀the⠀episode⠀at⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀social⠀relation⠀or⠀material⠀situation,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀a⠀brief⠀formal⠀linking⠀phrase,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀weather⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀object,⠀to⠀bridge⠀episodes⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀plain⠀and⠀vivid,⠀with⠀sentences⠀that⠀move⠀quickly⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀action⠀and⠀speech.⠀Let⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀pressure⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀period⠀role⠀requires⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀privately⠀notices⠀or⠀wants.⠀Avoid⠀transplanted⠀settings,⠀supernatural⠀elements,⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀self-reflection.⠀The⠀tradition's⠀episodic⠀structure⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀information⠀flow,⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀separate⠀lecture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard,⠀direct⠀sentences⠀with⠀concrete⠀period⠀detail.⠀Select⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀objects⠀or⠀surfaces⠀that⠀show⠀wear⠀and⠀use:⠀a⠀cracked⠀harness,⠀a⠀mended⠀shutter,⠀a⠀blade⠀sharpened⠀too⠀thin,⠀or⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool⠀near⠀a⠀brazier.⠀Let⠀those⠀details⠀establish⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀emotional⠀state⠀at⠀once.⠀Do⠀not⠀inventory⠀the⠀room;⠀choose⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀matter⠀to⠀someone⠀working⠀or⠀waiting⠀there.⠀Use⠀short⠀clauses⠀for⠀action⠀and⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀pressure⠀requires⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀transitions⠀abrupt⠀but⠀connected.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀physical⠀action⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀transitional⠀padding.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀hesitates,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀stop⠀in⠀movement⠀or⠀a⠀re-gripped⠀tool,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀self-analysis.⠀Let⠀speech⠀cut⠀and⠀be⠀answered⠀or⠀evaded⠀in⠀kind.⠀Period-specific⠀constraints—debt,⠀injury,⠀bad⠀weather,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀threat,⠀a⠀guild⠀rule—should⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀practical⠀facts⠀that⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀in⠀this⠀scene.⠀When⠀emotion⠀rises,⠀compress⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀sensory⠀detail⠀Kawabata's⠀method⠀favors:⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀not⠀their⠀whole⠀feeling⠀but⠀the⠀particular⠀quality⠀of⠀heat,⠀dust,⠀water,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀object.\n\nAvoid⠀melodramatic⠀vocabulary.⠀Use⠀plain⠀words⠀for⠀pain,⠀fear,⠀shame,⠀and⠀wanting.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀a⠀need,⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀delay⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀care⠀they⠀give⠀to⠀an⠀unlikely⠀object.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀produce⠀material⠀stakes⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀immediate⠀movement,⠀speech,⠀or⠀task⠀pauses,⠀not⠀where⠀all⠀problems⠀resolve.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀narrative⠀around⠀documents⠀that⠀a⠀person⠀of⠀the⠀specified⠀period⠀and⠀position⠀could⠀actually⠀produce:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀household⠀account,⠀a⠀court⠀record,⠀a⠀travel⠀journal,⠀a⠀memorial,⠀an⠀order,⠀or⠀a⠀copied⠀notice.⠀Begin⠀each⠀document⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀marker⠀of⠀time,⠀place,⠀or⠀occasion⠀without⠀a⠀meta-explanation.⠀Let⠀the⠀form⠀shape⠀what⠀appears:⠀an⠀account⠀records⠀amounts⠀and⠀shortages,⠀a⠀letter⠀opens⠀with⠀formulaic⠀greetings⠀and⠀then⠀turns⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀worry,⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀testimony⠀reports⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀to⠀an⠀official⠀rather⠀than⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀privately⠀thought.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀perception⠀inside⠀the⠀document's⠀limits.⠀Have⠀each⠀writer⠀notice⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀passing⠀details—the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀servant's⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀flight⠀of⠀birds⠀after⠀a⠀warning,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀ink⠀or⠀rain—and⠀let⠀those⠀details⠀carry⠀emotion⠀the⠀writer⠀does⠀not⠀fully⠀state.⠀The⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀and⠀the⠀changes⠀in⠀what⠀different⠀writers⠀notice⠀should⠀reveal⠀relationships⠀and⠀pressures⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary.⠀If⠀a⠀writer⠀omits⠀a⠀known⠀event,⠀show⠀the⠀pressure⠀that⠀produced⠀the⠀omission⠀through⠀the⠀document's⠀formality,⠀brevity,⠀or⠀awkward⠀shift.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀documents⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀private⠀thought;⠀they⠀are⠀deliberate⠀compositions.⠀A⠀diary⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀impression⠀but⠀need⠀not⠀put⠀the⠀whole⠀mind⠀on⠀the⠀page.⠀Preserve⠀historical⠀plausibility⠀in⠀language⠀and⠀social⠀position:⠀a⠀merchant's⠀letter⠀differs⠀from⠀a⠀magistrate's⠀report,⠀and⠀neither⠀should⠀use⠀modern⠀therapeutic⠀phrasing.⠀Let⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents⠀build⠀continuity⠀by⠀recurring⠀objects,⠀names,⠀or⠀phrases⠀whose⠀meaning⠀changes.⠀End⠀an⠀entry⠀where⠀that⠀writer⠀would⠀naturally⠀stop,⠀leaving⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀remains⠀unrecorded.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀of⠀practical⠀care⠀that⠀the⠀specified⠀period⠀and⠀place⠀would⠀support:⠀food⠀prepared⠀and⠀shared,⠀a⠀room⠀warmed⠀or⠀aired,⠀a⠀child⠀tucked⠀under⠀a⠀patched⠀blanket,⠀a⠀message⠀delivered⠀with⠀extra⠀care,⠀a⠀resting⠀animal⠀tended,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀of⠀tea⠀or⠀washing⠀before⠀a⠀longer⠀task.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀pleasure:⠀the⠀exact⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀bowl,⠀the⠀clean⠀smell⠀of⠀herbs,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀falls⠀across⠀a⠀swept⠀floor.⠀Keep⠀description⠀brief⠀and⠀specific,⠀in⠀the⠀manner⠀of⠀a⠀passing⠀impression.\n\nDo⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀period's⠀difficulties.⠀Debt,⠀weather,⠀illness,⠀difficult⠀relations,⠀and⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀work⠀may⠀press⠀at⠀the⠀edges⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀comfort⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀small,⠀reliable⠀action⠀one⠀person⠀does⠀for⠀another⠀or⠀for⠀themselves⠀within⠀those⠀constraints.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀but⠀unobtrusive:⠀a⠀preference⠀remembered,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀quiet⠀protected⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀Avoid⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair;⠀warmth⠀can⠀exist⠀while⠀a⠀problem⠀remains⠀unsolved⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀remain⠀private⠀or⠀prickly.\n\nUse⠀short⠀exchanges⠀and⠀simple⠀actions.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀little,⠀but⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀or⠀do⠀can⠀make⠀another⠀person's⠀day⠀easier.⠀Let⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀stay⠀intact—comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀End⠀after⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀has⠀settled⠀into⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀routine,⠀without⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀moving⠀through⠀small,⠀concrete⠀beats⠀rather⠀than⠀reflections⠀on⠀happiness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀sustained,⠀grammatically⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀beyond⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange.⠀Open⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀narrative⠀frame⠀that⠀situates⠀the⠀moment⠀in⠀its⠀period⠀context:⠀the⠀custom⠀that⠀brings⠀people⠀together,⠀the⠀season⠀and⠀its⠀agricultural⠀or⠀commercial⠀meaning,⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀that⠀shapes⠀private⠀feeling,⠀or⠀the⠀social⠀rank⠀that⠀governs⠀who⠀may⠀speak⠀first.⠀Keep⠀this⠀frame⠀concrete⠀and⠀local⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀broad⠀historical⠀lecture.⠀Let⠀it⠀introduce⠀the⠀pressure⠀that⠀will⠀shape⠀the⠀dialogue⠀or⠀action.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀paragraph,⠀retain⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀images⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀and⠀social⠀meaning—a⠀white⠀candle⠀burning⠀unevenly,⠀a⠀letter⠀held⠀unopened,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn⠀from⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀garden⠀stone⠀wet⠀after⠀rain—and⠀give⠀them⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀movement⠀without⠀piling⠀on⠀adjectives.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀slow⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unspoken⠀feeling,⠀then⠀recover⠀through⠀a⠀simple⠀observation⠀or⠀turn⠀of⠀phrase.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀may⠀generalize⠀about⠀custom⠀or⠀character⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀such⠀observation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀detail,⠀not⠀replace⠀it.\n\nLet⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀organize⠀longer⠀passages⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it:⠀a⠀formal⠀greeting⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀private⠀exchange;⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀in⠀company⠀and⠀then⠀thought⠀about⠀alone;⠀a⠀household⠀ritual⠀interrupted⠀by⠀news.⠀Keep⠀speech⠀grounded⠀in⠀period⠀idiom⠀and⠀social⠀register.⠀Use⠀transitions⠀that⠀follow⠀time⠀and⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀abrupt⠀cuts.⠀Emotional⠀restraint⠀should⠀come⠀through⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀the⠀selection⠀of⠀detail,⠀not⠀through⠀clinical⠀distance.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀structural⠀pause⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀has⠀shifted,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀private⠀matter⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀occasion⠀before⠀any⠀tale⠀begins:⠀someone⠀speaks⠀because⠀a⠀journey⠀has⠀ended,⠀a⠀debt⠀must⠀be⠀settled,⠀a⠀guest⠀must⠀be⠀kept⠀awake⠀through⠀the⠀night,⠀a⠀record⠀must⠀be⠀corrected,⠀or⠀a⠀younger⠀listener⠀has⠀to⠀understand⠀an⠀arrangement⠀before⠀it⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀aloud⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀these⠀particular⠀people,⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀left⠀for⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀recognize⠀later.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀frame⠀from⠀a⠀few⠀chosen⠀physical⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀described⠀setting.⠀A⠀cup⠀cooling,⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀lamplight⠀on⠀a⠀ledger,⠀rain⠀on⠀one⠀kind⠀of⠀roof,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool:⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀at⠀the⠀turns⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀shifts⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀the⠀outer⠀situation,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀come⠀back⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight,⠀unexplained.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀detached⠀entertainment.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀persuading⠀a⠀merchant⠀to⠀extend⠀credit,⠀warning⠀a⠀relative⠀about⠀a⠀marriage,⠀delaying⠀a⠀departure,⠀explaining⠀why⠀a⠀field⠀was⠀sold,⠀or⠀preparing⠀a⠀child⠀for⠀news⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀spoken.⠀Aim⠀the⠀tale⠀at⠀that⠀purpose;⠀its⠀effect⠀can⠀be⠀immediate,⠀delayed,⠀or⠀missed,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀intention⠀may⠀stay⠀partly⠀unspoken⠀even⠀from⠀the⠀reader.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀signature.⠀A⠀face,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀a⠀boat⠀disappeared⠀—⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀fix⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀and⠀stop.⠀An⠀absent⠀name,⠀a⠀skipped⠀season,⠀a⠀servant⠀mentioned⠀once⠀and⠀never⠀again⠀can⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀anything⠀told.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀omission⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀breath;⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀quiet⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀task.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀through⠀recurrence⠀rather⠀than⠀framing⠀formulas.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀can⠀reappear⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀once⠀more⠀after⠀the⠀telling⠀ends,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀connection⠀without⠀being⠀told⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀true.⠀The⠀teller's⠀memory⠀is⠀partial,⠀shaped⠀by⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀listener⠀act,⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀own⠀knowledge⠀can⠀differ⠀without⠀either⠀version⠀being⠀corrected⠀on⠀the⠀page.\n\nRender⠀what⠀happens⠀off⠀the⠀tongue⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀on⠀it:⠀a⠀hand⠀stilled⠀on⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀breath⠀taken⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀a⠀private⠀noticing⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀see.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀the⠀telling,⠀inside⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀it,⠀or⠀inside⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀has⠀only⠀begun.⠀The⠀past⠀can⠀remain⠀incomplete;⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀touches⠀is⠀the⠀present⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Take⠀the⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀as⠀a⠀craft⠀source⠀—⠀a⠀situated⠀teller,⠀an⠀audience⠀with⠀stakes,⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀—⠀and⠀bring⠀in⠀no⠀djinn,⠀palaces,⠀deserts,⠀or⠀particular⠀religion⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario⠀already⠀contains⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary-memory⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀between⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀remembers,⠀with⠀neither⠀version⠀treated⠀as⠀complete.⠀The⠀period's⠀actual⠀forms⠀of⠀record-keeping⠀enter⠀as⠀concrete⠀objects⠀—⠀a⠀registry⠀entry,⠀a⠀freight⠀manifest,⠀a⠀ration⠀list,⠀a⠀parish⠀note,⠀a⠀court⠀transcript,⠀a⠀letter⠀filed⠀in⠀an⠀office⠀—⠀and⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀neutral⠀background:⠀they⠀decide⠀who⠀can⠀prove⠀a⠀claim,⠀who⠀is⠀believed,⠀and⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀officially⠀forgotten.\n\nGive⠀the⠀remembered⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀gap⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀be⠀one⠀sensory⠀impression:⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀on⠀a⠀station⠀platform,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀soap⠀in⠀a⠀corridor,⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀shadow⠀across⠀a⠀desk.⠀Do⠀not⠀expand⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀full⠀explanatory⠀scene.⠀Set⠀the⠀single⠀impression⠀beside⠀the⠀documentary⠀language⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀scale⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nHold⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀steady⠀whatever⠀narrator⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀—⠀a⠀later⠀researcher,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀reading⠀old⠀papers,⠀a⠀former⠀official⠀reviewing⠀a⠀file,⠀a⠀witness⠀whose⠀account⠀was⠀never⠀entered⠀into⠀the⠀record.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀quote⠀documents⠀and⠀describe⠀reading⠀them,⠀but⠀reaches⠀no⠀mind⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀cannot⠀reach.⠀Keep⠀separate⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀was⠀told,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀infers⠀from⠀a⠀document's⠀phrasing⠀or⠀its⠀omissions.⠀The⠀present⠀moments⠀of⠀handling⠀the⠀papers⠀—⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀turning⠀a⠀page,⠀a⠀line⠀read⠀twice,⠀the⠀finger⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀name⠀—⠀are⠀live⠀experience⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀directly.\n\nLet⠀institutions⠀act⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀statements⠀about⠀bureaucracy.⠀A⠀clerk⠀refuses⠀to⠀correct⠀a⠀spelling;⠀a⠀supervisor⠀initials⠀a⠀form⠀without⠀reading⠀it;⠀a⠀widow⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀certificate⠀she⠀never⠀received.⠀These⠀meetings⠀show⠀the⠀system⠀touching⠀one⠀life⠀while⠀the⠀emotional⠀center⠀stays⠀on⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀noticed⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀keep.\n\nLeave⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀memory⠀open.⠀The⠀document⠀can⠀be⠀right⠀about⠀dates⠀and⠀wrong⠀about⠀motive;⠀the⠀memory⠀vivid⠀about⠀a⠀face⠀and⠀uncertain⠀about⠀the⠀year.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀The⠀close⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀survived⠀while⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀fades,⠀or⠀that⠀one⠀remembered⠀image⠀corrects⠀the⠀record⠀without⠀restoring⠀the⠀life⠀around⠀it⠀—⠀or⠀simply⠀the⠀next⠀page,⠀turned⠀or⠀unread.⠀The⠀route⠀concerns⠀how⠀documents⠀and⠀memory⠀interact;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀German⠀setting,⠀national⠀character,⠀or⠀translated⠀syntax,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀social⠀world⠀the⠀scenario⠀actually⠀supplies.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀inherited⠀power⠀as⠀a⠀pressure⠀inside⠀particular⠀historical⠀encounters.⠀An⠀old⠀family⠀may⠀still⠀control⠀a⠀building,⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀right⠀of⠀passage,⠀but⠀its⠀authority⠀now⠀has⠀to⠀pass⠀through⠀present⠀people⠀—⠀a⠀younger⠀heir,⠀a⠀tenant,⠀a⠀clerk,⠀a⠀servant,⠀a⠀creditor.⠀Stage⠀the⠀collision⠀as⠀what⠀someone⠀must⠀perform⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀room⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀there.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀compressed⠀sensory⠀attention⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀strain⠀between⠀the⠀social⠀mask⠀and⠀the⠀body⠀wearing⠀it.⠀Choose⠀one⠀detail⠀the⠀performance⠀cannot⠀fully⠀control:⠀a⠀hand⠀held⠀too⠀still⠀on⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀collar⠀damp⠀at⠀the⠀throat,⠀a⠀ring⠀turned⠀inward,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀smile.⠀Do⠀not⠀multiply⠀such⠀details.⠀Let⠀one⠀impression⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀come⠀from⠀material⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀adjectives.⠀The⠀period⠀supplies⠀the⠀facts:⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀cold⠀because⠀fuel⠀is⠀short,⠀a⠀stair⠀worn⠀in⠀the⠀center,⠀a⠀curtain⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀quite⠀cover⠀a⠀broken⠀pane,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀paper⠀and⠀damp⠀plaster.⠀These⠀make⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀feel⠀present⠀and⠀decaying⠀at⠀once,⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀costume⠀inventory.\n\nLet⠀intimacy⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated⠀rather⠀than⠀purely⠀sinister.⠀A⠀trusted⠀person⠀can⠀genuinely⠀comfort⠀another⠀while⠀also⠀protecting⠀an⠀inheritance;⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀can⠀lower⠀the⠀public⠀mask⠀and⠀reveal⠀fear,⠀tenderness,⠀or⠀exhaustion,⠀and⠀the⠀revelation⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀texture⠀is⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀separating⠀care⠀from⠀advantage,⠀not⠀a⠀trap⠀behind⠀every⠀kind⠀act.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀desire⠀present⠀but⠀restrained,⠀and⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀—⠀a⠀want⠀for⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀way⠀out,⠀or⠀simply⠀the⠀chance⠀to⠀sit⠀unwatched⠀—⠀moving⠀beneath⠀the⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀surface⠀stays⠀polite.⠀It⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀sentence;⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀theme.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀encounter's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-conversation,⠀mid-task,⠀inside⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀mask⠀settles⠀back⠀into⠀place.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀collapse,⠀or⠀a⠀reversal⠀before⠀stopping.⠀Take⠀from⠀the⠀style⠀only⠀its⠀portable⠀treatment:⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life,⠀urban⠀material⠀detail,⠀social⠀masks,⠀and⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀own⠀institutions⠀and⠀beliefs⠀supply⠀whatever⠀power⠀or⠀danger⠀the⠀scene⠀contains.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀the⠀period's⠀pressure⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀arrangements⠀of⠀a⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀neighborhood,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀detached⠀voice⠀explaining⠀the⠀era.⠀Let⠀the⠀scenario's⠀specific⠀region,⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀determine⠀the⠀actual⠀domestic⠀forms⠀—⠀who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀keeps⠀accounts,⠀who⠀decides⠀when⠀a⠀child⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀house,⠀who⠀is⠀expected⠀to⠀speak⠀first.\n\nApply⠀Kawabata-style⠀selectivity⠀to⠀the⠀intervals⠀inside⠀those⠀routines.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀turn⠀on⠀the⠀moment⠀between⠀a⠀pot⠀being⠀set⠀down⠀and⠀a⠀question⠀being⠀answered,⠀the⠀adjustment⠀of⠀a⠀shawl⠀before⠀a⠀visitor⠀enters,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀fan⠀or⠀a⠀sewing⠀machine⠀in⠀another⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀curtain⠀as⠀someone⠀passes⠀through.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀such⠀impressions⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀tension⠀without⠀commentary.\n\nLet⠀historical⠀change⠀arrive⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters.⠀A⠀new⠀tax⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀discussion⠀about⠀which⠀vessels⠀to⠀sell;⠀a⠀political⠀movement⠀as⠀a⠀younger⠀relative⠀returning⠀late⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀way⠀of⠀speaking;⠀a⠀migration⠀as⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀aloud⠀and⠀folded⠀back⠀into⠀a⠀trunk.⠀The⠀household⠀does⠀not⠀merely⠀react⠀to⠀history⠀—⠀its⠀members⠀make⠀practical⠀choices⠀inside⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀social⠀position⠀concrete:⠀who⠀may⠀sit,⠀who⠀serves,⠀who⠀can⠀refuse,⠀who⠀must⠀wait.⠀Follow⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀any⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀caste⠀experience,⠀religious⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀language⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario⠀includes⠀them;⠀when⠀it⠀supplies⠀a⠀community⠀or⠀region,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀for⠀rooms,⠀foods,⠀clothing,⠀and⠀relationships⠀where⠀the⠀narration⠀naturally⠀needs⠀them.\n\nGive⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀its⠀full⠀place.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀someone⠀did⠀not⠀say⠀a⠀name,⠀did⠀not⠀finish⠀a⠀sentence,⠀did⠀not⠀turn⠀around⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀noticing,⠀the⠀guess⠀at⠀its⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀say⠀nothing⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀inner⠀experience⠀while⠀the⠀surface⠀routine⠀continues.⠀Omission⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling;⠀the⠀surrounding⠀sensory⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀stillness⠀carry⠀it,⠀not⠀explanation.\n\nA⠀private⠀interval⠀needs⠀no⠀errand⠀to⠀justify⠀it:⠀waiting⠀for⠀water⠀to⠀boil,⠀mending,⠀sitting⠀in⠀the⠀hour⠀before⠀the⠀lamps⠀are⠀lit⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀story's⠀attention⠀on⠀its⠀own.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀inside⠀a⠀task,⠀inside⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀resolved,⠀or⠀inside⠀a⠀silence⠀between⠀two⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀code-switching⠀or⠀an⠀English-language⠀frame;⠀the⠀narration⠀follows⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀register⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀period,⠀and⠀any⠀term⠀from⠀the⠀setting⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀from⠀use⠀or⠀brief⠀context⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀glossary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Compose⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-marked⠀entries,⠀notes,⠀and⠀short⠀reflective⠀passages⠀kept⠀by⠀one⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀historical⠀situation.⠀The⠀form⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀container:⠀it⠀shapes⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀records,⠀what⠀seems⠀worth⠀the⠀paper,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀cannot⠀yet⠀see.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀entry⠀brief⠀and⠀selective.⠀One⠀entry⠀may⠀hold⠀only⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀rice,⠀the⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀road⠀after⠀rain,⠀a⠀visitor's⠀unexpected⠀silence,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀child's⠀sleeve⠀caught⠀on⠀a⠀nail.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀day,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀entries⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling:⠀a⠀repeated⠀image,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀stops⠀appearing,⠀a⠀task⠀described⠀with⠀increasing⠀brevity.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knew⠀when⠀writing⠀and⠀any⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀When⠀the⠀writer⠀rereads⠀an⠀old⠀entry⠀and⠀notices⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀understood⠀then,⠀render⠀that⠀recognition⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀in⠀the⠀miscellany⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀note⠀beneath⠀the⠀old⠀one⠀—⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀inserted⠀backward.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀can⠀stay⠀partly⠀open.\n\nLet⠀historical⠀conditions⠀appear⠀through⠀practical⠀attention.⠀A⠀shortage⠀is⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀what⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀bought;⠀a⠀political⠀change⠀is⠀a⠀canceled⠀visit⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀was⠀afraid⠀to⠀repeat;⠀a⠀seasonal⠀observance⠀is⠀its⠀preparations⠀and⠀its⠀particular⠀objects.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀diary⠀into⠀a⠀historical⠀summary.⠀The⠀writer⠀records⠀what⠀touches⠀the⠀day,⠀and⠀what⠀touches⠀the⠀day⠀is⠀often⠀small.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀keeper's⠀position⠀and⠀access⠀consistent.⠀The⠀entries⠀notice⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀writer⠀witnessed,⠀heard,⠀or⠀inferred;⠀a⠀servant's⠀pages⠀see⠀different⠀rooms⠀and⠀silences⠀than⠀a⠀merchant's⠀ledger-notes⠀or⠀a⠀teacher's⠀reflections.⠀Let⠀the⠀form⠀reflect⠀the⠀actual⠀literacy,⠀time,⠀and⠀materials⠀available⠀to⠀that⠀person:⠀a⠀cheap⠀notebook,⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀an⠀account⠀page,⠀or⠀a⠀formal⠀diary⠀received⠀as⠀a⠀gift⠀will⠀each⠀change⠀what⠀gets⠀recorded⠀and⠀how⠀carefully.\n\nAn⠀entry⠀can⠀break⠀off⠀mid-sentence⠀when⠀the⠀day⠀interrupts,⠀and⠀a⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀note⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rounded⠀conclusion.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀Japanese⠀setting,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀or⠀universal⠀quietness⠀—⠀the⠀route⠀is⠀the⠀method⠀of⠀selective,⠀dated⠀attention⠀to⠀passing⠀life,⠀and⠀it⠀works⠀in⠀whatever⠀location,⠀period,⠀and⠀language⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route:⠀one⠀witness⠀tells⠀or⠀writes⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀of⠀a⠀historical⠀event,⠀addressed⠀to⠀a⠀listener,⠀reader,⠀or⠀later⠀generation.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀retrospective⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀witness's⠀present⠀situation,⠀so⠀keep⠀distinct⠀throughout⠀what⠀the⠀witness⠀saw,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀understood⠀only⠀later.\n\nGive⠀the⠀remembered⠀scenes⠀selective⠀sensory⠀memory.⠀The⠀witness⠀recalls⠀one⠀detail⠀with⠀unusual⠀clarity⠀—⠀dust⠀on⠀a⠀windowsill,⠀burnt⠀sugar,⠀a⠀truck⠀changing⠀gears,⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀a⠀man⠀folded⠀a⠀paper⠀before⠀putting⠀it⠀away⠀—⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀whole⠀event⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀vivid⠀fragments⠀stand⠀beside⠀the⠀witness's⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀dates,⠀names,⠀or⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀matter⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀be⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀younger⠀relative,⠀answering⠀a⠀researcher,⠀recording⠀a⠀statement,⠀or⠀setting⠀down⠀what⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀will⠀remember.⠀The⠀listener's⠀questions,⠀impatience,⠀or⠀fatigue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀and⠀redirect⠀the⠀account;⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀make⠀someone⠀else⠀understand,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀succeed⠀partly,⠀fail,⠀or⠀simply⠀stop.⠀While⠀telling,⠀the⠀witness⠀has⠀a⠀live⠀present⠀—⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀skip⠀a⠀whole⠀year,⠀the⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀—⠀and⠀that⠀experience⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀directly,⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀words⠀delivered.\n\nMark⠀received⠀material⠀as⠀received.⠀When⠀the⠀witness⠀describes⠀an⠀event⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀see,⠀let⠀the⠀attribution⠀show:⠀\"they⠀said,\"⠀\"the⠀letter⠀claimed,\"⠀\"I⠀heard⠀later.\"⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀rumor⠀as⠀fact⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀repeat⠀something⠀at⠀all;⠀never⠀silently⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀scenes⠀the⠀witness⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀witnessed.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀history⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀—⠀its⠀actual⠀community,⠀language,⠀work,⠀and⠀political⠀situation⠀—⠀shown⠀through⠀who⠀could⠀leave,⠀who⠀had⠀to⠀stay,⠀who⠀was⠀believed,⠀who⠀was⠀searched.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀landscape⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀political⠀narrative.⠀Add⠀no⠀supernatural⠀or⠀marvelous⠀facts⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario's⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀them;⠀if⠀the⠀witness⠀believes⠀something⠀uncanny,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀belief⠀or⠀perception,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀established⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀world.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀mid-answer,⠀mid-silence,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀search⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀word;⠀the⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀complete⠀to⠀pause⠀here.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀each⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀historical⠀situation:⠀someone⠀is⠀already⠀waiting,⠀carrying,⠀counting,⠀refusing,⠀or⠀about⠀to⠀speak.⠀Give⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀location⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀clear⠀details⠀—⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀wet⠀street,⠀a⠀back⠀stair,⠀the⠀table's⠀single⠀candle⠀—⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀encounter.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀period⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀general⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀era.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀room,⠀counter⠀to⠀back⠀stair,⠀or⠀one⠀side⠀of⠀a⠀table⠀to⠀the⠀other,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀sensory⠀shift,⠀and⠀break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀movement,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀where⠀attention⠀rests.⠀In⠀quick⠀exchanges,⠀stage⠀or⠀tag⠀lines⠀often⠀enough⠀that⠀attribution⠀never⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀guessed.\n\nUse⠀selective⠀impressions⠀as⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀After⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀event,⠀give⠀one⠀focused⠀private⠀response:⠀a⠀coin⠀still⠀warm⠀in⠀the⠀hand,⠀a⠀sleeve⠀catching⠀on⠀a⠀splinter,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀dust.⠀Keep⠀each⠀beat⠀brief⠀and⠀specific;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀name⠀the⠀emotion.⠀The⠀chosen⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀character's⠀state,⠀and⠀that⠀state⠀is⠀real⠀inner⠀experience⠀—⠀attention,⠀reluctance,⠀calculation,⠀a⠀held⠀breath⠀—⠀not⠀only⠀an⠀observable⠀gesture.\n\nLet⠀historical⠀conditions⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bundle,⠀a⠀missing⠀button⠀on⠀a⠀uniform,⠀a⠀price⠀chalked⠀on⠀a⠀board,⠀a⠀clerk⠀checking⠀a⠀paper⠀twice.⠀These⠀show⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀pressures⠀without⠀stopping⠀for⠀explanation.⠀When⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀object,⠀office,⠀or⠀custom⠀matters⠀to⠀what⠀follows,⠀make⠀it⠀clear⠀through⠀use⠀or⠀one⠀concrete⠀contextual⠀line⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀glossary⠀note.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀owner.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀first-person⠀narration;⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀tone⠀follow⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective.⠀A⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀withheld⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀adjustment,⠀not⠀a⠀dramatic⠀announcement.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀and⠀emotional⠀state⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀re-enter⠀easily⠀at⠀the⠀next⠀beat.⠀A⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀one⠀available⠀ending,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀historical⠀situation⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀period⠀reach⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀sensory⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanation⠀of⠀institutions⠀or⠀customs.⠀Choose⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀would⠀notice⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀moment:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀door,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀fuel⠀this⠀household⠀uses,⠀the⠀sound⠀a⠀tool⠀makes⠀on⠀this⠀surface,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀garment⠀holds⠀heat⠀or⠀gives⠀it⠀up.⠀You⠀may⠀let⠀one⠀historical⠀object⠀return⠀in⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀related⠀images⠀across⠀the⠀passage,⠀each⠀recurrence⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀light,⠀the⠀task,⠀or⠀the⠀observer's⠀attention,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀passing⠀of⠀the⠀interval⠀is⠀felt⠀without⠀being⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀meant;⠀its⠀placement⠀and⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀no⠀character⠀says⠀aloud.\n\nShape⠀each⠀paragraph⠀around⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀that⠀also⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀open⠀from⠀an⠀immediate⠀perception⠀—⠀steam,⠀a⠀folded⠀cloth,⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀shutter⠀—⠀and⠀arrive⠀at⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀had⠀not⠀yet⠀put⠀into⠀words,⠀keeping⠀the⠀comparison⠀traceable⠀to⠀this⠀scene⠀or⠀this⠀teller's⠀associations⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀figure⠀about⠀the⠀era.⠀Interrupt⠀the⠀rhythmic⠀movement⠀with⠀plain⠀statements⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀registers⠀a⠀practical⠀fact,⠀a⠀spoken⠀phrase,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation⠀the⠀image⠀cannot⠀absorb;⠀the⠀interruption⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method,⠀and⠀it⠀keeps⠀the⠀lyric⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀every⠀mouth.⠀Dialogue⠀stays⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀register,⠀unarchaic⠀unless⠀the⠀period⠀voice⠀genuinely⠀runs⠀that⠀way.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀slow⠀or⠀quicken⠀with⠀attention.⠀A⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀follow⠀light⠀across⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀through⠀a⠀familiar⠀task;⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀can⠀record⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀task⠀finishes⠀or⠀the⠀perception⠀breaks.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀may⠀link⠀separate⠀perceptions⠀without⠀announcing⠀their⠀meaning.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀the⠀scene's⠀real⠀duration,⠀and⠀what⠀this⠀social⠀position⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀obtain.⠀End⠀while⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀is⠀still⠀incomplete⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀stands,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀moment⠀available⠀instead⠀of⠀closing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀finished⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀historical⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀touch,⠀hear,⠀or⠀perform,⠀one⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀life:⠀a⠀mended⠀garment,⠀a⠀route⠀now⠀closed,⠀a⠀tool⠀no⠀longer⠀used,⠀a⠀room⠀changed⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀occupant⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀regulation.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀perception⠀open⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀without⠀explaining⠀its⠀significance.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀image,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀once⠀said,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀performed⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀the⠀link⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀can⠀stay⠀implicit⠀wherever⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀not⠀articulate⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀itself⠀alive.⠀The⠀room⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀warm,⠀the⠀food⠀still⠀good,⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀done⠀competently;⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasurable⠀inside⠀the⠀reflection.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change,⠀make⠀it⠀particular⠀—⠀a⠀different⠀hand⠀has⠀worn⠀the⠀handle⠀smooth,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀spoken,⠀a⠀window⠀now⠀opens⠀onto⠀a⠀wall⠀—⠀and⠀resist⠀generalizing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀statement⠀about⠀all⠀time⠀or⠀all⠀people.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀remembers,⠀expects,⠀and⠀can⠀do⠀stays⠀bounded⠀by⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting:⠀who⠀could⠀send⠀word,⠀who⠀could⠀travel,⠀what⠀could⠀be⠀owned,⠀said,⠀or⠀asked.\n\nHold⠀the⠀feeling⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀compression⠀so⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀continuous⠀sadness.⠀One⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀is⠀usually⠀enough;⠀admit⠀a⠀second⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two,⠀or⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀continues⠀a⠀practical⠀task;⠀either⠀way⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀remains⠀actual⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized⠀away.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀hand⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀present⠀but⠀unresolved⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀stands⠀—⠀no⠀closing⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀reflective⠀telling:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀—⠀present⠀at⠀the⠀event,⠀told⠀it⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀was,⠀or⠀having⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences⠀—⠀relates⠀what⠀remains.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀line⠀or⠀two:⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener,⠀recalling⠀an⠀occasion,⠀or⠀setting⠀down⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀of⠀it.⠀Hold⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀allow;⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀reported⠀limits⠀the⠀account,⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀other⠀minds,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀stays⠀light⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀of⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀nested⠀anthology.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀frame,⠀select⠀a⠀few⠀physical⠀impressions⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀full⠀scene⠀inventory:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀cup⠀was⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀garment⠀after⠀long⠀use.⠀Let⠀these⠀carry⠀the⠀event's⠀feeling⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀leaves⠀the⠀connections⠀unexplained,⠀a⠀detail⠀held⠀rather⠀than⠀interpreted.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀reflects,⠀keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀brief⠀and⠀particular⠀—⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀returned⠀later,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there⠀afterward⠀—⠀and⠀take⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀from⠀the⠀scenario⠀as⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀bring⠀in⠀religious,⠀honor,⠀or⠀exile⠀motifs⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them;⠀this⠀is⠀reflective⠀framed⠀prose,⠀not⠀an⠀anthology⠀of⠀tales,⠀a⠀satire,⠀or⠀a⠀mystical⠀allegory,⠀and⠀the⠀region's⠀distinct⠀traditions⠀stay⠀distinct.\n\nThe⠀teller⠀may⠀address⠀the⠀listener⠀once⠀or⠀twice,⠀but⠀the⠀address⠀stays⠀functional⠀rather⠀than⠀ceremonial.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀holding⠀one⠀impression⠀in⠀mind⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀unfinished,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀moral;⠀uncertainty⠀the⠀scenario⠀leaves⠀open⠀remains⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀setting⠀from⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀period⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀placement⠀do⠀the⠀explaining.⠀One⠀detail⠀can⠀fix⠀the⠀hour,⠀another⠀the⠀material⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀another⠀the⠀social⠀relation⠀between⠀two⠀people:⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open⠀because⠀the⠀latch⠀is⠀broken,⠀a⠀bowl⠀passed⠀first⠀to⠀the⠀elder,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀quietly⠀because⠀the⠀noise⠀would⠀carry.⠀Trust⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀infer⠀the⠀constraint.⠀If⠀a⠀detail⠀does⠀not⠀materially⠀contribute⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account,⠀cut⠀it.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀is⠀welcome⠀when⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀movement⠀of⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀perception⠀—⠀a⠀hand⠀working⠀through⠀a⠀familiar⠀sequence,⠀a⠀wait⠀measured⠀by⠀what⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀—⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀it⠀with⠀adjectives⠀or⠀repeated⠀reassurance.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀is⠀missing,⠀that⠀a⠀hand⠀hesitates,⠀that⠀a⠀sound⠀has⠀stopped,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀about⠀it.⠀When⠀an⠀inward⠀connection⠀is⠀essential⠀to⠀the⠀account,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀clauses⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀scene;⠀compression⠀spends⠀inner⠀experience⠀sparingly,⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀what⠀the⠀contract⠀authorizes.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀omission⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀deleting⠀causality.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀why⠀a⠀person⠀acts,⠀waits,⠀or⠀turns⠀away⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀reason⠀is⠀never⠀stated.⠀Voices⠀stay⠀individual,⠀historical⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀archaic⠀English,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀real⠀duration⠀hold.⠀Stop⠀at⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀one;⠀no⠀summarizing⠀sentence⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter,⠀task,⠀or⠀interval,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀period⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do,⠀handle,⠀avoid,⠀and⠀expect:⠀a⠀regulation⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀shortage⠀as⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀using⠀the⠀last⠀of⠀something,⠀a⠀social⠀position⠀as⠀who⠀speaks⠀first⠀and⠀who⠀waits.⠀Never⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀era;⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀perception⠀carry⠀the⠀constraints,⠀and⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀leaves⠀conditions⠀uncertain,⠀leave⠀them⠀uncertain⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀default⠀past.\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes.⠀Give⠀perception⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀selectivity⠀—⠀one⠀detail⠀noticed,⠀one⠀sound⠀isolated,⠀one⠀interval⠀of⠀waiting⠀—⠀inside⠀otherwise⠀continuous⠀narration.⠀Thought⠀may⠀accompany⠀action⠀without⠀displacing⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀weighs⠀what⠀a⠀phrase⠀implied,⠀what⠀a⠀delay⠀cost,⠀what⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀has⠀come⠀to⠀mean,⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀keeps⠀moving.⠀Keep⠀that⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective;⠀do⠀not⠀open⠀other⠀minds⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery:⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀speaker,⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀interval⠀passing.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀sets⠀the⠀register⠀together⠀with⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀demand⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀lesson.⠀End⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls;⠀a⠀conversation,⠀task,⠀or⠀thought⠀still⠀in⠀progress⠀can⠀simply⠀be⠀where⠀the⠀reply⠀stops,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀moment⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection⠀and⠀particular⠀period⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀history⠀lessons.⠀Choose⠀a⠀moment⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀bond⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀or⠀do⠀not⠀say:⠀one⠀waits⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀the⠀other⠀knows⠀to⠀look,⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀is⠀handled⠀with⠀familiar⠀care,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀is⠀used⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀its⠀history.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀constrain⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀waiting⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀a⠀work⠀schedule⠀or⠀by⠀when⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀be⠀seen⠀together,⠀the⠀shared⠀object⠀is⠀scarce⠀or⠀forbidden,⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀risky⠀in⠀company⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀those⠀constraints⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀actually⠀permits.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀with⠀restraint.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀once⠀or⠀twice⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application;⠀a⠀gesture⠀may⠀recur⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀difference⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices.⠀Render⠀affection⠀as⠀practical⠀help,⠀jealousy⠀as⠀a⠀silence⠀about⠀a⠀third⠀person,⠀comfort⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀done⠀unasked,⠀rivalry⠀or⠀discovery⠀in⠀the⠀forms⠀this⠀actual⠀bond⠀takes⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Give⠀the⠀feeling⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs:⠀let⠀a⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀discovery⠀occupy⠀its⠀full⠀beat⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀it,⠀then⠀let⠀Kawabata's⠀compression⠀take⠀over⠀again,⠀one⠀selected⠀detail⠀carrying⠀what⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀explanation⠀would⠀flatten.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀sets⠀the⠀real⠀terms⠀of⠀meeting,⠀speaking,⠀touching,⠀and⠀being⠀seen⠀together,⠀and⠀you⠀keep⠀access⠀to⠀only⠀the⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀authorizes.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀question⠀or⠀moment⠀still⠀open⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀stands⠀—⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀no⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀required⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀pay⠀off⠀what⠀this⠀one⠀sets⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀phrase⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀teller's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀event:⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀afterward,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀or⠀community⠀came⠀to⠀remember.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀someone⠀who⠀received⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀access⠀stays⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀—⠀no⠀universal⠀chronicler⠀who⠀knows⠀every⠀mind,⠀and⠀no⠀knowledge⠀beyond⠀what⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀handed⠀down.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀a⠀few⠀selective⠀impressions,⠀the⠀ones⠀that⠀survived⠀in⠀memory:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀load,⠀the⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀road⠀after⠀rain,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀name⠀was⠀spoken⠀once⠀and⠀not⠀again.⠀Let⠀those⠀impressions⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀leaves⠀the⠀connections⠀unexplained.⠀Recurring⠀phrasing⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀and⠀a⠀designation⠀earned⠀by⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀outlives⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀—⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀—⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀telling⠀into⠀parody.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀setting.⠀Oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀speech⠀into⠀speakers⠀who⠀would⠀not⠀use⠀it.⠀Report⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀plainly⠀where⠀plain⠀speech⠀is⠀what⠀was⠀said.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀still⠀being⠀weighed⠀—⠀the⠀teller⠀holding⠀one⠀impression,⠀the⠀community's⠀verdict⠀not⠀yet⠀fixed⠀—⠀and⠀no⠀legend⠀declared⠀on⠀anyone's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realist⠀register⠀of⠀the⠀tradition,⠀with⠀the⠀inward,⠀lyric⠀attention⠀of⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀profile⠀moving⠀inside⠀it.⠀Treat⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀as⠀a⠀working⠀social⠀order⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery:⠀let⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀trade,⠀a⠀household⠀economy,⠀or⠀an⠀established⠀belief⠀reach⠀the⠀characters⠀through⠀one⠀particular⠀encounter⠀at⠀a⠀time⠀—⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀needs⠀permission,⠀a⠀payment⠀discussed⠀at⠀a⠀slant,⠀a⠀visit⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀etiquette,⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀season⠀makes⠀urgent.⠀The⠀people⠀know⠀what⠀their⠀station,⠀work,⠀and⠀locality⠀allow⠀them⠀to⠀know;⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀obtain⠀or⠀expect⠀stands⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀limit,⠀never⠀as⠀narrated⠀history.⠀Keep⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀circumstances⠀distinct⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀specifies⠀them,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀northern⠀temperament.\n\nCarry⠀feeling⠀through⠀selection.⠀Fix⠀on⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀physical⠀impressions⠀per⠀scene⠀—⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀utensil,⠀a⠀wet⠀doorstep,⠀lamplight⠀on⠀a⠀fold⠀of⠀cloth,⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀stops⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀return⠀lightly⠀at⠀intervals⠀instead⠀of⠀cataloguing⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀those⠀chosen⠀details⠀can⠀hold⠀what⠀is⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀a⠀trade⠀closing,⠀a⠀person⠀leaving,⠀a⠀season⠀of⠀the⠀household⠀ending.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀emotion⠀the⠀arrangement⠀carries⠀or⠀explain⠀each⠀connection.⠀Compression⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀bleakness⠀or⠀reserve;⠀a⠀brief⠀practical⠀exchange⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀selective⠀as⠀a⠀grief,⠀and⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀austerity⠀appear⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀place⠀and⠀season⠀actually⠀include⠀them,⠀as⠀lived⠀conditions⠀with⠀consequences⠀for⠀work.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀do⠀social⠀work.⠀A⠀subject⠀avoided⠀because⠀of⠀rank,⠀thrift,⠀shame,⠀or⠀care⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀realism,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀one⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀private⠀experience,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀—⠀attention⠀snagging⠀on⠀a⠀detail,⠀a⠀memory⠀surfacing⠀mid-task,⠀words⠀not⠀said⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀others⠀present⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀reader⠀holds⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nBring⠀the⠀period⠀on⠀screen⠀only⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀sequence⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear.⠀Write⠀action⠀in⠀concise⠀readable⠀blocks:⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀does⠀with⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀coin,⠀a⠀written⠀message,⠀a⠀door.⠀Head⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀genuinely⠀changes,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀era's⠀material⠀limits⠀decide⠀the⠀business⠀—⠀how⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀counted⠀out,⠀how⠀far⠀a⠀message⠀can⠀travel⠀and⠀how⠀quickly,⠀which⠀room⠀a⠀person⠀of⠀that⠀station⠀may⠀enter⠀and⠀where⠀they⠀must⠀wait⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀lives⠀in⠀physical⠀action,⠀never⠀in⠀explanatory⠀dialogue.\n\nGive⠀the⠀sequence⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀returning⠀impressions⠀in⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀manner:⠀a⠀kettle⠀on⠀the⠀fire,⠀a⠀latch,⠀a⠀bell,⠀one⠀particular⠀footstep,⠀the⠀same⠀sleeve⠀caught⠀in⠀different⠀light.⠀Cut⠀so⠀that⠀elapsed⠀time⠀is⠀simply⠀absent⠀between⠀scenes,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀recurring⠀object⠀measure⠀what⠀is⠀passing⠀—⠀on⠀its⠀next⠀appearance⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀worn,⠀moved,⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀in⠀another⠀hand,⠀with⠀no⠀line⠀naming⠀the⠀change.⠀Use⠀a⠀cut,⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀specific⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀shift⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀perceive,⠀and⠀keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀lines.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀fitted⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.⠀People⠀may⠀speak⠀around⠀a⠀subject⠀because⠀of⠀position,⠀habit,⠀or⠀care;⠀that⠀evasion⠀is⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀no⠀speech⠀explains⠀the⠀period⠀or⠀announces⠀feeling.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀experience,⠀set⠀it⠀down⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀presentation⠀—⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀momentary⠀attention⠀or⠀withheld⠀thought⠀—⠀which⠀is⠀neither⠀dialogue⠀nor⠀knowledge⠀any⠀other⠀character⠀holds.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀one.⠀No⠀reversal⠀or⠀discovery⠀is⠀owed⠀each⠀time⠀out,⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀stays⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied,⠀without⠀imported⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀or⠀isolation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nBuild⠀the⠀period⠀into⠀what⠀an⠀actor⠀can⠀perform.⠀Establish⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀the⠀basin,⠀the⠀coat,⠀the⠀letter,⠀the⠀coin,⠀the⠀tool;⠀who⠀waits⠀at⠀the⠀threshold;⠀who⠀exits⠀and⠀who⠀remains.⠀Entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀—⠀the⠀route⠀a⠀servant⠀takes⠀around⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀visitor⠀kept⠀standing⠀—⠀so⠀institutions⠀and⠀station⠀appear⠀as⠀physical⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀speech.⠀Keep⠀the⠀directions⠀economical⠀and⠀stageable,⠀with⠀no⠀film-camera⠀language.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀objects⠀or⠀movements⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀lightly,⠀in⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀manner:⠀the⠀same⠀bowl⠀filled⠀and⠀emptied,⠀a⠀coat⠀taken⠀up⠀and⠀put⠀down⠀again,⠀a⠀repeated⠀crossing⠀to⠀the⠀window.⠀Let⠀the⠀repetition⠀register⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep⠀—⠀an⠀absence⠀quietly⠀rearranging⠀the⠀room's⠀habits⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀hold⠀that⠀weight,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀pause⠀should⠀be⠀portentous,⠀and⠀business⠀continues⠀through⠀the⠀silence.⠀People⠀may⠀speak⠀around⠀a⠀subject⠀because⠀of⠀habit,⠀position,⠀or⠀whoever⠀else⠀is⠀on⠀stage;⠀the⠀avoidance⠀is⠀audible⠀as⠀avoidance,⠀not⠀narrated.\n\nGive⠀any⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside,⠀if⠀one⠀occurs,⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀a⠀defined⠀audience:⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀—⠀actual⠀inner⠀attention⠀or⠀withheld⠀response⠀—⠀which⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀hears⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀it.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀anyone⠀feels.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀one,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀stays⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied;⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀and⠀isolation⠀enter⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀given⠀world⠀has⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀run⠀as⠀the⠀live⠀associative⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braided⠀together.⠀A⠀present⠀sound,⠀surface,⠀smell,⠀or⠀task⠀pulls⠀forward⠀what⠀it⠀touches⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀person⠀—⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀rule⠀learned⠀young,⠀someone⠀gone⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraphing⠀may⠀follow⠀that⠀pull,⠀lengthening⠀or⠀breaking⠀where⠀attention⠀does.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation,⠀through⠀tense,⠀naming,⠀or⠀placement,⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀imagined⠀continuation.\n\nApply⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀selectivity⠀inside⠀the⠀flow.⠀Do⠀not⠀record⠀everything⠀the⠀mind⠀touches;⠀choose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀impressions⠀—⠀a⠀particular⠀cloth,⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀at⠀intervals⠀rather⠀than⠀drifting⠀across⠀a⠀full⠀inventory.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀those⠀returns⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling;⠀the⠀links⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained.⠀Ordinary⠀practical⠀reasoning,⠀a⠀flash⠀of⠀irritation,⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure⠀can⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀stream⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀mode.\n\nHold⠀the⠀period⠀at⠀the⠀level⠀of⠀what⠀this⠀mind⠀can⠀know.⠀It⠀recalls⠀prices,⠀routes,⠀prayers,⠀letters,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀tools⠀it⠀has⠀actually⠀met;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀another⠀person's⠀thoughts⠀or⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀distant⠀event,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀to⠀explain⠀its⠀era.⠀Where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀let⠀the⠀person's⠀uncertainty⠀stand⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀past.⠀The⠀mode⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀or⠀hand⠀this⠀mind⠀anyone⠀else's⠀interior.\n\nThe⠀stream⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀—⠀live,⠀nonspoken,⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀feeling⠀or⠀an⠀address⠀to⠀an⠀audience.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀moving,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀completes⠀or⠀fails⠀to;⠀no⠀resolution⠀or⠀discovery⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀carried⠀by⠀whatever⠀medium⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀actually⠀offers⠀—⠀a⠀telegraph⠀form,⠀a⠀pager,⠀an⠀SMS,⠀a⠀shared⠀machine's⠀chat⠀window⠀—⠀and⠀treat⠀that⠀medium⠀as⠀the⠀historical⠀fact.⠀Its⠀real⠀limits⠀do⠀the⠀period⠀work:⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀costs,⠀how⠀long⠀it⠀can⠀be,⠀when⠀it⠀can⠀arrive,⠀who⠀else⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀device⠀or⠀the⠀line.⠀Each⠀person⠀writes⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀habits⠀with⠀that⠀medium⠀—⠀short⠀practical⠀lines,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀unsent⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀gap⠀may⠀mean⠀work,⠀hesitation,⠀distance,⠀or⠀nothing⠀in⠀particular;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀receipt,⠀timestamp,⠀or⠀interface⠀event⠀to⠀supply⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀the⠀messages⠀carry⠀feeling⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀way:⠀one⠀exact⠀object,⠀sound,⠀or⠀moment⠀named⠀instead⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀described⠀—⠀the⠀coat⠀back⠀from⠀repair,⠀the⠀sound⠀the⠀shop⠀makes⠀at⠀closing,⠀the⠀same⠀word⠀used⠀twice,⠀a⠀week⠀apart.⠀A⠀returning⠀phrase⠀can⠀hold⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep,⠀gaining⠀weight⠀as⠀the⠀exchange⠀ages.⠀Omission⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record:⠀a⠀sender⠀avoids⠀a⠀subject⠀because⠀of⠀position,⠀habit,⠀care,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀medium⠀will⠀not⠀safely⠀carry,⠀and⠀the⠀avoidance⠀shows⠀only⠀as⠀what⠀never⠀arrives.⠀Not⠀every⠀gap⠀is⠀meaningful⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀message⠀is⠀confessional.\n\nBound⠀each⠀sender⠀by⠀their⠀actual⠀knowledge.⠀Messages⠀refer⠀to⠀work,⠀prices,⠀journeys,⠀rules,⠀household⠀tasks;⠀a⠀sender⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀another's⠀thoughts⠀or⠀the⠀outcome⠀of⠀a⠀distant⠀event,⠀and⠀unspecified⠀things⠀stay⠀uncertain⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀general⠀history⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀layers⠀distinct.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀that⠀exists⠀addressed⠀to⠀no⠀one⠀yet;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Render⠀required⠀private⠀experience,⠀when⠀authorized,⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀which⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀reads.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀needed,⠀set⠀off⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment,⠀with⠀no⠀forced⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀period⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀legible⠀illustrated⠀scenes.⠀Open⠀each⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀that⠀fixes⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀place⠀lets⠀them⠀reach,⠀see,⠀or⠀use,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀era⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀encounter⠀underway⠀—⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanation.⠀A⠀character's⠀station⠀decides⠀what⠀they⠀may⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀attempt,⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀objects⠀and⠀routes⠀show⠀it.\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀a⠀short⠀narrative⠀passage,⠀then⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀then⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Inside⠀that⠀rhythm⠀apply⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀selectivity⠀—⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀impressions⠀per⠀scene,⠀returned⠀to⠀lightly:⠀a⠀particular⠀cloth,⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀bowl,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀these⠀details⠀carries⠀feeling⠀without⠀stating⠀it.⠀Treat⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀as⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference⠀to⠀the⠀illustrated⠀moment,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀label⠀owed⠀every⠀line;⠀an⠀expression⠀may⠀draw⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀guess⠀at⠀its⠀meaning,⠀which⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀can⠀support,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀leave⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀never⠀a⠀fixed⠀readout⠀of⠀what⠀someone⠀feels.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀focal⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀—⠀attention,⠀withheld⠀reaction,⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀prior⠀scene⠀—⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀on⠀its⠀own.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀one.⠀A⠀visual⠀detail⠀established⠀early⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact,⠀deepening⠀the⠀reading⠀rather⠀than⠀restarting⠀it.⠀No⠀discovery,⠀confession,⠀or⠀relationship⠀turn⠀is⠀owed⠀per⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀remains⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaibabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀the⠀period⠀as⠀an⠀installment⠀story⠀with⠀an⠀easy⠀way⠀back⠀in.⠀At⠀the⠀top⠀of⠀each⠀reply,⠀re-anchor⠀briefly⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀installment,⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two⠀of⠀recovery⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀retelling⠀of⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Let⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀act⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀encounter⠀this⠀installment⠀actually⠀covers;⠀each⠀character's⠀station⠀still⠀decides⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.\n\nAcross⠀installments,⠀hold⠀to⠀the⠀Kawabata⠀selectivity.⠀Fix⠀on⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀impressions⠀—⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀surface,⠀a⠀small⠀habit⠀—⠀and⠀bring⠀them⠀back⠀lightly⠀at⠀intervals,⠀so⠀that⠀later⠀facts⠀quietly⠀change⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀suggested:⠀the⠀tool⠀mended⠀between⠀visits,⠀the⠀word⠀reused⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀table.⠀Repetition⠀deepens⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀chosen⠀particulars⠀instead⠀of⠀restarting⠀a⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀them⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explained⠀connections.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀avoids⠀—⠀out⠀of⠀position,⠀habit,⠀care,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀—⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling.\n\nLet⠀developments⠀be⠀earned⠀and⠀local.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀knows,⠀owes,⠀can⠀reach,⠀or⠀will⠀answer⠀is⠀progress⠀even⠀in⠀an⠀uneventful⠀installment;⠀do⠀not⠀shape⠀each⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀hang⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger⠀on⠀it.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀authorized,⠀render⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied⠀—⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀and⠀isolation⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀given⠀world⠀has⠀them⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀serial⠀duration⠀give⠀the⠀chosen⠀particulars⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
