le⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀withheld⠀for⠀a⠀reveal.⠀This⠀route⠀earns⠀its⠀reversals⠀through⠀checked⠀reference,⠀unlike⠀verbal⠀reformulation⠀alone.⠀More⠀exact⠀knowledge⠀may⠀support⠀an⠀immediate⠀precaution⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀wider⠀horror⠀unexplained.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajataw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPut⠀the⠀referent⠀of⠀a⠀disputed⠀word⠀into⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀action.⠀Establish⠀the⠀relevant⠀door,⠀distance,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀movement⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀clarification⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀somebody⠀to⠀be⠀attempting.⠀Let⠀the⠀line⠀that⠀supplies⠀the⠀correction⠀arrive⠀from⠀a⠀speaker⠀who⠀can⠀actually⠀know⠀it.\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀and⠀speaker⠀cues⠀to⠀separate⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀from⠀what⠀happens⠀as⠀a⠀result.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀agree⠀verbally⠀yet⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀interpretation;⠀show⠀the⠀conduct⠀before⠀assigning⠀a⠀motive⠀the⠀perspective⠀cannot⠀know.⠀A⠀correction⠀can⠀also⠀succeed⠀directly.⠀Timing⠀creates⠀pressure⠀because⠀action⠀continues⠀while⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀describe⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀every⠀exchange⠀hides⠀a⠀trap.\n\nRequired⠀interiority⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀replaced⠀by⠀voice-over,⠀a⠀camera⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀performance⠀clue;⠀a⠀separately⠀authorized⠀performed⠀device⠀is⠀a⠀separate⠀choice.⠀Let⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀remain⠀readable⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀private⠀objection⠀into⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀threat's⠀behavior⠀stays⠀concrete⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀name⠀is⠀contested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
