{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly,⠀locating⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀practical⠀task⠀before⠀narrowing⠀to⠀the⠀impression⠀that⠀interrupts⠀attention.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀next.⠀A⠀sound's⠀sudden⠀absence,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀contact,⠀or⠀an⠀unexpectedly⠀visible⠀detail⠀can⠀focus⠀dread⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀exaggerated⠀reaction.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀response⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀connect⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀choice.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀lengthy⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀surrounding⠀description⠀is⠀economical.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀pace⠀and⠀vocabulary.⠀A⠀short⠀exchange⠀can⠀clarify⠀the⠀material⠀situation⠀without⠀explaining⠀away⠀every⠀private⠀association.\n\nKeep⠀changes⠀of⠀position⠀and⠀consequence⠀readable⠀as⠀attention⠀shifts.⠀The⠀selected⠀detail⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀an⠀essential⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀pretty⠀pause.⠀No⠀young⠀cast,⠀comic⠀rhythm,⠀or⠀closing⠀shock⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀form⠀makes⠀a⠀concentrated⠀impression⠀easy⠀to⠀place⠀inside⠀a⠀moving⠀scene,⠀while⠀the⠀Horror⠀pressure⠀remains⠀in⠀what⠀that⠀scene⠀actually⠀permits⠀or⠀threatens.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
