            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-horror-05",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Horror · 05/05",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == horror}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Horror. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 5 of 5. }}{{// Source group: recipes-horror; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPajbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀small⠀perceivable⠀change⠀set⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀rhythm.⠀A⠀fading⠀sound,⠀a⠀surface⠀cooling⠀after⠀contact,⠀or⠀light⠀moving⠀out⠀of⠀reach⠀can⠀unfold⠀through⠀a⠀sentence⠀whose⠀pace⠀follows⠀the⠀experience.⠀Select⠀the⠀associated⠀image⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀person's⠀attention,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀another⠀metaphor⠀for⠀fear.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀impression⠀to⠀leave⠀an⠀inward⠀aftereffect⠀after⠀its⠀physical⠀source⠀changes⠀or⠀stops.⠀Make⠀that⠀transition⠀clear⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀fact⠀or⠀action.⠀A⠀remembered⠀warmth⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀someone⠀remains⠀present;⠀a⠀lingering⠀sound⠀in⠀memory⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀distinction⠀can⠀intensify⠀dread⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀inner⠀reasoning⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀available.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀be⠀musical⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀figurative,⠀restrained,⠀or⠀sad.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀body⠀must⠀continue,⠀carrying⠀only⠀the⠀association⠀that⠀still⠀matters.⠀Lyricism⠀gives⠀the⠀fleeting⠀experience⠀time⠀on⠀the⠀page;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀freeze⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀an⠀ornamental⠀tableau.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀current⠀impression⠀call⠀up⠀a⠀particular⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀fully⠀recover.⠀The⠀same⠀surface,⠀sound,⠀or⠀view⠀may⠀remain⠀while⠀the⠀bodily⠀ease⠀once⠀associated⠀with⠀it⠀does⠀not.⠀Give⠀the⠀comparison⠀its⠀actual⠀circumstances⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀that⠀the⠀familiar⠀has⠀become⠀permanently⠀ruined.\n\nKeep⠀memory⠀selective.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀temperature⠀or⠀interval⠀more⠀clearly⠀than⠀the⠀conver