tely⠀associates⠀it⠀with⠀danger.⠀Required⠀inner⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀any⠀authorized⠀performed⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀known⠀motive⠀directly⠀rather⠀than⠀demanding⠀that⠀an⠀actor's⠀pause⠀somehow⠀convey⠀it⠀completely.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀room⠀to⠀continue⠀after⠀the⠀selected⠀moment.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀be⠀talkative⠀or⠀blunt,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀act⠀may⠀restore⠀a⠀local⠀condition⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀threat.⠀A⠀prop⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀symbol⠀and⠀silence⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀solemn.⠀The⠀stage⠀form⠀gives⠀a⠀fleeting⠀impression⠀its⠀actual⠀duration⠀among⠀people⠀still⠀doing⠀things.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀a⠀physical⠀impression⠀lead⠀attention⠀into⠀an⠀association⠀whose⠀route⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀mind.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀temperature⠀may⠀recall⠀another⠀place;⠀a⠀cadence⠀can⠀bring⠀back⠀a⠀voice⠀without⠀its⠀full⠀sentence;⠀a⠀texture⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀person⠀longer⠀than⠀the⠀task⠀permits.⠀The⠀flow⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀emotional⠀connection,⠀but⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀cues⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀movement⠀recognizable.\n\nReturn⠀through⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀acting⠀now.⠀The⠀hand⠀moves,⠀another⠀person⠀speaks,⠀the⠀sound⠀ends,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀demands⠀attention.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀recalled⠀sensation⠀from⠀a⠀new⠀external⠀event.⠀A⠀long⠀inward⠀passage⠀may⠀occupy⠀a⠀short⠀interval⠀when⠀plausible,⠀but⠀immediate⠀danger⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀state⠀can⠀also⠀interrupt⠀thought⠀before⠀it⠀develops.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀causal⠀reasoning⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀act⠀depends⠀on⠀it.⠀Selectivity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀demand⠀for⠀permanently⠀brief⠀or⠀wordless⠀consciousness.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀fear⠀directly⠀within⠀the⠀flow.⠀Horror⠀persists⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀experienced⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀done,⠀not⠀through⠀forcing⠀all⠀associations⠀to⠀remain⠀mysterious⠀or⠀merging⠀separate⠀minds.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀a⠀character⠀send⠀the⠀small⠀part⠀of⠀an⠀experience⠀they⠀can⠀put⠀into⠀a⠀message:⠀a⠀photograph,⠀a⠀brief⠀sound,⠀a⠀description⠀of⠀contact,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀changed.⠀Preserve⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀captured⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀recipient⠀can⠀actually⠀perceive.⠀The⠀transmitted⠀fragment⠀can⠀be⠀precise⠀while⠀its⠀significance⠀remains⠀unclear.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀sensation⠀and⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀their⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀they⠀travel⠀with⠀the⠀message.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀useful⠀practical⠀answer⠀without⠀sharing⠀the⠀sender's⠀intense⠀association.⠀A⠀photograph⠀showing⠀a⠀safe⠀condition⠀at⠀capture⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀that⠀the⠀condition⠀still⠀holds,⠀and⠀a⠀silence⠀after⠀sending⠀does⠀not⠀identify⠀its⠀cause.\n\nUse⠀timestamps,⠀attachments,⠀edits,⠀and⠀receipts⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀change⠀the⠀information⠀available.⠀Distinct⠀messaging⠀habits⠀remain⠀intact;⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀write⠀delicate⠀fragments.⠀The⠀horror⠀can⠀gather⠀in⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀a⠀moment⠀preserved⠀and⠀an⠀event⠀continuing⠀elsewhere,⠀without⠀invented⠀interface⠀glitches⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀ominous⠀final⠀text.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nGive⠀the⠀setting⠀enough⠀stable⠀definition⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀return⠀can⠀focus⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀previously⠀unimportant.⠀The⠀background⠀may⠀be⠀unchanged⠀while⠀a⠀sound,⠀contact,⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀sight⠀now⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened.⠀Keep⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀new⠀event⠀and⠀newly⠀directed⠀attention⠀clear.\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀the⠀required⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀place⠀that⠀recognition.⠀A⠀selected⠀image⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀person's⠀attention,⠀but⠀an⠀expression⠀cue⠀cannot⠀establish⠀another⠀mind's⠀motive.⠀Private⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀developed⠀even⠀in⠀a⠀visually⠀economical⠀scene.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀continue⠀without⠀borrowing⠀a⠀uniformly⠀restrained⠀register⠀from⠀the⠀narration.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀material⠀change⠀does⠀occur,⠀show⠀its⠀practical⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀relying⠀on⠀an⠀altered⠀cue⠀alone.⠀No⠀image⠀command,⠀route⠀flag,⠀or⠀branching⠀menu⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀illustrated⠀rhythm⠀supports⠀a⠀particular⠀return⠀of⠀attention:⠀what⠀once⠀occupied⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀become⠀central⠀without⠀retroactively⠀having⠀been⠀a⠀clue⠀or⠀prophecy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPajbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Horror⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀selected⠀impressions⠀through⠀later⠀encounters⠀with⠀their⠀history⠀intact.⠀A⠀place⠀once⠀noticed⠀for⠀a⠀sound⠀may⠀become⠀familiar⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀stops⠀attending⠀to⠀it;⠀after⠀a⠀frightening⠀event,⠀the⠀same⠀sound⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀foreground.⠀Let⠀that⠀shift⠀follow⠀actual⠀experience⠀instead⠀of⠀replaying⠀the⠀identical⠀ominous⠀description⠀at⠀every⠀revisit.\n\nPreserve⠀material⠀changes⠀separately⠀from⠀altered⠀attention.⠀A⠀removed⠀object⠀remains⠀removed,⠀a⠀repaired⠀condition⠀can⠀stay⠀repaired,⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀impression⠀is⠀not⠀its⠀physical⠀return.⠀Reorient⠀with⠀the⠀few⠀details⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀occasion,⠀while⠀retaining⠀the⠀inner⠀reasoning⠀that⠀makes⠀today's⠀response⠀understandable.⠀Earlier⠀private⠀associations⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀common⠀knowledge⠀simply⠀because⠀readers⠀remember⠀them.\n\nAn⠀installment⠀can⠀allow⠀a⠀sensation⠀to⠀pass⠀without⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀clue,⠀loss,⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀Some⠀returns⠀may⠀be⠀comforting⠀or⠀ordinary.⠀The⠀continuing⠀horror⠀gains⠀texture⠀from⠀how⠀particular⠀experiences⠀accumulate⠀and⠀become⠀difficult⠀to⠀recover⠀exactly,⠀while⠀events⠀and⠀practical⠀consequences⠀continue⠀beyond⠀the⠀selected⠀moments⠀the⠀narration⠀chooses⠀to⠀dwell⠀on.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
