            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-mystery-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Mystery · 01/05",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == mystery}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Mystery. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 5. }}{{// Source group: recipes-mystery; payload preserved. }}{{// Recipe Library: Mystery }}\n{{setvar::NPakaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nUse⠀the⠀retained⠀Denpa-profile⠀techniques⠀through⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀disturbed⠀attention⠀and⠀emotional⠀investment⠀complicate⠀a⠀concrete⠀inquiry.⠀A⠀word⠀may⠀be⠀misheard,⠀a⠀memory⠀may⠀intrude,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀may⠀feel⠀hostile,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀external⠀event⠀distinct⠀from⠀that⠀experience.⠀The⠀unresolved⠀creator⠀label⠀supplies⠀no⠀additional⠀biography,⠀canon,⠀or⠀authority.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀rhythm⠀change⠀when⠀attention⠀is⠀actually⠀interrupted.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀circle⠀a⠀feared⠀interpretation⠀or⠀recoil⠀from⠀a⠀possibility⠀it⠀cannot⠀yet⠀support.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀individual:⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀plain,⠀patient,⠀angry,⠀or⠀unaware⠀of⠀the⠀disturbance.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀fragmented⠀or⠀every⠀emotional⠀wound⠀a⠀secret⠀clue.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀mystery⠀through⠀observations⠀whose⠀reliability⠀can⠀be⠀examined,⠀records,⠀and⠀independent⠀accounts.⠀A⠀vivid⠀intrusive⠀image⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀betrayal,⠀and⠀another⠀person's⠀dismissal⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀experience⠀was⠀meaningless.⠀Provide⠀a⠀fair⠀way⠀to⠀distinguish⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀established⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀solve⠀the⠀case⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀delusion,⠀supernatural⠀rule,⠀or⠀recovered⠀memory⠀introduced⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀The⠀angsty⠀treatment⠀can⠀leave⠀feeling⠀unresolved⠀after⠀the⠀factual⠀answer⠀becomes⠀clear,⠀without⠀turning⠀all⠀uncertainty⠀into⠀a⠀license⠀to⠀rewrite⠀reality.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nLet⠀the⠀current⠀inquiry⠀be⠀experienced⠀through⠀the⠀retained⠀profile's⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀and⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀where⠀the⠀authored⠀character⠀supports⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀interval⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀or⠀done⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀thought⠀it⠀meant.⠀The⠀unresolved⠀creator⠀attribution⠀remains⠀a⠀label,⠀not⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀invented⠀canon.\n\nUse⠀disruptions⠀selectively⠀and⠀causally.⠀A⠀sound,⠀intrusive⠀memory,⠀or⠀competing⠀concern⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀thought⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀question⠀emerge⠀awkwardly.⠀Other⠀characters⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀that⠀experience⠀or⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀broken⠀rhythm.⠀Access⠀to⠀each⠀character's⠀interior⠀and⠀control⠀over⠀voluntary⠀choices,⠀including⠀those⠀of⠀any⠀player⠀character,⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀this⠀style⠀alone⠀grants⠀no⠀new⠀access⠀or⠀control⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀permissions⠀already⠀given.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀case⠀through⠀something⠀testable.⠀A⠀record,⠀repeated⠀observation,⠀or⠀another⠀account⠀may⠀support⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀perception⠀while⠀correcting⠀its⠀interpretation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀correction⠀a⠀new⠀reason⠀the⠀world⠀is⠀unknowable.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀and⠀role⠀boundary⠀permits,⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀test⠀pending⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀stops⠀there;⠀no⠀investigative⠀gain⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀close.⠀A⠀stable⠀factual⠀answer⠀should⠀remain⠀possible⠀beneath⠀the⠀unsettled⠀telling,⠀with⠀relevant⠀uncertainty⠀disclosed⠀rather⠀than⠀used⠀to⠀hide⠀an⠀arbitrary⠀later⠀solution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀catalogue's⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀inquiry⠀around⠀connected⠀encounters⠀whose⠀openings⠀situate⠀the⠀occasion,⠀source,⠀and⠀practical⠀undertaking.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀arrival,⠀message,⠀visit,⠀or⠀task,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀retained⠀profile's⠀intrusive⠀associations⠀interrupt⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀within⠀that⠀occasion.⠀Return⠀through⠀an⠀established⠀action⠀or⠀occasion⠀marker⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀unexplained⠀shift⠀of⠀scene.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀episode⠀is⠀revisited,⠀distinguish⠀the⠀original⠀event⠀or⠀perception⠀from⠀later⠀clarification⠀and⠀evidence.⠀A⠀phrase⠀that⠀recurs⠀across⠀episodes⠀may⠀orient⠀a⠀connection,⠀but⠀recurrence⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀corroborate⠀a⠀fact.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀should⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀rhythms⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀including⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀answers⠀that⠀interrupt⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀escalating⠀interpretation.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀by⠀comparing⠀what⠀different⠀occasions⠀establish.⠀Records⠀and⠀independent⠀witnesses⠀can⠀corroborate⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀validating⠀every⠀association⠀around⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀supernatural⠀mechanism⠀or⠀hidden⠀technical⠀rule⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀The⠀selected⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀technological⠀conspiracy,⠀or⠀a⠀diagnosis⠀for⠀the⠀character.⠀The⠀creator⠀attribution⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀and⠀preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀An⠀episode⠀can⠀remain⠀underway⠀across⠀replies;⠀its⠀occasion⠀markers⠀help⠀re-entry⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀fresh⠀clue⠀or⠀completed⠀encounter⠀at⠀every⠀stopping⠀point.⠀The⠀finished⠀mystery⠀should⠀be⠀reconstructable⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀narrative⠀experience⠀is⠀fragmented,⠀so⠀episodic⠀form⠀deepens⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀contradiction⠀equally⠀factual.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nGive⠀the⠀retained⠀profile's⠀disrupted⠀attention⠀a⠀concrete,⠀economical⠀frame.⠀State⠀the⠀object,⠀sound,⠀action,⠀or⠀physical⠀condition⠀actually⠀encountered,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀brief⠀interruption⠀or⠀intrusive⠀interpretation⠀disturb⠀the⠀account.⠀Hard-edged⠀prose⠀should⠀clarify⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀issue⠀rather⠀than⠀turn⠀every⠀surface⠀into⠀a⠀hostile⠀signal.\n\nUse⠀fractured⠀syntax⠀only⠀when⠀thought⠀or⠀perception⠀genuinely⠀breaks.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀repeated⠀word⠀because⠀they⠀cannot⠀dismiss⠀it,⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀responds⠀plainly⠀and⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀that⠀fixation.⠀Private⠀reasoning⠀can⠀be⠀incomplete⠀without⠀being⠀absent.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀one⠀unstable⠀voice⠀to⠀the⠀whole⠀cast⠀or⠀use⠀graphic⠀detail⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀an⠀evidentiary⠀discrepancy.\n\nTest⠀the⠀interpretation⠀through⠀records,⠀another⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀repeatable⠀observation.⠀A⠀sensation's⠀intensity⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀its⠀cause.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀account⠀of⠀it,⠀with⠀enough⠀information⠀for⠀a⠀fair⠀solution.⠀No⠀late⠀diagnosis,⠀hidden⠀power,⠀or⠀retroactive⠀memory⠀should⠀explain⠀everything⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀disorienting.⠀The⠀unresolved⠀author⠀label⠀remains⠀unchanged.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀fact⠀narrow⠀the⠀case⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀character's⠀emotional⠀or⠀sensory⠀experience⠀does⠀not⠀immediately⠀become⠀orderly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀inquiry⠀through⠀records⠀that⠀may⠀preserve⠀different⠀versions⠀of⠀a⠀disrupted⠀experience:⠀a⠀diary,⠀message,⠀transcript,⠀report,⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀document.⠀The⠀retained⠀Denpa⠀profile⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀corrections,⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀missing⠀connections,⠀or⠀intrusive⠀associations,⠀but⠀distinguish⠀those⠀features⠀from⠀damage⠀to⠀the⠀document⠀itself.\n\nEstablish⠀each⠀record's⠀producer,⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀written⠀an⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀immediately⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀while⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀is⠀calmer⠀but⠀still⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀clean⠀official⠀transcript⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀full⠀truth,⠀and⠀a⠀fragmented⠀personal⠀note⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀false.⠀Keep⠀original⠀text,⠀annotations,⠀copies,⠀and⠀recalled⠀wording⠀separate.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀by⠀comparing⠀specific⠀claims⠀with⠀independent⠀evidence.⠀A⠀repeated⠀word⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀copying,⠀shared⠀context,⠀or⠀fixation;⠀its⠀cause⠀needs⠀support.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀decisive⠀corrupted⠀passage⠀or⠀lost⠀page⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀distinctly⠀from⠀documents⠀and⠀from⠀what⠀their⠀recipients⠀can⠀know.⠀The⠀unresolved⠀creator⠀i