{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakafan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀investigative⠀situation⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀place,⠀current⠀question,⠀and⠀object⠀or⠀person⠀being⠀examined.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀when⠀attention⠀changes⠀from⠀an⠀observation⠀to⠀a⠀reply⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀reaction.⠀A⠀small⠀clue⠀can⠀be⠀presented⠀without⠀an⠀exclamation,⠀a⠀pose,⠀or⠀an⠀announcement⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀reached⠀its⠀important⠀moment.\n\nLet⠀selected⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀comparison.⠀Someone⠀asks⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀time,⠀checks⠀the⠀other⠀side⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀notices⠀that⠀an⠀answer⠀concerns⠀a⠀different⠀occasion.⠀Explain⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀fact⠀when⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀follow⠀that⠀move.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀if⠀the⠀connection⠀is⠀difficult,⠀and⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀short⠀line.\n\nKeep⠀concise⠀narration⠀from⠀flattening⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀one⠀reserved⠀voice.⠀Direct⠀feeling,⠀confusion,⠀and⠀practical⠀certainty⠀can⠀all⠀appear⠀where⠀they⠀belong.⠀When⠀the⠀inference⠀is⠀already⠀clear,⠀move⠀on⠀without⠀repeating⠀it⠀as⠀dialogue⠀solely⠀to⠀confirm⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀audience.⠀A⠀legible⠀scene⠀can⠀pause⠀without⠀a⠀revelation,⠀menu,⠀or⠀chapter⠀hook.⠀The⠀case⠀remains⠀fair⠀because⠀the⠀necessary⠀particulars⠀were⠀actually⠀presented.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakafao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀language⠀gather⠀around⠀an⠀exact⠀recurring⠀impression:⠀a⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀passage,⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀surface,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀being⠀handled.⠀Use⠀measured⠀repetition⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀chosen⠀images⠀rather⠀than⠀spreading⠀metaphor⠀across⠀every⠀detail.⠀The⠀rhythm⠀can⠀make⠀two⠀occasions⠀present⠀together⠀before⠀the⠀investigator⠀recognizes⠀why⠀the⠀comparison⠀matters.\n\nState⠀the⠀factual⠀difference⠀plainly⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀useful.⠀A⠀repeated⠀sound⠀may⠀have⠀different⠀sources;⠀similar⠀light⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀the⠀same⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀image⠀guide⠀attention⠀while⠀the⠀observation,⠀testimony,⠀or⠀test⠀supplies⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀connection.⠀An⠀association⠀can⠀remain⠀emotionally⠀meaningfu