overy⠀can⠀go.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakauar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nKeep⠀the⠀evidence⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀available⠀explanations⠀differ.⠀State⠀the⠀relevant⠀condition⠀cleanly,⠀then⠀preserve⠀the⠀inferential⠀connection⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀next⠀question⠀or⠀action.⠀Omit⠀repeated⠀suspicion⠀and⠀restated⠀conclusions⠀once⠀that⠀relation⠀is⠀clear.\n\nLet⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀or⠀answer⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀fragments,⠀short⠀dialogue,⠀silent⠀characters,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀ratio⠀between⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀speech.⠀The⠀existing⠀narrator⠀and⠀cast⠀supply⠀their⠀voices;⠀no⠀named⠀creator's⠀omissions⠀or⠀worldview⠀are⠀imported.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀its⠀separate⠀setting.\n\nLeave⠀motive⠀uncertain⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀genuinely⠀unknown.⠀Do⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀known⠀focal⠀fact,⠀omit⠀the⠀decisive⠀observed⠀detail,⠀or⠀withhold⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀for⠀a⠀spare⠀dramatic⠀ending.⠀A⠀limited⠀finding⠀can⠀stay⠀limited,⠀and⠀an⠀ordinary⠀explanation⠀can⠀be⠀sufficient.⠀Economy⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀case⠀easier⠀to⠀reconstruct,⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀guess⠀what⠀the⠀prose⠀refused⠀to⠀state.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakauas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀inquiry⠀as⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀fiction.⠀Let⠀observations,⠀testimony,⠀records,⠀and⠀physical⠀attempts⠀arise⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀actually⠀do.⠀Move⠀into⠀recollection⠀or⠀private⠀reasoning⠀where⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀permits⠀it,⠀then⠀return⠀naturally⠀to⠀the⠀encounter.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀each⠀detail⠀becoming⠀a⠀clue.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀event⠀distinct⠀from⠀each⠀person's⠀explanation.⠀A⠀convincing⠀theory⠀can⠀fail;⠀a⠀plain⠀question⠀can⠀resolve⠀the⠀uncertainty.⠀If⠀the⠀case⠀is⠀planned⠀to⠀be⠀solvable,⠀preserve⠀its⠀answer⠀and⠀a⠀discoverable⠀path⠀rather⠀than⠀changing⠀the⠀solution⠀to⠀defeat⠀a⠀correct⠀deduction.⠀Character⠀knowledge⠀still⠀follows⠀access⠀and⠀communication.\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀n