n{{setvar::NPakauaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀relevant⠀action,⠀object,⠀or⠀statement⠀in⠀a⠀screen-oriented⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀headings⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀a⠀later⠀inference⠀depend⠀on⠀something⠀actually⠀shown⠀or⠀reported,⠀not⠀a⠀camera⠀command⠀that⠀labels⠀an⠀unseen⠀clue.⠀Establish⠀who⠀can⠀perceive⠀each⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nA⠀reconstruction⠀or⠀recollection⠀can⠀be⠀presented⠀when⠀the⠀narrative⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀identify⠀its⠀status.⠀It⠀must⠀not⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀authoritative⠀replay⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀merely⠀because⠀an⠀investigator⠀imagines⠀it⠀confidently.⠀Cuts⠀can⠀control⠀disclosure⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀event's⠀history⠀and⠀each⠀character's⠀access⠀to⠀information.\n\nRequired⠀interiority⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Voice-over,⠀as⠀a⠀separately⠀authorized⠀performance⠀device,⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀public⠀action⠀lines⠀free⠀of⠀declarations⠀about⠀hidden⠀guilt.⠀No⠀named⠀cinematic⠀style⠀or⠀universal⠀dialogue⠀rhythm⠀is⠀added.⠀The⠀sequence⠀should⠀make⠀a⠀supported⠀explanation⠀reconstructable⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀montage,⠀surprise⠀cut,⠀or⠀final⠀gathering⠀of⠀suspects.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakauax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀to⠀establish⠀what⠀participants⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀reach,⠀and⠀handle.⠀Props,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀spoken⠀reports⠀can⠀provide⠀the⠀evidence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀access⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀claim⠀can⠀be⠀compared⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀made⠀possible.\n\nLet⠀testimony⠀retain⠀its⠀source.⠀An⠀offstage⠀act⠀is⠀not⠀verified⠀merely⠀because⠀a⠀confident⠀speaker⠀describes⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀guarded⠀prop⠀or⠀pause⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀sign⠀of⠀guilt.⠀Characters⠀can⠀ask,⠀demonstrate,⠀or⠀correct⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀voices⠀without⠀a⠀hidden⠀playwright's⠀verbal⠀signature.⠀A⠀present⠀reenactment⠀remains⠀a⠀test⠀under⠀present⠀conditions.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀thought⠀stays⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Asides⠀and⠀monologues⠀are⠀perform