            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == mystery}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Mystery. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 5 of 5. }}{{// Source group: recipes-mystery; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPakazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀make⠀an⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀worth⠀questioning.⠀The⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀candor⠀can⠀help⠀a⠀character⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀shared⠀assumption,⠀unexplained⠀act,⠀or⠀conventional⠀story⠀that⠀has⠀shaped⠀how⠀the⠀participants⠀treat⠀one⠀another.⠀Keep⠀the⠀mystery's⠀factual⠀question⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀desired⠀emotional⠀outcome.\n\nUse⠀established⠀exchanges⠀as⠀the⠀basis⠀for⠀reflection⠀and⠀correction.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀admit⠀a⠀self-serving⠀interpretation,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀remains⠀practical,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀playful⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀speaker.⠀A⠀clever⠀challenge⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀one⠀person⠀the⠀relationship's⠀permanent⠀voice⠀of⠀reason.⠀Let⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀have⠀knowledge,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀boundaries⠀of⠀their⠀own.\n\nTest⠀the⠀interpretation⠀through⠀actual⠀evidence.⠀A⠀preferred⠀pairing⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀innocence,⠀and⠀a⠀candid⠀confession⠀of⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀what⠀happened.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀hidden⠀sacrifice⠀or⠀a⠀socially⠀disapproved⠀secret⠀merely⠀to⠀reward⠀unconventional⠀thinking.⠀Let⠀the⠀answer⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀can⠀reasonably⠀assume,⠀then⠀let⠀their⠀conduct⠀determine⠀repair,⠀trust,⠀or⠀continued⠀disagreement.⠀The⠀combination⠀should⠀make⠀honest⠀inquiry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀turn⠀the⠀case⠀into⠀a⠀device⠀for⠀demonstrating⠀that⠀the⠀most⠀irreverent⠀or⠀articulate⠀person⠀always⠀understands⠀the⠀other⠀better.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀the⠀saga's⠀remembered⠀deeds⠀and⠀repeated⠀accounts⠀as⠀material⠀for⠀a⠀precise⠀inquiry.⠀The⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile⠀can⠀question⠀an⠀inherited⠀explanation⠀without⠀assuming⠀every⠀legend⠀is⠀false.⠀Establish⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said,⠀done,⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀recorded,⠀and⠀distinguish⠀that⠀from⠀the⠀moral⠀later⠀tellers⠀attached⠀to⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀occasionally⠀irreverent⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀clarity.⠀A⠀famous⠀act⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀condition⠀the⠀grand⠀account⠀omitted.⠀Individual⠀speakers⠀can⠀be⠀plain,⠀ceremonial,⠀confused,⠀or⠀self-protective⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀situation.⠀Private⠀motives⠀require⠀actual⠀access⠀or⠀sourced⠀testimony,⠀not⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀tradition.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀through⠀independent⠀records,⠀traces,⠀and⠀a⠀recoverable⠀sequence.⠀A⠀clever⠀reinterpretation⠀of⠀an⠀oath⠀or⠀title⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀by⠀itself.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀an⠀ancient⠀rule,⠀prophecy,⠀or⠀hidden⠀lineage⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀The⠀selected⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀pantheon⠀or⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Let⠀the⠀corrected⠀account⠀remain⠀proportionate⠀to⠀the⠀evidence,⠀neither⠀preserving⠀a⠀flattering⠀myth⠀for⠀comfort⠀nor⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀cynical⠀one⠀for⠀effect.⠀The⠀final⠀consequence⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀more⠀responsible⠀remembrance⠀of⠀the⠀deed⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀universal⠀rejection⠀of⠀inherited⠀stories.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀catalogue's⠀psychological⠀and⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀candid⠀reasoning⠀follow⠀an⠀investigator⠀who⠀questions⠀both⠀the⠀accepted⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀appeal⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀alternative.⠀The⠀narrative⠀can⠀reflect⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀procedure⠀or⠀social⠀assumption,⠀but⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀check⠀underway.\n\nDevelop⠀a⠀situated⠀observation⠀into⠀a⠀stated⠀premise,⠀follow⠀its⠀conditional⠀consequences⠀in⠀deliberate⠀prose,⠀and⠀distinguish⠀hypothetical⠀illustration⠀from⠀reported⠀occurrence.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀check⠀with⠀that⠀premise⠀available⠀for⠀testing.⠀A⠀result⠀may⠀support,⠀qualify,⠀or⠀overturn⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀pending⠀check⠀can⠀remain⠀pending.⠀Keep⠀reflection⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator's⠀authority;⠀the⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀need⠀not⠀occur⠀after⠀every⠀scene⠀or⠀become⠀every⠀character's⠀spoken⠀style.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀mind's⠀freedom⠀visible⠀through⠀its⠀capacity⠀to⠀revise,⠀not⠀merely⠀refuse.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀enjoy⠀an⠀irreverent⠀explanation⠀and⠀then⠀discover⠀that⠀it⠀lacks⠀evidence.⠀Another⠀speaker's⠀ordinary⠀experience⠀can⠀correct⠀a⠀theoretical⠀assumption.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀regional⠀template⠀of⠀reserve⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀voice⠀of⠀intellectual⠀skepticism.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀case⠀from⠀observations,⠀records,⠀and⠀independently⠀sourced⠀testimony.⠀A⠀logically⠀coherent⠀story⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀it⠀happened,⠀and⠀an⠀institution's⠀flaws⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀all⠀its⠀records⠀false.⠀The⠀selected⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀setting,⠀bleakness,⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀facts.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀account⠀clarify⠀the⠀event⠀while⠀leaving⠀wider⠀philosophical⠀interpretation⠀provisional.⠀A⠀reflective⠀ending⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀investigator⠀now⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀responsibly⠀claim,⠀rather⠀than⠀use⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀meaning⠀to⠀avoid⠀resolving⠀an⠀answerable⠀factual⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPut⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀clear⠀questioning⠀into⠀visible⠀attempts⠀and⠀concise⠀exchanges.⠀Establish⠀the⠀accepted⠀explanation,⠀the⠀practical⠀fact⠀it⠀fails⠀to⠀cover,⠀and⠀the⠀test⠀that⠀might⠀distinguish⠀alternatives.⠀Use⠀readable⠀action⠀lines⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀an⠀entire⠀philosophy⠀of⠀skepticism.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀retain⠀different⠀voices⠀and⠀motives.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀candid⠀without⠀being⠀correct,⠀and⠀an⠀official⠀can⠀answer⠀accurately⠀without⠀understanding⠀the⠀larger⠀problem.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀attributed⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Separately⠀motivated⠀voice-over⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀disclose⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀cast⠀by⠀default.⠀Avoid⠀using⠀an⠀actor's⠀confidence,⠀embarrassment,⠀or⠀contempt⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀truthfulness.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀from⠀what⠀viewers⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀or⠀learn⠀through⠀a⠀credible⠀source.⠀A⠀demonstration⠀establishes⠀possibility;⠀further⠀evidence⠀must⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀rule,⠀hidden⠀record,⠀or⠀unshown⠀decisive⠀action⠀only⠀in⠀the⠀reveal⠀sequence.⠀The⠀final⠀explanation⠀should⠀remain⠀precise⠀and⠀proportionate,⠀with⠀its⠀practical⠀consequence⠀visible.⠀Screen⠀form⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀absurdity⠀funny⠀without⠀treating⠀humor⠀as⠀proof⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀triumphant⠀monologue⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀most⠀independent⠀thinker⠀settles⠀every⠀moral⠀and⠀factual⠀issue⠀at⠀once.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nMake⠀the⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀testable⠀through⠀the⠀room's⠀actual⠀props,⠀timing,⠀entrances,⠀and⠀testimony.⠀The⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀lucid⠀irreverence⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀rule's⠀stated⠀purpose⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀permits.⠀Keep⠀the⠀arrangement⠀stageable⠀and⠀the⠀relevant⠀conditions⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀audience.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀pursue⠀the⠀inquiry⠀rather⠀than⠀become⠀a⠀detached⠀philosophical⠀contest.⠀A⠀plain⠀speaker⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀elegant⠀argument.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Treat⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues⠀as⠀separately⠀motivated⠀performed⠀speech,⠀never⠀replacements;⠀the⠀cast⠀does⠀not⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀private⠀material⠀automatically.⠀Different⠀participants⠀can⠀accept⠀the⠀same⠀fact⠀while⠀disagreeing⠀about⠀its⠀meaning.\n\nThe⠀mystery⠀needs⠀evidence⠀beyond⠀a⠀successful⠀demonstration⠀of⠀logical⠀possibility.⠀Link⠀the⠀proposed⠀sequence⠀to⠀a⠀witness,⠀record,⠀or⠀observable⠀trace.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀film⠀editing,⠀an⠀invisible⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀procedural⠀exception⠀introduced⠀at⠀the⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀final⠀exchange⠀can⠀be⠀concise⠀because⠀the⠀room⠀prepared⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀consequence⠀show⠀what⠀changes⠀practically,⠀without⠀a⠀universal⠀declaration⠀that⠀reason⠀has⠀defeated⠀authority⠀or⠀an⠀ironic⠀ending⠀that⠀makes⠀every⠀attempted⠀explanation⠀equally⠀futile.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀an⠀authorized⠀mind⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀then⠀examine⠀the⠀attraction⠀of⠀its⠀own⠀alternative.⠀The⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀rational⠀candor⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀memories,⠀objections,⠀private⠀jokes,⠀and⠀practical⠀comparisons⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀polished⠀essay⠀detached⠀from⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀current⠀observations⠀to⠀interrupt⠀the⠀argument.⠀A⠀witness⠀answers,⠀a⠀test⠀fails,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀contradicts⠀an⠀assumption.⠀Distinguish⠀imagined⠀examples⠀from⠀actual⠀events⠀through⠀context,⠀and⠀keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀minds⠀separate.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀intellectually⠀independent⠀and⠀still⠀miss⠀a⠀simple⠀fact⠀because⠀of⠀irritation,⠀vanity,⠀or⠀fatigue.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀evidence⠀path⠀beneath⠀the⠀associative⠀movement.⠀A⠀coherent⠀possibility⠀needs⠀support⠀linking⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀decisive⠀memory⠀or⠀hidden⠀rule⠀solely⠀as⠀a⠀final⠀insight.⠀Let⠀the⠀investigation⠀revise⠀both⠀conventional⠀and⠀unconventional⠀accounts⠀when⠀facts⠀require⠀it.⠀The⠀conclusion⠀should⠀remain⠀expressible⠀plainly,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀mental⠀route⠀was⠀restless⠀or⠀irreverent.⠀Uncertainty⠀about⠀the⠀narrator's⠀self-understanding⠀need⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀concrete⠀answer,⠀and⠀an⠀inward⠀sense⠀of⠀liberation⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀mistaken⠀for⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀favored⠀explanation⠀is⠀true.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀a⠀digital⠀exchange⠀to⠀test⠀a⠀conventional⠀claim⠀against⠀its⠀actual⠀wording,⠀circulation,⠀and⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀The⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀candid⠀questions⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀assumption⠀in⠀a⠀forwarded⠀notice,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀shared⠀account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀thread's⠀immediate⠀purpose⠀clear⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀platform⠀for⠀general⠀skepticism.\n\nDistinguish⠀original⠀messages,⠀quotations,⠀screenshots,⠀drafts,⠀and⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀widely⠀shared⠀account⠀may⠀derive⠀from⠀one⠀source.⠀A⠀precise⠀question⠀can⠀be⠀useful⠀without⠀making⠀its⠀asker⠀automatically⠀right.⠀Let⠀participants⠀have⠀different⠀levels⠀of⠀expertise⠀and⠀different⠀reasons⠀for⠀answering⠀or⠀remaining⠀silent.⠀Metadata⠀should⠀establish⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀actual⠀interface⠀supports.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀through⠀corroborated⠀timing,⠀provenance,⠀and⠀events⠀beyond⠀the⠀conversation.⠀A⠀logical⠀reading⠀of⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀the⠀sender's⠀intent.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀hidden⠀edit⠀or⠀decisive⠀deleted⠀text⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀The⠀final⠀clarification⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary⠀and⠀practical,⠀with⠀disagreement⠀about⠀wider⠀meaning⠀still⠀possible.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀triumphant⠀post⠀that⠀makes⠀every⠀participant⠀concede,⠀or⠀a⠀cynical⠀last⠀message⠀that⠀invalidates⠀all⠀evidence⠀because⠀digital⠀accounts⠀can⠀sometimes⠀be⠀manipulated.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀clear⠀dialogue,⠀concise⠀scene⠀passages,⠀and⠀focal⠀reasoning⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀profile's⠀independent⠀inquiry⠀readable.⠀A⠀conventional⠀explanation⠀can⠀be⠀challenged⠀through⠀a⠀visible⠀discrepancy⠀or⠀practical⠀test.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀clue⠀in⠀the⠀text⠀rather⠀than⠀relying⠀on⠀an⠀imagined⠀background⠀asset.\n\nLet⠀private⠀thought⠀expose⠀the⠀narrator's⠀assumptions⠀and⠀their⠀willingness⠀to⠀revise⠀them.⠀Other⠀characters⠀can⠀supply⠀accurate⠀ordinary⠀knowledge⠀without⠀becoming⠀ideological⠀foils.⠀Expression⠀cues⠀show⠀reaction,⠀not⠀truthfulness.⠀A⠀candid⠀or⠀irreverent⠀line⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀turn⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀display⠀of⠀intellectual⠀independence.\n\nAdvance⠀through⠀evidence⠀that⠀distinguishes⠀possible⠀accounts.⠀A⠀demonstration⠀may⠀show⠀how⠀an⠀event⠀could⠀occur,⠀but⠀needs⠀corroboration⠀of⠀actual⠀use.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀rule⠀or⠀hidden⠀past⠀scene⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀reveal⠀needs⠀force.⠀The⠀visual-novel⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀routes,⠀assets,⠀or⠀game⠀commands.⠀Let⠀the⠀answer⠀settle⠀the⠀concrete⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀show⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀most⠀unconventional⠀character⠀the⠀automatic⠀winner⠀or⠀treating⠀a⠀philosophically⠀op