answer⠀be⠀clear⠀enough⠀to⠀follow⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀emotional⠀response⠀quiet,⠀mixed,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀an⠀authorized⠀mind⠀move⠀among⠀a⠀few⠀selected⠀impressions,⠀memories,⠀private⠀words,⠀and⠀present⠀interruptions.⠀The⠀Kawabata⠀profile's⠀compression⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀associations⠀delicate⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀vague.⠀Keep⠀the⠀concrete⠀uncertainty⠀present⠀through⠀recurring⠀factual⠀anchors⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀continuous⠀wash⠀of⠀mood.\n\nDistinguish⠀current⠀perception⠀from⠀remembered⠀sensation⠀and⠀imagined⠀explanation⠀through⠀context.⠀A⠀small⠀detail⠀may⠀attract⠀attention⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀attachment⠀the⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀fully⠀understand.⠀Another⠀speaker's⠀ordinary⠀answer⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀association⠀and⠀correct⠀a⠀practical⠀assumption.⠀Other⠀minds⠀remain⠀separate,⠀and⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀authorize⠀private⠀thought⠀for⠀a⠀human-controlled⠀character.\n\nThe⠀mystery⠀requires⠀a⠀check⠀beyond⠀the⠀impression.⠀A⠀resemblance⠀or⠀emotionally⠀vivid⠀memory⠀can⠀suggest⠀where⠀to⠀look,⠀but⠀cannot⠀establish⠀sequence⠀or⠀motive⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀solve⠀the⠀case⠀with⠀an⠀unprepared⠀recovered⠀detail⠀or⠀use⠀the⠀thought⠀stream⠀to⠀excuse⠀contradictions⠀in⠀the⠀event.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀understanding⠀change⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀images⠀already⠀available,⠀with⠀enough⠀plain⠀explanation⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀inference⠀fair.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀remain⠀emotionally⠀open⠀without⠀refusing⠀a⠀factual⠀answer⠀that⠀the⠀evidence⠀supports.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀a⠀selective⠀transcript⠀in⠀which⠀small⠀differences⠀of⠀wording,⠀timing,⠀or⠀circulation⠀matter⠀through⠀established⠀context.⠀The⠀Kawabata⠀profile⠀can⠀give⠀an⠀ordinary⠀message⠀personal⠀resonance,⠀but⠀preserve⠀exactly⠀what⠀was⠀sent⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀the⠀recipient's⠀impression⠀as⠀its⠀full⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀sent⠀text,⠀quoted⠀material,⠀drafts,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀distinct.⠀A⠀short⠀answer⠀may⠀be⠀sufficient⠀rather⠀than⠀emotionally⠀distant.⠀A⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀reflect⠀ordinary⠀absence,⠀and⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀understanding.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀remain⠀individual.⠀Include⠀supported⠀interface⠀details⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange,⠀orientation,⠀private⠀experience,⠀or⠀evidence.⠀Keep⠀interface⠀events⠀consistent⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀shown⠀or⠀established⠀rather⠀than⠀fabricating⠀a⠀receipt⠀or⠀delay⠀solely⠀to⠀imply⠀hidden⠀meaning;⠀neither⠀needs⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀clue.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀solution⠀through⠀corroborated⠀context.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀suggest⠀shared⠀knowledge⠀without⠀proving⠀a⠀hidden⠀relationship⠀or⠀common⠀author.⠀A⠀saved⠀message⠀establishes⠀its⠀contents,⠀not⠀every⠀circumstance⠀surrounding⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀decisive⠀deletion⠀or⠀unseen⠀attachment⠀at⠀the⠀reveal.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀clarification⠀reweight⠀earlier⠀messages⠀without⠀changing⠀them.⠀The⠀emotional⠀aftermath⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀reply,⠀while⠀the⠀concrete⠀question⠀receives⠀enough⠀explanation⠀to⠀be⠀answerable.⠀Selectivity⠀should⠀remove⠀noise,⠀not⠀the⠀information⠀needed⠀for⠀a⠀fair⠀inference.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene⠀passages⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀few⠀selected⠀details⠀matter.⠀The⠀Kawabata⠀profile's⠀attention⠀can⠀focus⠀on⠀an⠀object's⠀placement,⠀a⠀recurring⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀an⠀established⠀routine.⠀Put⠀the⠀relevant⠀information⠀in⠀the⠀text⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀a⠀background⠀image⠀contains⠀evidence⠀the⠀reader⠀cannot⠀inspect.\n\nLet⠀focal⠀reactions⠀remain⠀personal⠀and⠀fallible.⠀A⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀can⠀evoke⠀memory⠀without⠀proving⠀its⠀cause.⠀Expression⠀cues⠀should⠀not⠀identify⠀lies⠀or⠀hidden⠀affection⠀automatically.⠀Required⠀private⠀reasoning⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀retains⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀rhythm⠀and⠀capacity⠀for⠀direct⠀explanation.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀mystery⠀through⠀a⠀comparison,⠀record,⠀or⠀sourced⠀account⠀that⠀tests⠀the⠀initial⠀impression.⠀A⠀visual⠀reprise⠀may⠀gain⠀meaning⠀through⠀new⠀context⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene's⠀actual⠀contents.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀routes,⠀choice⠀menus,⠀images,⠀or⠀engine⠀commands.⠀Let⠀the⠀solution⠀be⠀quiet⠀yet⠀intelligible,⠀with⠀its⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀shown⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀subsequent⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀confuse⠀a⠀delicate⠀presentation⠀with⠀permission⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀evidence⠀path⠀unwritten⠀or⠀to⠀end⠀on⠀ambiguity⠀about⠀a⠀factual⠀question⠀the⠀case⠀has⠀made⠀solvable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPakbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Mystery⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nLet⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀recurring⠀details⠀accumulate⠀context⠀across⠀installments.⠀The⠀Kawabata⠀profile's⠀selectivity⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀changed⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀interval⠀noticeable⠀because⠀earlier⠀scenes⠀established⠀its⠀ordinary⠀place.⠀Preserve⠀that⠀history⠀accurately,⠀and⠀allow⠀many⠀other⠀details⠀to⠀remain⠀irrelevant⠀parts⠀of⠀lived⠀experience.\n\nUse⠀investigative⠀work⠀cumulatively⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀return⠀may⠀add⠀a⠀concrete⠀observation,⠀test⠀an⠀impression,⠀clarify⠀a⠀source,⠀continue⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀request⠀pending.⠀Reorientation⠀can⠀be⠀brief,⠀through⠀the⠀current⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀repeated⠀clue⠀list.⠀Private⠀feelings⠀may⠀change⠀slowly⠀while⠀factual⠀corrections⠀remain⠀settled.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀into⠀stronger⠀foreshadowing⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀statement⠀about⠀loss.\n\nCarry⠀valid⠀inferences⠀forward.⠀A⠀subtle⠀clue⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀altered⠀later⠀to⠀fit⠀a⠀new⠀answer,⠀and⠀an⠀already⠀explained⠀discrepancy⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀mysterious⠀again⠀merely⠀to⠀prolong⠀the⠀arc.⠀The⠀final⠀synthesis⠀can⠀be⠀concise⠀when⠀the⠀evidence⠀has⠀been⠀distributed⠀fairly.⠀Let⠀the⠀case⠀close⠀when⠀supported,⠀with⠀its⠀human⠀consequence⠀available⠀for⠀further⠀scenes.⠀Serial⠀restraint⠀should⠀not⠀mean⠀permanent⠀deferral,⠀and⠀a⠀quiet⠀ending⠀should⠀still⠀answer⠀the⠀concrete⠀question⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀another⠀evocative⠀image.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
