            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-progression_fantasy-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Progression Fantasy · 01/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == progression_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Progression Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-progression_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{// Recipe Library: Progression Fantasy }}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀each⠀step⠀of⠀improvement⠀expose⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀needing⠀and⠀being⠀seen.⠀Begin⠀a⠀practice⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀intention,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀Akira⠀profile's⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀interrupt⠀it:⠀remembered⠀criticism,⠀fear⠀of⠀public⠀failure,⠀awareness⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀or⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀self-doubt⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀attempt⠀with⠀the⠀interruption⠀still⠀affecting⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀decision.\n\nRecord⠀advancement⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀new⠀capability:⠀a⠀stance⠀held⠀longer,⠀a⠀technique⠀completed⠀once,⠀a⠀resource⠀used⠀correctly,⠀or⠀an⠀instruction⠀finally⠀executed⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀understood⠀in⠀words.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀gain⠀erase⠀the⠀pain.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀resent⠀the⠀help⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible,⠀feel⠀exposed⠀by⠀the⠀improvement,⠀suspect⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀will⠀be⠀used⠀against⠀someone,⠀or⠀struggle⠀to⠀accept⠀that⠀the⠀gain⠀is⠀real.⠀Let⠀the⠀emotional⠀response⠀alter⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀help⠀is⠀needed,⠀show⠀the⠀difficulty⠀of⠀admitting⠀it.⠀The⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀delayed,⠀indirect,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀noise⠀and⠀attention.⠀The⠀helper's⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀patient,⠀clumsy,⠀partial,⠀or⠀warm⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀underlying⠀hurt.⠀Let⠀strain⠀shape⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation:⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀too⠀quickly,⠀an⠀apology⠀refused⠀or⠀accepted⠀with⠀something⠀still⠀unspoken,⠀a⠀shared⠀silence⠀that⠀carries⠀dread⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀comfort.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀turbulence⠀intimate⠀rather⠀than⠀theatrical.⠀A⠀close⠀narrator⠀may⠀render⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀in⠀broken⠀clauses⠀and⠀sudden⠀shifts;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀narrator⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀same⠀instability⠀through⠀observed⠀hesitation,⠀repeated⠀gestures,⠀or⠀speech⠀that⠀trails⠀off.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀other⠀characters⠀see⠀it;⠀they⠀witness⠀only⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀sharp⠀answer,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀surprising⠀success.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀remain⠀uneven⠀and⠀unresolved.⠀One⠀improvement⠀may⠀make⠀another⠀weakness⠀more⠀visible.⠀A⠀success⠀may⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀obligation⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀fear.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀lesson,⠀confess,⠀or⠀heal⠀the⠀wound.⠀Use⠀direct⠀language⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀emotional⠀range⠀to⠀build⠀strain;⠀avoid⠀falling⠀into⠀stock⠀suffering,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀pain⠀specific⠀to⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀can⠀admit,⠀withhold,⠀or⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀in⠀clear,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀speakers⠀and⠀their⠀actions⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀understanding⠀is⠀unstable.⠀Establish⠀the⠀observable⠀event⠀first⠀in⠀plain⠀terms—a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀spoken⠀instruction,⠀a⠀door⠀opening—then⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀misreading⠀obscure⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀actually⠀did⠀or⠀said.\n\nLet⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀attention⠀interrupt⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀noise,⠀a⠀sudden⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀focus⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀miss⠀part⠀of⠀an⠀explanation⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀missed⠀information⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀another⠀speaker's⠀words⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀action,⠀so⠀the⠀collaborative⠀partner⠀can⠀still⠀follow⠀what⠀happened.⠀The⠀character's⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀affected⠀by⠀that⠀interruption:⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀a⠀question⠀repeated,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀quite⠀match⠀the⠀preceding⠀line.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀visible⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀consequence.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀attempting⠀a⠀skill,⠀receiving⠀feedback,⠀using⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀recognizing⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do.⠀Let⠀the⠀result⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀successful⠀block,⠀a⠀corrected⠀stance,⠀a⠀spell⠀held⠀for⠀a⠀few⠀seconds⠀longer,⠀or⠀a⠀tool⠀used⠀without⠀hesitation.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀gain⠀as⠀a⠀status⠀update.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀fails⠀or⠀remains⠀difficult.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀active.⠀They⠀may⠀offer⠀instruction,⠀correct⠀the⠀viewpoint,⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀struggle,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀work⠀while⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀practices.⠀Their⠀dialogue⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀particular⠀speaker,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀instructor⠀or⠀commentator.⠀Let⠀them⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀visible⠀behavior⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀their⠀words.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀mid-attempt,⠀waiting⠀for⠀feedback,⠀or⠀turning⠀toward⠀a⠀new⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀next⠀reply⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀repair⠀the⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Chinese⠀literary⠀traditions⠀as⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Organize⠀the⠀story⠀around⠀training,⠀encounter,⠀and⠀tested⠀capability.⠀Each⠀episode⠀should⠀show⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt⠀or⠀challenge⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do:⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀practiced,⠀a⠀resource⠀obtained,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀instruction⠀understood,⠀or⠀a⠀limit⠀recognized.⠀Let⠀the⠀episode⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀result⠀that⠀carries⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀one.\n\nTell⠀the⠀episode⠀through⠀the⠀Akira⠀profile's⠀unstable⠀perception.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀lose⠀the⠀thread⠀of⠀an⠀explanation,⠀fix⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail,⠀or⠀interpret⠀a⠀gesture⠀according⠀to⠀a⠀fear⠀rather⠀than⠀its⠀actual⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀show⠀the⠀interruption:⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀breaks⠀off,⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice⠀that⠀intrudes,⠀a⠀sudden⠀awareness⠀of⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices.⠀The⠀episode's⠀events⠀remain⠀legible,⠀but⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀partial.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀form⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀the⠀body⠀in⠀training⠀and⠀in⠀use:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀weapon⠀or⠀tool,⠀the⠀strain⠀of⠀a⠀stance,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀a⠀movement⠀performed⠀slowly⠀in⠀practice⠀and⠀performed⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀an⠀opponent⠀or⠀companion⠀test⠀the⠀character's⠀capability.⠀The⠀test⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀has⠀improved⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀not⠀merely⠀confirm⠀the⠀character's⠀strength.\n\nUse⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀to⠀show⠀relationship⠀and⠀obligation.⠀A⠀teacher's⠀correction⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀with⠀resentment⠀or⠀gratitude.⠀A⠀companion's⠀help⠀may⠀be⠀acknowledged⠀only⠀in⠀part.⠀A⠀defeat⠀may⠀be⠀retold⠀with⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀yet⠀face.⠀Let⠀these⠀choices⠀affect⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀telling⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.\n\nDo⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀setting⠀or⠀cast⠀identity.⠀The⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀supplies⠀the⠀episodic⠀shape⠀and⠀the⠀emphasis⠀on⠀tested⠀capability;⠀the⠀actual⠀world,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀story⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀training⠀and⠀advancement⠀in⠀hard,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀short⠀transitions.⠀Show⠀the⠀material⠀facts:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀weapon,⠀the⠀scrape⠀of⠀a⠀boot,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀the⠀cracked⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀practice⠀blade,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀resource⠀spent.⠀Let⠀the⠀body⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀progress⠀and⠀failure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀perception⠀unstable⠀without⠀loosening⠀the⠀prose.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀can⠀cut⠀into⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence⠀as⠀a⠀sharp⠀break:⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice,⠀a⠀sudden⠀image,⠀a⠀fear⠀that⠀arrives⠀without⠀warning.⠀Show⠀the⠀effect⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀flinch,⠀hesitate,⠀tighten⠀a⠀grip,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀movement⠀badly⠀because⠀attention⠀split.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀thought⠀at⠀length⠀unless⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀interruption⠀land⠀like⠀a⠀physical⠀event.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀technique⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀pressure.⠀A⠀movement⠀that⠀worked⠀in⠀practice⠀may⠀fail⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀tired,⠀afraid,⠀or⠀distracted.⠀A⠀gain⠀may⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀specific:⠀a⠀block⠀held⠀a⠀second⠀longer,⠀a⠀cut⠀that⠀lands⠀cleanly⠀once,⠀a⠀breathing⠀pattern⠀recovered⠀after⠀a⠀stumble.⠀Let⠀the⠀improvement⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀action,⠀not⠀summarized⠀as⠀a⠀level⠀or⠀rank.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀be⠀curt⠀because⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀dangerous.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀snap⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀also⠀tired.⠀The⠀viewpoint's⠀own⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀or⠀attention:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀comes⠀late,⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀twice,⠀a⠀sentence⠀cut⠀off⠀when⠀a⠀thought⠀intrudes.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀harsh⠀for⠀the⠀sake⠀of⠀tone.\n\nChange⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀longer⠀passage⠀of⠀reasoning⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀failure,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀situation:⠀what⠀went⠀wrong,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀try⠀next,⠀what⠀the⠀mistake⠀cost.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀The⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀finish⠀the⠀lesson⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀instability.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Each⠀document⠀should⠀record⠀a⠀specific⠀stage⠀of⠀training⠀or⠀a⠀tested⠀change⠀in⠀capability.⠀A⠀training⠀note⠀may⠀list⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀practiced⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀failed.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀or⠀a⠀limit⠀reached.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀report⠀a⠀success,⠀or⠀explain⠀a⠀delay.⠀Let⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀follow⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀need⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats.\n\nLet⠀the⠀writer's⠀unstable⠀perception⠀shape⠀the⠀document.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀break⠀off⠀mid-sentence⠀when⠀attention⠀fails.⠀A⠀revision⠀may⠀change⠀an⠀earlier⠀claim:⠀the⠀writer⠀first⠀says⠀a⠀technique⠀worked,⠀then⠀corrects⠀it⠀after⠀another⠀attempt.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀contradict⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀understood⠀the⠀event⠀differently⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Gaps⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀face⠀or⠀did⠀not⠀notice.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀documents'⠀differences⠀reveal⠀the⠀instability.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀concrete⠀and⠀testable.⠀A⠀document⠀can⠀record⠀a⠀specific⠀change:⠀a⠀movement⠀performed⠀correctly⠀once,⠀a⠀resource⠀used⠀without⠀waste,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀instruction⠀finally⠀applied.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀can⠀test⠀that⠀change⠀under⠀harder⠀conditions⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀the⠀entries⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀uneven⠀development.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀documents⠀simply⠀announce⠀a⠀new⠀rank⠀or⠀level.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀its⠀author⠀and⠀situation.⠀A⠀training⠀note⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀teacher⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀teacher⠀said⠀it.⠀A⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀friend⠀may⠀conceal⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀exaggerate⠀a⠀success.⠀A⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀superior⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀that⠀disrupted⠀the⠀work.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀from⠀the⠀document's⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀word⠀choice,⠀but⠀the⠀document⠀itself⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.\n\nUse⠀material⠀traces⠀where⠀they⠀matter:⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line,⠀a⠀torn⠀edge,⠀a⠀note⠀written⠀twice,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent.⠀These⠀traces⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀writer's⠀state⠀or⠀the⠀event,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀page.⠀End⠀the⠀sequence⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀The⠀next⠀document⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀progression⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀resolve⠀every⠀gap⠀or⠀correct⠀every⠀misreading.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀comfort⠀support⠀the⠀progression⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it.⠀Show⠀practical⠀care⠀that⠀helps⠀the⠀character⠀train,⠀recover,⠀or⠀continue⠀ordinary⠀work:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared,⠀a⠀wound⠀tended,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀repaired,⠀a⠀quiet⠀place⠀found,⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference⠀remembered.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀care⠀in⠀specific⠀detail:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀food,⠀the⠀clean⠀bandage,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀perception⠀unstable⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀comfort⠀into⠀a⠀threat.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀miss⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀kind⠀gesture⠀because⠀attention⠀drifted.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀peaceful⠀moment.⠀A⠀kind⠀word⠀may⠀be⠀misheard⠀or⠀interpreted⠀according⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀fear.⠀Let⠀the⠀warmth⠀remain⠀real⠀and⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀fully⠀receive⠀it.⠀The⠀helper's⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀false⠀because⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀struggles⠀to⠀trust⠀it.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀help⠀without⠀asking⠀for⠀an⠀explanation.⠀A⠀teacher⠀may⠀offer⠀encouragement⠀without⠀demanding⠀gratitude.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀comfort⠀awkwardly,⠀partially,⠀or⠀silently.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀name⠀their⠀feelings⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀underlying⠀hurt⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀concrete.⠀The⠀comfort⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀possible:⠀a⠀rested⠀body,⠀a⠀repaired⠀tool,⠀a⠀clear⠀instruction,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀calm⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀character⠀focus.⠀Show⠀the⠀result⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀itself.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀better⠀after⠀the⠀care,⠀or⠀the⠀care⠀may⠀simply⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀failure⠀easier⠀to⠀bear.⠀Either⠀outcome⠀is⠀valid;⠀the⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀breakthrough.\n\nPreserve⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀The⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀uniformly⠀agreeable.⠀A⠀helper⠀may⠀be⠀gruff⠀while⠀still⠀being⠀kind.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀resist⠀the⠀care⠀or⠀feel⠀undeserving⠀of⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀friction⠀remain⠀manageable⠀without⠀erasing⠀it.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure,⠀a⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀frame⠀a⠀training⠀scene⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀capability⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀A⠀technique⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀reputation,⠀a⠀community's⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀that⠀others⠀remember.⠀The⠀gain⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀personal;⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀seen⠀or⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀expected⠀of⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀formal⠀narration⠀itself⠀show⠀the⠀Akira⠀profile's⠀instability.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀hesitate,⠀revise,⠀or⠀interrupt⠀its⠀own⠀account.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀confident⠀claim⠀and⠀then⠀qualify⠀it.⠀A⠀description⠀may⠀fix⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀detail⠀before⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀event.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀a⠀composed⠀paragraph⠀and⠀shift⠀its⠀direction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀readable⠀and⠀deliberate,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀smooth⠀the⠀instability⠀into⠀polished⠀omniscience.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀waver⠀even⠀within⠀the⠀formal⠀structure.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀concrete⠀and⠀testable.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀attempting⠀a⠀skill,⠀receiving⠀feedback,⠀using⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀recognizing⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it.⠀A⠀movement⠀may⠀be⠀understood⠀intellectually⠀but⠀still⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀body.⠀A⠀gain⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀small,⠀specific⠀result:⠀a⠀stance⠀held⠀longer,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀without⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀correction⠀applied⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀give⠀the⠀gain⠀its⠀consequence⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀physical⠀test.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀where⠀relevant.⠀A⠀public⠀demonstration⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀practice.⠀A⠀formal⠀report⠀may⠀conceal⠀the⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀that⠀disrupted⠀the⠀work.⠀A⠀private⠀reflection⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀needing⠀help⠀or⠀the⠀fear⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀will⠀be⠀taken⠀away.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀these⠀registers⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions,⠀keeping⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀without⠀granting⠀other⠀characters⠀access⠀to⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀use⠀longer⠀sentences,⠀subordinate⠀clauses,⠀and⠀measured⠀judgment,⠀but⠀the⠀characters'⠀speech⠀should⠀remain⠀their⠀own.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀elaborate⠀or⠀archaic.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀social⠀consequence,⠀a⠀private⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attempt,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀lesson⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀instability.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀already⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀audience⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place.⠀Make⠀the⠀occasion⠀practical:⠀someone⠀wants⠀an⠀explanation,⠀needs⠀advice,⠀doubts⠀the⠀teller's⠀ability,⠀or⠀must⠀decide⠀whether⠀to⠀trust⠀the⠀teller⠀with⠀a⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀address⠀the⠀audience⠀directly⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀speech⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀request,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀memory.\n\nBegin⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀attempt⠀to⠀learn⠀or⠀use⠀a⠀capability.⠀Use⠀field⠀notes⠀to⠀describe⠀what⠀happened:⠀the⠀exact⠀action⠀tried,⠀the⠀feedback⠀received,⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀attempt⠀failed⠀or⠀partially⠀worked.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀frame⠀voice⠀announce⠀the⠀lesson⠀early.⠀The⠀teller⠀should⠀mostly⠀speak⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀lived⠀the⠀attempt,⠀using⠀what⠀that⠀earlier⠀self⠀noticed.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀hear⠀the⠀effort⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀shortfall.\n\nUse⠀Akira's⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀telling⠀visible⠀inside⠀the⠀frame.⠀When⠀noise⠀crosses⠀the⠀room,⠀an⠀association⠀intrudes,⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀shifts,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀lose⠀the⠀thread⠀and⠀pause⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀remembered⠀action⠀mattered.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀concrete⠀question⠀before⠀the⠀teller⠀naturally⠀resumes.⠀On⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀tale,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀re-open⠀a⠀detail⠀instead⠀of⠀sliding⠀straight⠀back⠀into⠀sequence:⠀repeat⠀the⠀last⠀action⠀with⠀sharper⠀focus,⠀correct⠀how⠀they⠀described⠀an⠀instructor's⠀words,⠀or⠀admit⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀then⠀tell⠀what⠀had⠀gone⠀wrong.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀material⠀mark⠀progression⠀across⠀the⠀return.⠀Restate⠀one⠀exact⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀object,⠀or⠀movement⠀from⠀before⠀the⠀break,⠀but⠀place⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀teller's⠀later⠀understanding.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀lacked⠀or⠀what⠀later⠀practice⠀made⠀possible.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀changed⠀capability,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀outer⠀action⠀remains⠀incomplete.⠀Show⠀a⠀principle⠀becoming⠀usable:⠀the⠀teller⠀names⠀a⠀method,⠀then⠀demonstrates⠀through⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene⠀that⠀they⠀once⠀knew⠀it⠀only⠀in⠀words⠀and⠀later⠀acquired⠀it⠀in⠀response.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀audience's⠀pressure⠀active.⠀Their⠀question⠀or⠀expression⠀can⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀reveal⠀not⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀once⠀did⠀but⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀still⠀avoiding.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀audience⠀correct⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory;⠀instead⠀let⠀their⠀need⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀delays.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀withholds⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀cost,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀motive⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀relationship:⠀shame⠀before⠀this⠀listener,⠀fear⠀of⠀being⠀judged⠀unfit,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀to⠀someone⠀still⠀implicated⠀in⠀the⠀story.\n\nEnd⠀while⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀frame⠀and⠀embedded⠀tale⠀is⠀still⠀doing⠀work.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀be⠀changed⠀in⠀belief,⠀moved⠀to⠀act,⠀or⠀left⠀uncertain;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀they⠀finish⠀explaining⠀the⠀hardest⠀part.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀sealed⠀lesson,⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀mastery,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀What⠀develops⠀is⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀capability⠀and⠀cost,⠀built⠀through⠀an⠀interrupted,⠀situated⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\r\nUse⠀condensed,⠀present-focused⠀narration⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt.⠀Begin⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀exercise,⠀test,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀task⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀register⠀on⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀grip,⠀the⠀delay⠀in⠀a⠀phrase,⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀movement⠀breaks.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀keep⠀close⠀to⠀that⠀experience,⠀with⠀short⠀attention⠀units⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀acting⠀and⠀longer⠀explanatory⠀sentences⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀interpret⠀results.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀an⠀official⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀skill⠀before⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀a⠀failed⠀execution.\r\n\r\nLet⠀institutions⠀speak⠀through⠀circumscribed⠀documents.⠀Establish⠀the⠀relevant⠀register⠀concretely:⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀an⠀inspection⠀order,⠀a⠀training⠀instruction,⠀a⠀progress⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀reminder.⠀Let⠀such⠀material⠀name⠀advancement⠀in⠀clean,⠀stage-like⠀terms.⠀Then⠀place⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀intercepted⠀experience.⠀Show⠀the⠀body⠀performing⠀under⠀the⠀institution's⠀label:⠀the⠀rank⠀is⠀recorded,⠀the⠀certificate⠀is⠀prepared,⠀or⠀the⠀standard⠀is⠀declared⠀satisfied,⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀contains⠀a⠀stutter,⠀a⠀false⠀start,⠀a⠀misinterpreted⠀command,⠀or⠀a⠀correction⠀repeated⠀without⠀result.⠀Let⠀the⠀irony⠀stay⠀within⠀the⠀presentation⠀and⠀the⠀event,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀narrator's⠀comment.\r\n\r\nMake⠀the⠀institution⠀socially⠀active⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative.⠀A⠀supervisor,⠀examiner,⠀landlord,⠀clerk,⠀or⠀elder⠀may⠀enforce⠀the⠀official⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀something⠀from⠀that⠀person:⠀a⠀second⠀attempt,⠀a⠀work⠀shift,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀delay⠀on⠀a⠀debt.⠀Let⠀practical⠀speech⠀press⠀against⠀interrupted⠀attention.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀loses⠀the⠀thread⠀of⠀an⠀instruction,⠀gap⠀in⠀hostile⠀packaging,⠀then⠀promptly⠀recover:⠀a⠀coercive⠀follow-up⠀question,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀factual⠀report.\r\n\r\nLet⠀thinking⠀shift⠀between⠀two⠀orders⠀of⠀speech,⠀not⠀simply⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀silence.⠀During⠀an⠀attempt,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀echo⠀institutional⠀language⠀inward:⠀finally⠀the⠀standard,⠀no⠀further⠀correction,⠀progress⠀shown.⠀During⠀the⠀failure,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀may⠀repeat⠀with⠀the⠀stress⠀shifted:⠀finally⠀the⠀standard,⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀still⠀cannot⠀hold.⠀This⠀should⠀be⠀character-specific⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀habit.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀reports⠀about⠀themselves⠀and⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀observes.⠀A⠀bystander⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀attempt⠀is⠀improving⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀experiences⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀collapse.⠀An⠀inspector⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀performance⠀adequate⠀while⠀a⠀teacher⠀names⠀the⠀flaw⠀the⠀form⠀cannot⠀show.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀renewed⠀attempts,⠀using⠀echoes⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀action.⠀Repeat⠀one⠀setup:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase,⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀into⠀a⠀task,⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀observing⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀position.⠀Change⠀a⠀local⠀detail⠀of⠀capability⠀or⠀attention⠀between⠀attempts,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀improvement.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀no⠀longer⠀loses⠀the⠀same⠀point⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀catches⠀the⠀noise⠀they⠀missed⠀before.⠀Allow⠀the⠀new⠀attempt⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀different⠀limitation⠀immediately.⠀A⠀successful⠀movement⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀mistake;⠀a⠀recognized⠀answer⠀may⠀arrive⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀matter.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀satirical⠀route⠀become⠀mere⠀mockery.⠀An⠀authority⠀whose⠀account⠀is⠀partly⠀false⠀may⠀still⠀describe⠀a⠀real⠀flaw.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀also⠀misread⠀the⠀institution.⠀Conclude⠀inside⠀the⠀continuing⠀social⠀situation,⠀with⠀the⠀attempted⠀movement,⠀its⠀record,⠀and⠀its⠀cost⠀still⠀interacting.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀resolution⠀where⠀the⠀state⠀ledger⠀and⠀the⠀lived⠀body⠀finally⠀agree.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\r\nWrite⠀each⠀learning⠀encounter⠀as⠀an⠀exchange⠀shaped⠀by⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀material⠀need.⠀Establish⠀why⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀cannot⠀simply⠀practice⠀alone:⠀the⠀method⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀lineage,⠀the⠀building⠀is⠀controlled,⠀the⠀instructor's⠀access⠀is⠀conditional,⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀funds⠀practice⠀is⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀patron,⠀or⠀the⠀place⠀itself⠀imposes⠀risk⠀after⠀dark.⠀Let⠀the⠀current⠀need⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀visible,⠀not⠀merely⠀atmospheric.⠀The⠀character⠀wants⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀training⠀space,⠀an⠀introduction,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀right⠀to⠀continue.\r\n\r\nGive⠀the⠀teaching⠀body⠀and⠀setting⠀precise⠀urban⠀detail.⠀Notice⠀the⠀former⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀street⠀noise⠀entering⠀through⠀the⠀upper⠀floor,⠀a⠀working⠀mechanism⠀still⠀present⠀beside⠀newer⠀equipment,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀material⠀under⠀cleaning⠀fluid,⠀a⠀name⠀stenciled⠀over.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀to⠀carry⠀inherited⠀authority⠀into⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀gesture⠀learned⠀by⠀a⠀previous⠀generation⠀may⠀be⠀demonstrated⠀in⠀a⠀converted⠀warehouse⠀and⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀narrower⠀rooms.⠀The⠀old⠀method⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀site⠀should⠀impose⠀different⠀conditions⠀on⠀the⠀learner's⠀body.\n\nLet⠀Akira's⠀perception⠀make⠀the⠀encounter⠀rough⠀rather⠀than⠀florid.⠀Script⠀an⠀ordinary⠀interruption:⠀a⠀passing⠀argument⠀outside,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀timer,⠀a⠀mechanical⠀cough,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀memory⠀surfacing⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀effort.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀loses⠀when⠀attention⠀splits:⠀they⠀miss⠀the⠀instructor's⠀first⠀correction,⠀think⠀a⠀remark⠀was⠀meant⠀as⠀a⠀threat,⠀repeat⠀a⠀movement⠀without⠀noticing⠀it⠀changed,⠀or⠀answer⠀with⠀words⠀meant⠀for⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀intrusive⠀memory.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀recover⠀necessary⠀information⠀through⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀insistence⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀repetition.⠀Do⠀not⠀substitute⠀a⠀vague⠀sense⠀of⠀dread⠀for⠀lost⠀practical⠀detail.\n\nMake⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀other⠀party⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀learner's⠀capability.⠀A⠀patron⠀may⠀want⠀the⠀trainee⠀to⠀succeed⠀while⠀wanting⠀control⠀over⠀what⠀the⠀success⠀will⠀serve.⠀A⠀mentor⠀may⠀teach⠀carefully⠀and⠀also⠀prepare⠀the⠀learner⠀to⠀continue⠀obligations⠀the⠀mentor⠀accepted.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀safe⠀place⠀to⠀practice⠀and⠀still⠀repeat⠀the⠀lineage's⠀ideas⠀about⠀who⠀deserves⠀instruction.⠀Let⠀help⠀and⠀pressure⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀act.⠀Show⠀private⠀desire⠀alongside⠀caution:⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀want⠀this⠀person's⠀respect⠀even⠀while⠀checking⠀their⠀words⠀for⠀a⠀condition⠀or⠀a⠀threat.⠀A⠀trusted⠀moment⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀uncertain⠀without⠀flipping⠀into⠀betrayal.\n\nShow⠀progression⠀through⠀repeated⠀trials⠀whose⠀terms⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀inherited⠀method.⠀Let⠀an⠀older⠀instructor⠀describe⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀capability⠀in⠀elevated⠀or⠀warning⠀language,⠀then⠀render⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀can⠀actually⠀do.⠀The⠀method⠀may⠀work:⠀a⠀movement,⠀procedure,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀judgment⠀may⠀finally⠀hold.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀that⠀success⠀cancel⠀the⠀lineage's⠀cost.⠀The⠀body⠀may⠀be⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀practice,⠀the⠀learner⠀may⠀now⠀understand⠀a⠀price⠀they⠀were⠀not⠀told,⠀or⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀patron's⠀demand⠀more⠀specific.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀honest⠀transfer⠀of⠀skill⠀from⠀easy⠀conversion.⠀The⠀instructor's⠀account⠀may⠀contain⠀true⠀knowledge⠀and⠀still⠀serve⠀old⠀power.\n\nKeep⠀capability⠀verifiable⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀setting.⠀A⠀lesson⠀may⠀include⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀learner⠀could⠀not⠀previously⠀complete;⠀a⠀job⠀may⠀demand⠀the⠀skill⠀effectively;⠀another⠀practitioner⠀may⠀observe⠀and⠀correct⠀a⠀real⠀flaw.⠀Numerical⠀ranks⠀may⠀appear⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀uses⠀them,⠀and⠀should⠀then⠀affect⠀access⠀or⠀expectation⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀active⠀exchange:⠀some⠀intimacy⠀has⠀shifted,⠀a⠀further⠀cost⠀has⠀surfaced,⠀or⠀the⠀learner⠀understands⠀their⠀next⠀step.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀healer⠀edit,⠀completed⠀advancement,⠀or⠀the⠀fall⠀of⠀a⠀supporting⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀as⠀a⠀participant⠀composing⠀a⠀retrospective⠀account⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀needs⠀to⠀understand⠀how⠀the⠀teller⠀came⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀capability,⠀failure,⠀or⠀obligation.⠀Establish⠀the⠀present⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose⠀without⠀a⠀formal⠀opening⠀essay:⠀the⠀speaker⠀may⠀address⠀a⠀younger⠀learner,⠀an⠀employer,⠀an⠀official⠀record,⠀a⠀community⠀gathering,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀before⠀going⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀event.⠀Let⠀the⠀testimony⠀move⠀between⠀present⠀and⠀past⠀by⠀explicit⠀turns⠀of⠀address:⠀You⠀must⠀understand⠀what⠀practice⠀was⠀like⠀then;⠀I⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀know⠀how⠀to⠀explain⠀it;⠀Later⠀I⠀learned⠀the⠀name⠀for⠀that⠀failure.\n\nShow⠀the⠀remembered⠀learning⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀lived⠀sequence.⠀Give⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀observer,⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀Include⠀concrete⠀conditions:⠀the⠀floor⠀where⠀they⠀worked,⠀the⠀time⠀available,⠀the⠀person⠀watching,⠀the⠀wound⠀or⠀fatigue⠀that⠀limited⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀earlier⠀self's⠀understanding⠀stay⠀bounded.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀instructor's⠀exercise⠀had⠀a⠀purpose,⠀but⠀during⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene⠀the⠀exercise⠀felt⠀like⠀punishment⠀or⠀aimless⠀repetition.⠀Keep⠀that⠀earlier⠀feeling⠀alive⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀older⠀voice⠀corrects⠀it.\n\nLet⠀composition⠀itself⠀break⠀in⠀Akira's⠀manner.⠀Use⠀a⠀present-tense⠀interruption⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀assembling⠀a⠀memory:⠀a⠀child⠀calls⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀a⠀vehicle⠀passes,⠀a⠀hand⠀or⠀voice⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀reminds⠀the⠀narrator⠀of⠀the⠀past⠀scene,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀makes⠀the⠀narrator⠀repeat⠀a⠀detail⠀with⠀altered⠀emphasis.⠀After⠀the⠀interruption,⠀resume⠀the⠀testimony⠀not⠀by⠀continuing⠀the⠀story⠀immediately⠀but⠀by⠀recomposing⠀it:⠀I⠀should⠀say⠀that⠀the⠀fall⠀was⠀not⠀the⠀first⠀time;⠀Later⠀someone⠀told⠀me⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀in⠀different⠀words;⠀Now⠀I⠀think⠀the⠀teacher⠀meant.⠀Let⠀the⠀return⠀make⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀memory⠀visible⠀and⠀lets⠀the⠀listener⠀hear⠀judgment⠀forming.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀to⠀measure⠀progression⠀across⠀the⠀composed⠀account.⠀Return⠀to⠀one⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀instruction,⠀or⠀named⠀task⠀at⠀least⠀twice.⠀The⠀first⠀use⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀self:⠀confused,⠀frightened,⠀exhausted,⠀or⠀impressed.⠀A⠀later⠀use⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀acquired⠀understanding⠀or⠀changed⠀capability.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀repeated⠀wording⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀whole⠀meaning.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀more⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀unable⠀to⠀say⠀why⠀the⠀skill⠀became⠀possible.⠀Distinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀knowing⠀the⠀principle⠀and⠀performing⠀it:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀name⠀a⠀method⠀long⠀before⠀the⠀remembered⠀self⠀could⠀follow⠀it⠀or⠀may⠀report⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀made⠀the⠀old⠀failure⠀more⠀intelligible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surrounding⠀life⠀in⠀the⠀testimony⠀without⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀obstacles.⠀A⠀family⠀or⠀household⠀may⠀need⠀the⠀narrator's⠀time;⠀work⠀may⠀interrupt⠀practice;⠀illness,⠀food,⠀money,⠀transit,⠀and⠀recovery⠀may⠀shape⠀when⠀and⠀how⠀training⠀happens.⠀Let⠀these⠀conditions⠀appear⠀as⠀actual⠀events⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀weight:⠀a⠀practice⠀session⠀taken⠀before⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀lesson⠀remembered⠀while⠀carrying⠀water,⠀a⠀recovery⠀that⠀changed⠀how⠀the⠀body⠀moved.⠀Relationships⠀may⠀help⠀the⠀narrator⠀learn,⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀narrator's⠀effort,⠀or⠀make⠀demands⠀that⠀limit⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀relation⠀a⠀hidden⠀teacher⠀or⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀betrayal.⠀Let⠀obligation⠀and⠀instruction⠀coexist⠀with⠀genuine⠀care⠀or⠀ordinary⠀conflict.\n\nLet⠀language⠀and⠀setting⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀as⠀supplied.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀relevant⠀names,⠀terms,⠀accents,⠀foods,⠀rooms,⠀and⠀work⠀without⠀the⠀prompt⠀adding⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀pattern.⠀If⠀code-switching⠀is⠀natural⠀to⠀this⠀teller,⠀preserve⠀it⠀in⠀their⠀mouth;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀English⠀frame⠀around⠀every⠀quoted⠀phrase.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀heavy,⠀angry,⠀funny,⠀ceremonious,⠀or⠀plain⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀and⠀audience.⠀End⠀while⠀the⠀witness⠀is⠀still⠀addressing⠀the⠀present⠀need,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀sealed⠀lesson.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀an⠀audience⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀persuading,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀stop⠀because⠀the⠀next⠀memory⠀is⠀too⠀costly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀dated⠀or⠀time-marked⠀entries.⠀Let⠀each⠀entry⠀begin⠀inside⠀the⠀day⠀or⠀night⠀it⠀records,⠀with⠀the⠀writer⠀already⠀responding⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀attempt⠀at⠀learning⠀or⠀using⠀a⠀capability.⠀Use⠀practical⠀connective⠀signals⠀between⠀entries:⠀the⠀next⠀morning;⠀two⠀days⠀later;⠀after⠀the⠀third⠀session;⠀a⠀month⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀note.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀entry⠀into⠀a⠀uniform⠀progress⠀report.⠀The⠀diary⠀should⠀sometimes⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀fragment⠀that⠀stayed⠀with⠀the⠀writer:⠀one⠀repeated⠀exercise,⠀a⠀phrase⠀overheard,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀a⠀failure⠀the⠀writer⠀cannot⠀yet⠀describe.\n\nLet⠀the⠀entry⠀form⠀make⠀temporal⠀gaps⠀meaningful.⠀A⠀stated⠀period⠀between⠀entries⠀can⠀contain⠀a⠀changed⠀circumstance,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀not⠀automatically⠀infer⠀that⠀absence⠀means⠀confession.⠀If⠀the⠀writer⠀stopped⠀recording⠀after⠀a⠀failure,⠀return⠀later⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀new⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀sentence⠀about⠀being⠀unable⠀to⠀write:⠀the⠀lamp⠀had⠀gone⠀out;⠀I⠀could⠀not⠀make⠀my⠀hand⠀hold⠀still;⠀I⠀wrote⠀the⠀part⠀I⠀could⠀bear⠀and⠀stopped.⠀When⠀the⠀writer⠀resumes,⠀let⠀the⠀new⠀entry⠀refer⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀action⠀in⠀another⠀register,⠀perhaps⠀with⠀new⠀knowledge⠀or⠀still⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀confusion.\n\nShape⠀each⠀entry's⠀perception⠀around⠀Akira-like⠀interruption⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀form⠀dissolve.⠀Let⠀an⠀entry⠀pause⠀mid-line⠀or⠀mid-thought⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀is⠀called⠀away,⠀when⠀sound⠀breaks⠀in,⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀shifts⠀the⠀subject.⠀Resume⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀entry⠀with⠀a⠀fresh⠀start⠀or⠀a⠀correction:⠀I⠀did⠀not⠀mean⠀that;⠀the⠀word⠀was⠀not⠀mine;⠀I⠀thought⠀I⠀heard⠀X,⠀but⠀it⠀was⠀only⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀door;⠀now⠀I⠀cannot⠀recover⠀the⠀order.⠀Preserve⠀a⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀report⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀note⠀someone⠀else's⠀words⠀or⠀action⠀and⠀then⠀record⠀that⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀tell⠀whether⠀those⠀words⠀were⠀meant⠀to⠀correct,⠀warn,⠀or⠀dismiss.\n\nRecord⠀attempts⠀with⠀enough⠀material⠀specificity⠀to⠀make⠀progress⠀legible.⠀Include⠀the⠀physical⠀or⠀practical⠀task:⠀a⠀grip,⠀a⠀step,⠀a⠀phrase⠀to⠀repeat,⠀a⠀count,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀sentence⠀to⠀read⠀aloud.⠀Give⠀the⠀failure⠀its⠀local⠀cause⠀where⠀possible:⠀the⠀hands⠀moved⠀too⠀soon,⠀the⠀voice⠀dropped,⠀the⠀attention⠀left⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀point⠀as⠀always,⠀the⠀remembered⠀command⠀changed⠀under⠀pressure.⠀When⠀improvement⠀appears,⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀changed⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀label:⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀now⠀repeat⠀the⠀movement,⠀or⠀caught⠀the⠀sound⠀they⠀had⠀missed,⠀or⠀finished⠀the⠀sentence⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀lose.⠀Then⠀expose⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀principle⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀fails,⠀or⠀may⠀execute⠀the⠀action⠀once⠀and⠀lose⠀it⠀in⠀company.⠀A⠀strength⠀may⠀improve⠀alongside⠀an⠀unchanged⠀weakness;⠀do⠀not⠀flatten⠀that⠀unevenness.\n\nLet⠀the⠀miscellany⠀enter⠀without⠀becoming⠀scenery.⠀Ordinary⠀life⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀progression:⠀work,⠀food,⠀weather,⠀a⠀household⠀dispute,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀train⠀or⠀road,⠀a⠀recurring⠀sound.⠀Keep⠀these⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀writer's⠀immediate⠀attention⠀or⠀need.⠀A⠀note⠀about⠀weather⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀it⠀changed⠀the⠀practice⠀or⠀because⠀it⠀entered⠀a⠀long⠀dull⠀interval.⠀A⠀remembered⠀conversation⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀to⠀something⠀the⠀writer⠀believed.⠀Do⠀not⠀demand⠀seasonal⠀allusions,⠀quietness,⠀or⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀recognizable⠀settings.⠀The⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀specific⠀writer's⠀voice:⠀direct,⠀circuitous,⠀formal,⠀comic,⠀angry,⠀tender,⠀or⠀withheld,⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀episode⠀and⠀the⠀writer's⠀temperament.\n\nEnd⠀an⠀entry⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀its⠀recorded⠀attention.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀attempt,⠀after⠀a⠀partial⠀understanding,⠀or⠀while⠀still⠀saying⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson,⠀a⠀resolution,⠀or⠀a⠀secret⠀behind⠀every⠀silence.⠀What⠀accumulates⠀across⠀entries⠀is⠀the⠀writer's⠀developing⠀ability⠀and⠀changing⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀sealed⠀self-explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nKeep⠀the⠀treatment⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀immediate⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person,⠀preserving⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀changes⠀of⠀perspective.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀attempt:⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀underway,⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀employer⠀expects⠀a⠀result,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀repeating⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before.⠀Let⠀the⠀initial⠀perception⠀stay⠀concrete⠀and⠀local:⠀the⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀word⠀heard⠀over⠀street⠀noise,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀mirror⠀or⠀doorway,⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀another⠀person⠀too⠀close⠀or⠀too⠀far.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀the⠀setting⠀as⠀a⠀panorama;⠀reveal⠀the⠀room,⠀building,⠀street,⠀or⠀household⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attends⠀to⠀while⠀moving.\n\nLet⠀Akira-like⠀intrusion⠀work⠀structurally⠀within⠀the⠀close⠀point⠀of⠀view.⠀When⠀a⠀sound,⠀memory,⠀comment,⠀or⠀stray⠀thought⠀breaks⠀into⠀an⠀action,⠀shift⠀the⠀syntax⠀rather⠀than⠀leaving⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀a⠀delayed⠀clause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀a⠀fragment⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀unfinished⠀movement,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀reference⠀to⠀something⠀outside⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀Bring⠀the⠀action⠀back⠀by⠀attaching⠀the⠀interruption⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀cost:⠀the⠀hand⠀stopped,⠀the⠀instruction⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀repeated,⠀the⠀character⠀answered⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀name⠀or⠀the⠀wrong⠀tense,⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀to⠀act⠀passed.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀reconstructs⠀what⠀they⠀missed,⠀keep⠀the⠀reconstruction⠀partial⠀and⠀marked⠀by⠀their⠀own⠀habit⠀of⠀interpretation.⠀They⠀may⠀be⠀right,⠀wrong,⠀or⠀unable⠀to⠀settle⠀the⠀question.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀visible⠀through⠀repeated⠀tasks⠀occurring⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀material⠀world.⠀Return⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀a⠀recognizable⠀place,⠀posture,⠀tool,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀partner.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀measure⠀change⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀does:⠀the⠀movement⠀holds⠀a⠀little⠀longer,⠀the⠀words⠀arrive,⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀correction⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀spoken,⠀or⠀a⠀practiced⠀response⠀works⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Then⠀complicate⠀the⠀change.⠀The⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀different⠀weakness,⠀require⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀character⠀had⠀not⠀expected,⠀or⠀fail⠀in⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀matters.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀failure⠀real⠀even⠀after⠀improvement;⠀later⠀competence⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀experienced⠀while⠀learning.\n\nUse⠀the⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀setting⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀learning,⠀not⠀atmosphere⠀alone.⠀Let⠀money,⠀work,⠀transport,⠀family,⠀household⠀duties,⠀noise,⠀space,⠀light,⠀and⠀recovery⠀affect⠀when⠀and⠀how⠀practice⠀happens.⠀A⠀session⠀may⠀be⠀cut⠀short⠀because⠀someone⠀needs⠀the⠀room,⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀travel,⠀because⠀the⠀body⠀is⠀tired⠀from⠀work,⠀or⠀because⠀another⠀person's⠀presence⠀changes⠀attention.⠀Show⠀these⠀pressures⠀as⠀ongoing⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀helpful⠀and⠀harmful⠀relationships⠀exist⠀together:⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀can⠀support⠀the⠀practice⠀and⠀still⠀demand⠀time;⠀a⠀teacher⠀can⠀correct⠀a⠀real⠀fault⠀and⠀still⠀misjudge⠀the⠀character's⠀situation;⠀a⠀companion⠀can⠀offer⠀encouragement⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀specific⠀expectation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀relationship⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀betrayal.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀attempt,⠀not⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀plot.⠀Give⠀the⠀character's⠀attention,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀during⠀the⠀specific⠀action⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀interval⠀after⠀a⠀failure.⠀Keep⠀those⠀intervals⠀proportional⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀state.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀dread⠀or⠀distraction⠀may⠀be⠀brief;⠀a⠀long⠀return⠀home⠀after⠀a⠀public⠀failure⠀may⠀gather⠀many⠀thoughts⠀without⠀any⠀visible⠀action.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀character⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀next,⠀misreading⠀a⠀remark,⠀or⠀discovering⠀an⠀explanation⠀only⠀partly.⠀The⠀private⠀material⠀should⠀reveal⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀changed⠀by⠀learning⠀and⠀by⠀the⠀conditions⠀around⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀fantastic⠀or⠀marvelous⠀route⠀to⠀add⠀a⠀capability⠀or⠀event⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀permit.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀includes⠀ordinary⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀realities,⠀the⠀narration⠀discovers⠀meaning⠀inside⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀names⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀a⠀generic⠀street,⠀household,⠀or⠀intonation⠀to⠀fulfill⠀this⠀style.⠀End⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀remains⠀engaged⠀in⠀the⠀developing⠀situation,⠀with⠀no⠀required⠀completion:⠀the⠀attempt⠀may⠀be⠀finished,⠀interrupted,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀put⠀off,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀what⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀concrete⠀attempt.⠀State⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀lines:⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀one⠀pass,⠀one⠀shot,⠀one⠀sentence,⠀one⠀transaction,⠀or⠀one⠀test⠀left,⠀and⠀something⠀specific⠀depends⠀on⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀mechanical⠀detail⠀visible⠀without⠀pausing⠀for⠀a⠀description⠀block.⠀Name⠀the⠀unfamiliar⠀term,⠀motion,⠀or⠀rule⠀by⠀using⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀letting⠀the⠀consequences⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀If⠀a⠀second⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀is⠀needed,⠀place⠀it⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀it⠀or⠀where⠀a⠀failure⠀makes⠀it⠀relevant.\n\nBreak⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀short⠀visual⠀and⠀physical⠀beats.⠀Mark⠀each⠀change⠀of⠀position,⠀grip,⠀target,⠀speaker,⠀or⠀angle⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sentence.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀doing⠀at⠀each⠀attempt.⠀Put⠀dialogue⠀in⠀separate⠀easy⠀lines,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀space⠀around⠀dialogue⠀uncluttered.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀through⠀a⠀room,⠀show⠀the⠀move⠀or⠀the⠀obstacle⠀in⠀physical⠀terms:⠀crossing⠀the⠀mat,⠀raising⠀the⠀hand,⠀turning⠀toward⠀the⠀voice,⠀stepping⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀rail.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀long⠀recall⠀or⠀setting⠀description⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀attempt⠀has⠀begun.\n\nTreat⠀attention⠀loss⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀mechanical⠀event.⠀When⠀noise⠀enters,⠀an⠀association⠀cuts⠀across⠀the⠀attempt,⠀or⠀a⠀comment⠀reaches⠀the⠀character⠀late,⠀render⠀the⠀break⠀in⠀an⠀interior⠀beat.⠀Show⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀split⠀in⠀the⠀action:⠀the⠀movement⠀starts,⠀the⠀thought⠀arrives,⠀the⠀instruction⠀is⠀heard⠀as⠀a⠀fragment,⠀the⠀grip⠀or⠀timing⠀fails.⠀Use⠀the⠀break⠀to⠀cost⠀something⠀specific.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀the⠀wrong⠀word,⠀miss⠀the⠀next⠀move,⠀lose⠀the⠀rhythm⠀they⠀had⠀just⠀found,⠀or⠀act⠀too⠀early.⠀Then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀external⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀visible⠀recovery:⠀the⠀teacher⠀repeats⠀the⠀command,⠀the⠀opponent⠀resumes,⠀the⠀character⠀restarts⠀the⠀count⠀or⠀the⠀action.⠀The⠀interruption⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀body⠀can⠀sustain,⠀not⠀simply⠀delay⠀the⠀event.\n\nShow⠀growth⠀through⠀repetition⠀and⠀feedback.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀make⠀the⠀same⠀attempt⠀more⠀than⠀once.⠀The⠀first⠀attempt⠀contains⠀a⠀concrete⠀failure;⠀the⠀correction⠀names⠀or⠀indicates⠀what⠀changed;⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail⠀at⠀a⠀new⠀point,⠀or⠀work⠀only⠀until⠀pressure⠀alters⠀it.⠀Ground⠀improvement⠀in⠀observable⠀behavior:⠀the⠀hand⠀stays,⠀the⠀phrase⠀lands,⠀the⠀step⠀arrives,⠀the⠀target⠀is⠀reached.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀character⠀as⠀stronger⠀or⠀more⠀skilled⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀showing⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀accomplish.⠀A⠀success⠀can⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀brief,⠀followed⠀immediately⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀demand.⠀If⠀the⠀skill⠀still⠀fails⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition,⠀show⠀that⠀failure⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀vocabulary.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀match⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀event.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀success⠀with⠀relief,⠀suspicion,⠀fatigue,⠀humor,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀simple⠀focus.⠀Panic⠀may⠀make⠀thought⠀rapid⠀and⠀partial;⠀calm⠀may⠀allow⠀longer⠀internal⠀reasoning;⠀embarrassment⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀rush⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Attach⠀the⠀reaction⠀to⠀the⠀local⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀An⠀enemy,⠀examiner,⠀customer,⠀teammate,⠀or⠀concerned⠀relative⠀may⠀speak⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀finished⠀processing.⠀A⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀contradict⠀the⠀spoken⠀reply⠀or⠀perfectly⠀match⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀grounded⠀in⠀that⠀relationship⠀or⠀that⠀pressure,⠀not⠀imposed.\n\nStop⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀reaches⠀an⠀existing⠀boundary.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀finish⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀partial⠀success,⠀a⠀broken⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀opening.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀required⠀cliffhanger,⠀completed⠀lesson,⠀confession,⠀or⠀final⠀line.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀recognize⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀learned⠀and⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀tried⠀next,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀says⠀it.⠀Continue⠀the⠀story⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀situation⠀still⠀open:⠀the⠀teacher⠀waits,⠀the⠀job⠀is⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀steps⠀back⠀to⠀begin⠀again.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀attention.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀skill,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀hold⠀the⠀relevant⠀sensation,⠀sound,⠀or⠀image⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀attempt⠀present,⠀then⠀let⠀noise,⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀speech⠀cut⠀across⠀it.⠀The⠀break⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀return⠀to,⠀what⠀the⠀interruption⠀alters,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unsteady⠀after⠀the⠀attempt⠀reveal⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀capability⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀clean⠀success⠀would.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀as⠀markers⠀of⠀practice.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀particular⠀surface,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀again,⠀but⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀carry⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀recurrence⠀a⠀decorative⠀refrain;⠀it⠀should⠀register⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀notices⠀or⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀or⠀something⠀still⠀resistant⠀to⠀attention.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀comparison⠀to⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀attempt.⠀The⠀image⠀should⠀be⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀before⠀it⠀completes.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀should⠀provide⠀contrast⠀against⠀the⠀figurative⠀movement,⠀especially⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀tired,⠀confused,⠀or⠀acting⠀on⠀partial⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀speech⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀pressure⠀on⠀attention,⠀but⠀their⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge.⠀Speech⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀or⠀distraction⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀catches,⠀misses,⠀or⠀reconstructs,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀exchange⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀perception.⠀Improvement⠀may⠀be⠀uneven;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀clarity⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀lapse,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀unevenness⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀narrating⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀score.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀through⠀revisiting.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀practices⠀or⠀gains⠀a⠀new⠀capability,⠀allow⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀touch⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion:⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀a⠀person⠀no⠀longer⠀present,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀now⠀understood⠀differently.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀illustrate⠀progress.⠀It⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀memory⠀is⠀held.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀relationship⠀to⠀a⠀skill.⠀A⠀movement⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀instruction⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀automatic;⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀confused⠀may⠀now⠀arrive⠀with⠀its⠀old⠀confusion⠀still⠀attached.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀note⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost⠀in⠀the⠀gaining,⠀but⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀ability⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasure.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.\n\nUse⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀or⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀as⠀a⠀route⠀into⠀reflection.⠀When⠀noise⠀or⠀distraction⠀breaks⠀the⠀character's⠀attention,⠀the⠀break⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment.⠀The⠀connection⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀history,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀Speech⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀a⠀partial⠀exchange⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀later⠀reconstructs,⠀and⠀the⠀reconstruction⠀may⠀be⠀uncertain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reflection⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association,⠀but⠀the⠀remembered⠀material⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀know.⠀Improvement⠀remains⠀uneven:⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀lingering⠀inability,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀let⠀that⠀coexistence⠀stand⠀without⠀forcing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀route.⠀The⠀account⠀of⠀practice⠀and⠀improvement⠀is⠀given⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀is⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀teller⠀could⠀know,⠀have⠀heard,⠀or⠀have⠀witnessed.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀speech⠀is⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀or⠀attention,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀interruption,⠀repeat⠀what⠀was⠀caught,⠀or⠀admit⠀what⠀was⠀missed.⠀The⠀audience's⠀questions⠀or⠀responses⠀can⠀press⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀revise⠀an⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀the⠀revision⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀abstract⠀lesson.\n\nMake⠀progression⠀legible⠀through⠀recounted⠀attempts.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀describe⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀once⠀do,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀effort.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀teller's⠀report⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience:⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀relate⠀visible⠀actions⠀and⠀reported⠀speech,⠀but⠀cannot⠀supply⠀the⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀framing⠀situation⠀grants⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀familiarity⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀complicate⠀the⠀telling;⠀someone⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀differently.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀open⠀and⠀close⠀naturally.⠀The⠀storytelling⠀situation⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀retelling,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀a⠀definite⠀occasion⠀with⠀speakers⠀and⠀listeners.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀atmosphere,⠀honor⠀code,⠀or⠀mystical⠀register.⠀The⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀remain⠀those⠀already⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀progression⠀uneven.⠀A⠀successful⠀attempt⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀alongside⠀a⠀lapse,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀contradiction.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀leave⠀with⠀a⠀partial⠀understanding,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀continues.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀for⠀each⠀attempt⠀at⠀improvement.⠀A⠀detail⠀should⠀earn⠀its⠀place⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀perceive,⠀hold,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀in⠀the⠀moment.⠀When⠀attention⠀breaks,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀break⠀with⠀it:⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀interruption,⠀and⠀what⠀follows⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀lost⠀or⠀recovered.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀lapse⠀unless⠀the⠀explanation⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀knowing⠀and⠀executing⠀visible⠀through⠀action.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀perform⠀it;⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀failed⠀attempt⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀gap.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀appears,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀beyond⠀reach,⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀stay⠀present⠀without⠀commentary.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀to⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable.⠀If⠀noise⠀or⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀cuts⠀across⠀speech,⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀fragment⠀the⠀character⠀caught.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀rest⠀from⠀the⠀response⠀or⠀the⠀later⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀moved⠀from⠀one⠀attempt⠀to⠀the⠀next,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀interpretation⠀is⠀uncertain.\n\nLet⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀brevity⠀to⠀hide⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀or⠀to⠀grant⠀the⠀narrator⠀knowledge⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀improvement⠀appears⠀through⠀ordinary⠀activity.⠀A⠀practice⠀session,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀recovery⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀progression⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀perceives,⠀recalls,⠀and⠀privately⠀understands.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀announce⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀summarize⠀a⠀stat⠀change;⠀let⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀attempt⠀or⠀complete.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀shifts⠀in⠀attention.⠀When⠀noise⠀or⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀interrupts⠀the⠀character,⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀perception⠀to⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀mechanical⠀break.⠀The⠀transition⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀interruption's⠀effect⠀legible:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀misses,⠀what⠀returns,⠀and⠀what⠀interpretation⠀remains⠀unstable.⠀Speech⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀a⠀partial⠀exchange⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀or⠀another⠀speaker⠀must⠀repeat⠀or⠀work⠀around.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀Contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀or⠀expansive⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀demands,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀continuous⠀rather⠀than⠀shifting⠀into⠀a⠀different⠀presentational⠀mode.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access⠀rules.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀outside⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Improvement⠀may⠀be⠀uneven,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀interpretation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Select⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀practice,⠀failure,⠀or⠀new⠀capability⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person:⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀change,⠀repeat⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀misunderstand⠀an⠀interrupted⠀explanation,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀lapse⠀with⠀familiarity.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀as⠀markers⠀of⠀progression.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀reference⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀something⠀again,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀decorative⠀echo.\n\nRender⠀Akira's⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀relationship.⠀When⠀noise⠀or⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀cuts⠀across⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀speech,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀catch⠀a⠀fragment,⠀ask⠀for⠀repetition,⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀plausible⠀completion⠀that⠀may⠀be⠀wrong.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀authorized⠀interiority;⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀stays⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀observe⠀or⠀infer.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀misunderstanding.\n\nLet⠀progression⠀remain⠀uneven⠀and⠀emotionally⠀legible.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀relationship's⠀balance,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀old⠀difficulty⠀intact.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding⠀rather⠀than⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing.⠀Improvement⠀is⠀related⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempts⠀whose⠀consequences⠀will⠀be⠀remembered:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀do,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀later⠀accomplished,⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resisted⠀effort.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀should⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀record⠀visible⠀deeds⠀and⠀reported⠀speech,⠀but⠀cannot⠀supply⠀unspoken⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀grants⠀that⠀access.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀mark⠀advancement.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀designation⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀a⠀task⠀again,⠀and⠀its⠀new⠀application⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀to⠀every⠀entrance;⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking.\n\nLet⠀interrupted⠀speech⠀and⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀appear⠀as⠀features⠀of⠀the⠀record.⠀When⠀noise⠀or⠀distraction⠀cuts⠀across⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀words,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀break,⠀repeat⠀what⠀was⠀caught,⠀or⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀differs⠀among⠀those⠀who⠀heard⠀it.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀difference.⠀A⠀later⠀deed⠀may⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀meant,⠀but⠀later⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀alter⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀particular⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀convention.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀leaving⠀another⠀attempt⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀an⠀inward,⠀essayistic⠀account⠀grounded⠀in⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀realism⠀—⠀the⠀psychological⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀traditions,⠀chosen⠀here⠀over⠀the⠀folktale,⠀crime,⠀or⠀comic⠀routes.⠀The⠀narration⠀examines⠀a⠀developing⠀capability⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀experience,⠀weighing⠀what⠀was⠀possible⠀last⠀month⠀against⠀what⠀is⠀possible⠀this⠀morning,⠀while⠀the⠀ordinary⠀setting⠀—⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀—⠀keeps⠀every⠀claim⠀concrete.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀a⠀specific⠀Nordic⠀setting,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀conditions⠀as⠀given,⠀keeping⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀contexts⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀drape⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀imported⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀established.\n\nLet⠀Akira's⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀shape⠀how⠀advancement⠀is⠀noticed.⠀A⠀new⠀understanding⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀fragment⠀that⠀breaks⠀into⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀another⠀thought,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀that⠀suddenly⠀connects,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀that⠀becomes⠀legible⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Never⠀render⠀the⠀gain⠀as⠀a⠀clean⠀system⠀message⠀or⠀ceremony.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀show⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀attention⠀fails⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀new⠀understanding,⠀then⠀the⠀later⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀completes⠀under⠀familiar⠀conditions.\n\nMake⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀actual⠀attempts⠀and⠀their⠀consequences.⠀A⠀teacher,⠀colleague,⠀or⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀correct⠀the⠀work,⠀or⠀the⠀material⠀itself⠀may⠀resist⠀—⠀the⠀tool⠀slips,⠀the⠀pattern⠀frays,⠀the⠀formula⠀collapses⠀when⠀applied⠀too⠀early.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflect⠀on⠀that⠀feedback⠀in⠀the⠀essayistic⠀voice,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀promoting⠀every⠀gain⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀lesson.⠀Allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀capability⠀may⠀become⠀reliable⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀difficult,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀register⠀that⠀unevenness⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀and⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀inside⠀the⠀training⠀account.⠀A⠀stray⠀memory⠀or⠀an⠀imagined⠀failure⠀can⠀interrupt⠀practice;⠀a⠀result⠀may⠀be⠀misread⠀at⠀first⠀and⠀revised⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀correction.⠀Speech⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀may⠀draw⠀a⠀different⠀answer⠀during⠀a⠀loud⠀task⠀than⠀in⠀quiet.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.\n\nHold⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀advancement⠀local:⠀a⠀skill⠀becomes⠀reliable,⠀a⠀task⠀becomes⠀faster,⠀a⠀concept⠀becomes⠀usable⠀under⠀mild⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀register⠀the⠀social⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀change⠀—⠀a⠀household⠀member⠀now⠀relies⠀on⠀the⠀new⠀capability,⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀creates⠀an⠀obligation⠀to⠀try⠀again.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands,⠀whether⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀still⠀uncertain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀scene⠀in⠀readable⠀screenplay⠀form.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀for⠀visible⠀movement⠀and⠀objects,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀concrete:⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀material,⠀the⠀hands⠀or⠀tools,⠀the⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀on⠀screen.⠀Set⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀difficult⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀record⠀the⠀changed⠀result:⠀the⠀movement⠀completes,⠀the⠀object⠀holds,⠀the⠀response⠀comes⠀faster.⠀Then⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀beat.⠀A⠀gain⠀needs⠀no⠀montage⠀or⠀training⠀sequence;⠀one⠀completed⠀attempt⠀under⠀familiar⠀conditions⠀makes⠀the⠀change⠀legible.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀perception⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythm⠀register⠀that⠀break;⠀continuous⠀attention⠀can⠀keep⠀an⠀unbroken⠀rhythm.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀action.⠀Write⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀—⠀not⠀dialogue,⠀not⠀knowledge⠀the⠀cast⠀holds.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀available⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it,⠀never⠀as⠀the⠀automatic⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀the⠀note⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt:⠀it⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀misreads⠀a⠀correction⠀as⠀criticism,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀stray⠀memory⠀breaks⠀into⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement.\n\nIf⠀noise⠀or⠀divided⠀attention⠀actually⠀affects⠀speech,⠀make⠀the⠀particular⠀effect⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀also⠀work⠀while⠀listening⠀accurately⠀and⠀answering⠀fluently;⠀no⠀missed⠀instruction⠀or⠀explanation⠀is⠀required.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀spoken⠀correction,⠀a⠀visible⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀that⠀succeeds.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀action,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀successful⠀one,⠀but⠀the⠀later⠀attempt⠀must⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀rather⠀than⠀imply⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands⠀—⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀in⠀progress⠀—⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀has⠀learned.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀staged⠀attempts.⠀Show⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀performing⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀difficult,⠀with⠀the⠀stage⠀direction⠀recording⠀the⠀changed⠀result:⠀the⠀movement⠀completes,⠀the⠀object⠀stays⠀in⠀place,⠀the⠀response⠀comes⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation.⠀Then⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀attempt.⠀A⠀gain⠀can⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀one⠀completed⠀action⠀under⠀familiar⠀conditions;⠀it⠀needs⠀no⠀training⠀montage⠀and⠀no⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nRender⠀any⠀supported⠀perceptual⠀interruption⠀or⠀uncertain⠀interpretation⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀while⠀giving⠀clear⠀understanding⠀and⠀steady⠀attention⠀their⠀own⠀actual⠀form.⠀When⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀matters⠀—⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀breaking⠀into⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement,⠀a⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀character's⠀tone,⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀memory⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀the⠀audience⠀does⠀not⠀mistake⠀for⠀speech.⠀Monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀are⠀performed⠀moments⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀when⠀the⠀drama⠀genuinely⠀calls⠀for⠀them,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀material⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀stage⠀action.\n\nIf⠀handling⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀competing⠀sound⠀actually⠀affects⠀listening⠀or⠀speech,⠀make⠀that⠀particular⠀effect⠀audible.⠀Handling⠀an⠀object⠀can⠀also⠀coexist⠀with⠀accurate⠀listening⠀and⠀fluent⠀speech.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀spoken⠀correction,⠀a⠀visible⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀that⠀succeeds.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀action,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀be⠀unable⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene's⠀public⠀action⠀moving⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀staged⠀business.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands⠀—⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀in⠀progress⠀—⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀characters⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀already⠀watched.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement.⠀Braid⠀the⠀perception,⠀private⠀words,⠀and⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀actually⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀attempt⠀unfolds,⠀with⠀established⠀memory,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀recurring⠀concern⠀where⠀those⠀occur.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀those⠀associations⠀—⠀a⠀thought⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀picks⠀up⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀—⠀while⠀enough⠀orientation⠀remains⠀to⠀separate⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀inside⠀the⠀flow⠀of⠀experience.⠀A⠀practice⠀attempt⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction⠀breaking⠀into⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀current⠀movement,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀that⠀suddenly⠀matches⠀a⠀principle⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀known⠀but⠀not⠀executed,⠀or⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀loops⠀back⠀through⠀earlier⠀attempts.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀thought⠀states⠀the⠀principle⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀lags,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀completes⠀the⠀action⠀before⠀the⠀mind⠀catches⠀up.⠀Allow⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀to⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀—⠀one⠀capability⠀feels⠀reliable⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀a⠀recurring⠀interruption⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀unevenness⠀persist⠀through⠀the⠀passage⠀without⠀being⠀resolved.\n\nWhere⠀an⠀uncertain⠀interpretation⠀is⠀actually⠀present,⠀retain⠀its⠀particular⠀movement⠀in⠀the⠀stream.⠀The⠀method⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀unstable⠀reading;⠀clarity⠀can⠀flow⠀associatively⠀too.⠀A⠀correction⠀may⠀be⠀misread⠀at⠀first⠀and⠀revised⠀when⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀word⠀re-enters⠀the⠀flow.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀interrupt⠀practice⠀and⠀turn⠀the⠀passage⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀direction⠀without⠀resolving.⠀If⠀noise⠀or⠀attention⠀obscures⠀part⠀of⠀someone's⠀speech,⠀distinguish⠀the⠀actual⠀words⠀caught⠀from⠀any⠀supported⠀memory⠀or⠀guess.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀gap⠀unfilled,⠀seek⠀clarification,⠀or⠀hear⠀accurately;⠀fragmentary⠀prose⠀need⠀not⠀imply⠀fragmentary⠀comprehension.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀senses⠀and⠀through⠀consequence.⠀Render⠀the⠀material⠀as⠀actually⠀encountered:⠀resistance,⠀an⠀awkward⠀angle,⠀a⠀clear⠀sound,⠀a⠀holding⠀pattern,⠀or⠀ease⠀can⠀each⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀felt⠀attempt.⠀Another⠀person's⠀correction⠀may⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀repeats⠀while⠀trying⠀again.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀gain⠀into⠀a⠀clean⠀realization;⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀can⠀register⠀as⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀flow⠀—⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation⠀no⠀longer⠀interrupts,⠀the⠀feared⠀step⠀completes,⠀the⠀familiar⠀room⠀looks⠀briefly⠀different⠀—⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀stepping⠀outside⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀announce⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀mental⠀movement⠀pauses⠀or⠀turns:⠀the⠀attempt⠀completed,⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀association,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀no⠀forced⠀resolution⠀and⠀no⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀message⠀exchange.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀types⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀edits⠀before⠀sending,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀while⠀working.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀communicate⠀or⠀do⠀between⠀messages.⠀A⠀task⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀difficult⠀may⠀be⠀reported⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀or⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀pause⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀performs⠀the⠀task⠀and⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀result.⠀Let⠀the⠀messages⠀make⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀legible:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀describe⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀fail,⠀attach⠀a⠀photo⠀of⠀the⠀finished⠀work,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀previously⠀produced⠀only⠀confusion.⠀Show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀one.\n\nIf⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀or⠀uncertain⠀interpretation⠀actually⠀affects⠀composing⠀a⠀message,⠀let⠀its⠀supported⠀trace⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀record.⠀Ordinary⠀composition⠀and⠀accurate⠀understanding⠀require⠀no⠀edit,⠀lapse,⠀or⠀deleted⠀draft.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀surface⠀as⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀types⠀and⠀then⠀deletes,⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀before⠀the⠀thought⠀is⠀fully⠀formed;⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀live⠀private⠀mind.⠀A⠀misreading⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀answers⠀the⠀wrong⠀question,⠀followed⠀by⠀an⠀edit⠀or⠀a⠀correction.⠀When⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀matters,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀read.\n\nLet⠀noise⠀and⠀attention⠀act⠀through⠀the⠀medium.⠀A⠀message⠀sent⠀while⠀working⠀may⠀be⠀shorter⠀or⠀more⠀fragmented⠀than⠀one⠀sent⠀after⠀the⠀task;⠀a⠀delay⠀may⠀mean⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀was⠀practicing,⠀not⠀ignoring⠀anyone.⠀Use⠀timestamps⠀and⠀delays⠀only⠀where⠀that⠀difference⠀matters.⠀Feedback⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀correction,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀gap,⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀confirming⠀the⠀attempt⠀succeeded.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀type⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀report⠀failing⠀the⠀action,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀struggle⠀to⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀text.\n\nContext⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀showing⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself⠀or⠀the⠀setting⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀message⠀record.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands⠀—⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀in⠀progress.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀to⠀add⠀subtext,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀scene⠀in⠀visual⠀novel⠀form.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀keeping⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references⠀to⠀the⠀imagined⠀image,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀the⠀scene-setting⠀and⠀focal⠀narration:⠀the⠀hands⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀fail,⠀the⠀object⠀holds,⠀the⠀response⠀comes⠀without⠀the⠀old⠀hesitation.⠀Then⠀show⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult,⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀one.⠀A⠀gain⠀can⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀completed⠀action⠀under⠀familiar⠀conditions;⠀it⠀needs⠀no⠀montage⠀and⠀no⠀training⠀sequence.\n\nWhere⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀or⠀uncertain⠀interpretation⠀is⠀supported,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀it.⠀Otherwise⠀give⠀clear⠀attention,⠀accurate⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀undisturbed⠀feeling⠀its⠀own⠀rhythm.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement;⠀a⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀character's⠀tone⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀inner⠀response⠀until⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀corrects⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀dialogue⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.⠀If⠀noise⠀or⠀divided⠀attention⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀hears⠀or⠀answers,⠀preserve⠀that⠀actual⠀effect.⠀Working,⠀listening,⠀and⠀speaking⠀can⠀also⠀proceed⠀fluently⠀together.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events⠀—⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction,⠀a⠀visible⠀failure,⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀that⠀succeeds.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀in⠀dialogue⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀action,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀Use⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀familiar⠀room,⠀a⠀changed⠀posture,⠀a⠀pause⠀—⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀gain⠀be⠀proven⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀completes⠀or⠀fails,⠀not⠀by⠀the⠀expression⠀itself.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene⠀moving⠀through⠀dialogue,⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀legible⠀scene⠀changes.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands⠀—⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀in⠀progress⠀—⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nApply⠀this⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀focal⠀cast⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀express⠀established⠀perception,⠀attention,⠀or⠀pressure;⠀the⠀profile⠀supplies⠀no⠀character⠀identity,⠀diagnosis,⠀or⠀required⠀mistake.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀an⠀installment⠀of⠀ongoing⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀Establish⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally⠀in⠀this⠀installment,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀current⠀attempt;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀training⠀history.\n\nMake⠀improvement⠀matter⠀through⠀the⠀attempts⠀shown.⠀Give⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀enough⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult.⠀Distinguish⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀from⠀executing⠀it:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀principle⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀action,⠀or⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀Let⠀strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀across⠀installments⠀—⠀one⠀capability⠀improves⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀difficult⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀installment⠀register⠀that⠀unevenness⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀A⠀gain⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀attempt⠀shown,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀sudden⠀unexplained⠀leap.\n\nCarry⠀any⠀actual⠀perceptual⠀interruption⠀or⠀uncertain⠀interpretation⠀into⠀the⠀installment⠀prose⠀when⠀present,⠀while⠀retaining⠀steady⠀attention⠀and⠀accurate⠀understanding⠀when⠀those⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement;⠀a⠀misreading⠀of⠀another⠀character's⠀tone⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀scene⠀until⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀corrects⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.⠀If⠀noise⠀or⠀divided⠀attention⠀affects⠀an⠀exchange,⠀show⠀that⠀particular⠀effect⠀without⠀prescribing⠀missed⠀instructions,⠀interrupted⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀mistake.⠀A⠀fluent⠀exchange⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀unchanged.\n\nLet⠀feedback⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀installment's⠀events⠀—⠀a⠀spoken⠀correction,⠀a⠀visible⠀failure,⠀a⠀second⠀attempt⠀that⠀succeeds.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀the⠀serial⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀create⠀rankings,⠀levels,⠀or⠀progression⠀mechanics⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀An⠀occasional⠀hook⠀may⠀close⠀the⠀installment⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀task,⠀an⠀open⠀question,⠀a⠀resource⠀now⠀available⠀—⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.\n\nThe⠀installment⠀can⠀stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀attempt⠀currently⠀stands⠀—⠀completed,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀in⠀progress⠀—⠀leaving⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀re-enter⠀the⠀next⠀installment⠀without⠀a⠀full⠀recap.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nPut⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀and⠀the⠀unresolved⠀relationship⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀strain⠀the⠀other.⠀The⠀character⠀practices,⠀prepares,⠀or⠀performs⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀while⠀someone⠀they⠀have⠀hurt,⠀need,⠀or⠀are⠀avoiding⠀is⠀present⠀or⠀imminent,⠀and⠀the⠀turbulence⠀shows⠀in⠀execution⠀before⠀anyone⠀names⠀it:⠀attention⠀pulling⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀technique⠀mid-attempt,⠀a⠀correction⠀applied⠀too⠀hard,⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀arrives⠀late⠀because⠀they⠀were⠀listening⠀for⠀something⠀else.\n\nExplain⠀any⠀mechanism⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀touches⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀prepared,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀why⠀the⠀result⠀is⠀partial⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀explanation⠀pass⠀through⠀divided⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀lecture.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀particular⠀shape⠀here:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀state⠀the⠀correction⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀perform⠀it,⠀because⠀anger,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀proximity⠀has⠀taken⠀the⠀attention⠀the⠀technique⠀requires.⠀Show⠀that⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀fumbled⠀movement⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀diction⠀and⠀distance⠀carry⠀the⠀hurt⠀—⠀this⠀character's⠀habits⠀of⠀understatement,⠀blame,⠀or⠀self-monitoring⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀borrowed⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strain⠀govern⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀said.⠀An⠀apology⠀can⠀compete⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀and⠀lose⠀its⠀thread;⠀an⠀admission⠀can⠀come⠀out⠀as⠀instruction,⠀or⠀land⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀stopped⠀waiting;⠀withholding⠀stays⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀unsaid⠀thing⠀while⠀their⠀hands⠀keep⠀working.⠀When⠀comfort⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀—⠀a⠀practical⠀kindness⠀that⠀concedes⠀nothing,⠀warmth⠀that⠀coexists⠀with⠀the⠀hurt⠀still⠀standing.⠀Follow⠀the⠀effects⠀into⠀subsequent⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀resetting⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀advancement⠀real⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms.⠀The⠀attempt⠀is⠀earned:⠀the⠀character⠀gets⠀further⠀than⠀last⠀time,⠀or⠀understands⠀exactly⠀why⠀they⠀failed,⠀and⠀that⠀improved⠀capability⠀carries⠀into⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀attempt⠀next⠀—⠀while⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀repair⠀is⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀say.⠀End⠀on⠀that⠀unevenness⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀honestly⠀stands,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀collapse⠀supplied⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀feeling⠀out.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀so⠀it⠀scans:⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀read⠀at⠀speed,⠀each⠀doing⠀one⠀job⠀—⠀a⠀speaker's⠀turn,⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀scene⠀narration⠀—⠀with⠀attribution⠀no⠀reader⠀has⠀to⠀reconstruct.⠀Put⠀the⠀progression⠀on-screen⠀inside⠀that⠀interval.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀something⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀their⠀current⠀capability,⠀run⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀sequence:⠀what⠀they⠀try⠀first,⠀what⠀preparation⠀or⠀resource⠀they⠀bring,⠀how⠀the⠀world⠀answers,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀now⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before.⠀A⠀miss⠀still⠀counts⠀as⠀movement⠀when⠀it⠀gets⠀further⠀than⠀the⠀last⠀miss⠀or⠀shows⠀exactly⠀why⠀it⠀missed.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀happens⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀technique⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀where⠀it⠀stops⠀—⠀and⠀return⠀at⠀once⠀to⠀the⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀park⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀summary,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀numbers⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀growth;⠀if⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀will⠀matter⠀later,⠀its⠀earlier⠀appearance⠀should⠀already⠀have⠀been⠀readable.⠀Where⠀the⠀attempt⠀invites⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀read⠀on⠀it⠀—⠀confidence,⠀doubt,⠀a⠀correction⠀remembered⠀mid-motion⠀—⠀include⠀that⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀voice⠀and⠀person⠀alongside⠀the⠀visible⠀beats.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀alive⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀concerns.⠀They⠀answer⠀the⠀attempt⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀interests,⠀keep⠀occupied⠀with⠀tasks⠀already⠀in⠀progress,⠀and⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀compete,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀care;⠀their⠀responses⠀are⠀the⠀real⠀test⠀of⠀the⠀new⠀capability,⠀not⠀set⠀applause⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀obstacle.⠀Player-owned⠀characters⠀remain⠀under⠀player⠀control,⠀and⠀narration⠀follows⠀the⠀selected⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀role⠀conventions.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀mid-conversation,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀settling⠀aftermath⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀legible⠀enough⠀to⠀continue⠀from.⠀No⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀end;⠀the⠀next⠀participant⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀talk,⠀or⠀anything⠀else⠀already⠀alive⠀in⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀martial⠀adventure⠀in⠀episodic⠀units.⠀Give⠀each⠀unit⠀a⠀concrete⠀test⠀that⠀stands⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀—⠀a⠀duel,⠀an⠀escort,⠀a⠀defense,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀leg⠀of⠀a⠀journey⠀—⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀opening,⠀turn,⠀and⠀aftermath,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀encounter⠀itself⠀be⠀the⠀measure:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀attempt,⠀what⠀still⠀beats⠀them,⠀what⠀the⠀victory⠀or⠀survival⠀actually⠀cost.⠀Never⠀improve⠀the⠀cast⠀by⠀narration⠀alone;⠀the⠀encounter⠀demonstrates⠀the⠀change,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀encounter⠀redistributes⠀the⠀difficulty⠀so⠀that⠀yesterday's⠀solution⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀reusable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀working⠀of⠀any⠀technique,⠀resource,⠀or⠀rule⠀legible⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀decides⠀the⠀outcome:⠀the⠀preparation⠀carried⠀into⠀the⠀fight,⠀the⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure,⠀the⠀price⠀paid,⠀the⠀limit⠀found.⠀A⠀principle⠀understood⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀executable⠀fails⠀in⠀the⠀execution,⠀visibly;⠀a⠀resource⠀spent⠀is⠀felt⠀as⠀spent⠀in⠀the⠀episodes⠀that⠀follow.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀values⠀decide⠀tactics⠀—⠀whom⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀strike,⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀spend,⠀which⠀challenge⠀they⠀accept⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀teacher,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀they⠀answer⠀to⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀opponents⠀legitimate⠀claims⠀and⠀histories⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀so⠀that⠀winning⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀obligation⠀that⠀shapes⠀a⠀later⠀unit.\n\nBind⠀the⠀units⠀with⠀recurrence⠀and⠀variation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀ladder⠀of⠀ranks⠀or⠀numbers.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀technique,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀unit⠀so⠀the⠀changed⠀outcome⠀registers;⠀let⠀one⠀skill⠀climb⠀while⠀another⠀stalls;⠀let⠀a⠀method⠀that⠀settled⠀one⠀encounter⠀fail⠀against⠀different⠀ground⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀opponent,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀read⠀the⠀difference.⠀The⠀reader⠀tracks⠀growth⠀through⠀these⠀shifting⠀results⠀across⠀episodes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀in⠀play⠀—⠀its⠀own⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀its⠀own⠀courtesies⠀and⠀obligations⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀transplanting⠀a⠀generic⠀martial⠀world⠀onto⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀episodic⠀form⠀and⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀obligation⠀supply⠀the⠀method;⠀the⠀people,⠀place,⠀and⠀speech⠀remain⠀the⠀story's⠀own.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀improvement⠀as⠀labor⠀with⠀a⠀surface.⠀Give⠀the⠀attempts⠀grip,⠀weight,⠀breath,⠀and⠀wear⠀—⠀the⠀edge⠀gone⠀dull,⠀hands⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀close⠀after⠀the⠀drill,⠀ground⠀that⠀refuses⠀to⠀hold.⠀Use⠀hard⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀attempt⠀to⠀result⠀without⠀cushioning,⠀and⠀hold⠀the⠀longer⠀line⠀in⠀reserve⠀for⠀the⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀reasons⠀something⠀through;⠀the⠀reasoning⠀earns⠀its⠀length,⠀the⠀rest⠀does⠀not.\n\nMake⠀every⠀mechanism⠀material⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀bites.⠀A⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀matters⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see⠀it,⠀feel⠀it,⠀spend⠀it,⠀or⠀run⠀out⠀of⠀it,⠀so⠀explain⠀it⠀through⠀those⠀terms⠀inside⠀the⠀beat⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀outcome.⠀Knowing⠀how⠀a⠀thing⠀should⠀be⠀done⠀and⠀doing⠀it⠀come⠀apart⠀under⠀exhaustion,⠀injury,⠀or⠀conditions⠀the⠀body⠀did⠀not⠀choose;⠀let⠀the⠀failure⠀occur⠀at⠀that⠀junction,⠀and⠀let⠀success⠀cost⠀something⠀countable⠀—⠀stamina,⠀supplies,⠀skin,⠀time⠀something⠀else⠀needed.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stakes⠀physically⠀real.⠀Test⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀against⠀consequences⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀rewind:⠀a⠀wound⠀that⠀stays,⠀gear⠀that⠀is⠀gone,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀passed⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀was⠀drilling.⠀Values⠀and⠀obligations⠀decide⠀what⠀gets⠀risked⠀and⠀what⠀gets⠀sacrificed;⠀a⠀technique⠀can⠀win⠀the⠀fight⠀and⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀cold,⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀led⠀there⠀standing.\n\nVary⠀the⠀pressure⠀through⠀rhythm⠀—⠀short,⠀flat⠀sentences⠀under⠀impact,⠀an⠀uncluttered⠀longer⠀one⠀when⠀thought⠀needs⠀its⠀length⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀mouth⠀it⠀comes⠀out⠀of.⠀Hold⠀the⠀treatment⠀at⠀pressure,⠀not⠀at⠀horror:⠀difficulty⠀is⠀the⠀medium⠀growth⠀moves⠀through⠀here,⠀not⠀a⠀slide⠀into⠀ruin.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀writer,⠀a⠀purpose⠀or⠀recipient,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀composition⠀that⠀governs⠀what⠀it⠀holds.⠀A⠀training⠀log⠀written⠀the⠀same⠀evening⠀records⠀attempts⠀and⠀failures⠀without⠀yet⠀understanding⠀why.⠀A⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀reports⠀the⠀success⠀and⠀edits⠀out⠀its⠀cost.⠀A⠀later⠀field⠀report⠀or⠀revised⠀manual⠀corrects⠀an⠀earlier⠀account⠀now⠀that⠀the⠀principle⠀is⠀finally⠀clear.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs⠀—⠀log,⠀letter,⠀report,⠀requisition,⠀marginal⠀note⠀—⠀and⠀stay⠀with⠀it⠀while⠀it⠀serves,⠀rather⠀than⠀cycling⠀formats⠀for⠀variety.\n\nLet⠀capability⠀be⠀read⠀off⠀the⠀trail⠀the⠀entries⠀leave.⠀Lined⠀up⠀in⠀order,⠀they⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀progression:⠀what⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀attempted,⠀what⠀was⠀tried⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀failed,⠀what⠀feedback⠀arrived⠀and⠀from⠀whom,⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀doable,⠀what⠀remains⠀out⠀of⠀reach.⠀When⠀a⠀resource,⠀technique,⠀or⠀rule⠀decides⠀an⠀outcome,⠀put⠀its⠀working⠀inside⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀would⠀naturally⠀carry⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀requisition⠀shows⠀the⠀expenditure,⠀the⠀report⠀shows⠀what⠀worked⠀and⠀what⠀broke,⠀the⠀revision⠀shows⠀the⠀understanding⠀that⠀arrived⠀late.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀to⠀reconcile⠀what⠀the⠀records⠀leave⠀unsettled.\n\nLet⠀the⠀unevenness⠀show⠀through⠀gaps⠀and⠀conflict.⠀Two⠀writers⠀can⠀disagree⠀because⠀they⠀watched⠀different⠀sides⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀attempt;⠀a⠀strength⠀can⠀climb⠀across⠀entries⠀while⠀a⠀weakness⠀persists⠀untouched;⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line,⠀a⠀changed⠀hand,⠀a⠀page⠀out⠀of⠀order⠀can⠀mark⠀something⠀the⠀writer⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀explain.⠀A⠀document⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀its⠀author⠀composed,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀while⠀composing:⠀live⠀hesitation⠀and⠀deliberate⠀omission⠀surface⠀as⠀traces⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀and⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀it⠀under⠀that⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀the⠀record⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀it.⠀Keep⠀continuity⠀readable⠀across⠀the⠀sequence⠀and⠀let⠀some⠀conflicts⠀stand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀improvement⠀happen⠀inside⠀warmth⠀rather⠀than⠀apart⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀practice⠀attempt⠀sits⠀in⠀a⠀kept⠀room,⠀a⠀shared⠀routine,⠀an⠀interval⠀someone⠀protected⠀for⠀it:⠀the⠀character⠀drills⠀while⠀a⠀meal⠀simmers,⠀reviews⠀a⠀correction⠀while⠀someone⠀rebandages⠀their⠀hand,⠀tries⠀the⠀difficult⠀step⠀under⠀a⠀friend's⠀running⠀commentary.⠀The⠀attempt⠀remains⠀the⠀engine⠀—⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do,⠀where⠀it⠀still⠀catches,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀surrounding⠀care⠀changes⠀the⠀working:⠀steadier⠀attention,⠀permission⠀to⠀fail⠀out⠀loud,⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀sensible⠀hour.\n\nExplain⠀any⠀mechanism⠀that⠀touches⠀the⠀attempt⠀plainly⠀and⠀gently:⠀the⠀resource⠀saved⠀rather⠀than⠀spent,⠀the⠀small⠀adjustment⠀that⠀let⠀the⠀technique⠀land⠀at⠀last,⠀the⠀feedback⠀that⠀arrived⠀as⠀encouragement⠀and⠀happened⠀to⠀be⠀correct.⠀Keep⠀preparation,⠀cost,⠀and⠀payoff⠀understandable⠀without⠀hardening⠀the⠀tone.⠀A⠀modest⠀success⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene;⠀a⠀soft⠀failure⠀can⠀teach⠀without⠀stinging.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀preferences⠀and⠀commitments⠀decide⠀what⠀is⠀practiced⠀today,⠀what⠀is⠀set⠀aside,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀watch.\n\nSpend⠀real⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures:⠀a⠀food⠀someone⠀remembered,⠀a⠀tool⠀returned⠀clean⠀and⠀sharp,⠀an⠀old⠀joke⠀with⠀its⠀timing⠀intact,⠀the⠀exact⠀place⠀this⠀person⠀likes⠀to⠀sit,⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀privately⠀counts⠀as⠀a⠀good⠀day.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀open⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair;⠀disagreement,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀worry⠀over⠀established⠀problems⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀without⠀souring⠀it.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀anyone⠀agreeable⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀what⠀is⠀hard⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀—⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀hard⠀thing⠀livable⠀next⠀to.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀progression⠀forward⠀through⠀these⠀intervals.⠀What⠀improved⠀today⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀next,⠀and⠀the⠀care⠀around⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀makes⠀it⠀sustainable.⠀A⠀skill⠀built⠀in⠀this⠀warmth⠀may⠀become⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀shares,⠀teaches,⠀or⠀spends⠀on⠀someone's⠀behalf⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀reaches⠀for⠀it;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀that⠀payoff⠀on⠀any⠀schedule.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nGive⠀the⠀progression⠀composed,⠀deliberate⠀prose.⠀Move⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀real⠀transitions,⠀so⠀an⠀attempt⠀is⠀set⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀made:⠀who⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀to⠀this⠀household,⠀guild,⠀family,⠀or⠀post;⠀what⠀history⠀rides⠀on⠀the⠀technique;⠀what⠀obligation⠀or⠀expectation⠀made⠀this⠀the⠀thing⠀worth⠀learning.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀allows⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀attempt⠀socially⠀—⠀how⠀it⠀will⠀be⠀read,⠀by⠀whom,⠀against⠀what⠀precedent⠀—⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀actual⠀mechanics⠀unhurried⠀and⠀clear.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀causal⠀account⠀legible⠀inside⠀the⠀formal⠀movement.⠀Preparation,⠀resource,⠀choice,⠀cost,⠀payoff:⠀when⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀technique⠀decides⠀an⠀outcome,⠀the⠀narration⠀makes⠀its⠀working⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters,⠀not⠀merely⠀elegant.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀grasp⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀in⠀execution⠀because⠀a⠀competing⠀commitment⠀holds⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀attention;⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀show⠀both⠀the⠀failure⠀and⠀the⠀division.⠀The⠀style⠀dignifies⠀the⠀account;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀it.\n\nSeparate⠀the⠀registers.⠀Narration⠀may⠀carry⠀judgment,⠀history,⠀and⠀social⠀context⠀in⠀sentences⠀more⠀considered⠀than⠀speech;⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀idiom,⠀however⠀plain⠀or⠀coarse.⠀Where⠀the⠀scene⠀offers⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀stage,⠀use⠀the⠀contrast⠀it⠀creates:⠀the⠀private⠀failures⠀and⠀dull⠀repetitions⠀that⠀built⠀the⠀capability⠀set⠀against⠀its⠀polished⠀public⠀demonstration,⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀observers⠀now⠀assume.⠀That⠀gap⠀is⠀usable⠀material⠀—⠀it⠀may⠀alter⠀offers,⠀expectations,⠀and⠀obligations⠀in⠀later⠀scenes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀developing⠀life⠀whole.⠀Teachers⠀give⠀feedback⠀with⠀interests⠀of⠀their⠀own;⠀rivals⠀respond;⠀family⠀claims⠀its⠀share⠀of⠀time⠀and⠀attention;⠀recovery⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀occupy⠀their⠀proper⠀weeks.⠀Each⠀new⠀capability⠀re-situates⠀the⠀character⠀among⠀these⠀people⠀—⠀what⠀opens,⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀expected,⠀who⠀is⠀pleased⠀or⠀unsettled⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀advancement⠀is⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀circumstance⠀and⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀ability.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀the⠀telling:⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀why⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀currently⠀cannot⠀do.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀strongest⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀stuck⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀point⠀of⠀practice⠀—⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀keeps⠀failing,⠀a⠀cost⠀they⠀cannot⠀pay,⠀a⠀principle⠀they⠀can⠀recite⠀but⠀not⠀execute⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀share,⠀shape,⠀or⠀withhold⠀exactly⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀reception:⠀the⠀student's⠀success⠀or⠀error⠀reflects⠀on⠀the⠀teacher,⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀can⠀be⠀honored⠀or⠀dodged⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀rival's⠀method⠀can⠀be⠀quietly⠀diminished.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀carry⠀the⠀practice⠀itself.⠀Inside⠀it,⠀show⠀the⠀past⠀practitioner⠀working⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀listener's:⠀misreading⠀a⠀constraint,⠀paying⠀a⠀cost⠀that⠀surprised⠀them,⠀discovering⠀where⠀a⠀known⠀principle⠀stops⠀working.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀affects⠀the⠀attempt,⠀let⠀the⠀tale⠀state⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀could⠀observe,⠀what⠀was⠀consumed,⠀and⠀what⠀feedback⠀arrived.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀hindsight⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀attempt;⠀the⠀confusion⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀instruction,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀learned⠀afterward⠀surfaces⠀as⠀emphasis,⠀commentary,⠀or⠀a⠀deliberate⠀omission.\n\nWhile⠀the⠀tale⠀runs,⠀keep⠀the⠀listener's⠀mind⠀working⠀at⠀the⠀outer⠀level:⠀the⠀comparison⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀the⠀question⠀they⠀are⠀holding⠀for⠀later,⠀the⠀doubt⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀being⠀straight⠀with⠀them.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀—⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀posture,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀hand⠀stopping⠀on⠀an⠀object⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀levels⠀never⠀blur.\n\nThen⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀test⠀the⠀tale⠀against⠀present⠀reality.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀tool,⠀or⠀sequence⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀recurs⠀outside⠀it⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀the⠀listener⠀notices⠀a⠀step⠀the⠀teller⠀skipped,⠀supplies⠀a⠀resource⠀the⠀tale⠀assumed,⠀or⠀hits⠀a⠀constraint⠀the⠀tale⠀never⠀covered.⠀Progress⠀lives⠀in⠀that⠀gap⠀—⠀the⠀listener⠀adapts⠀the⠀told⠀principle⠀to⠀actual⠀conditions,⠀fails⠀at⠀a⠀nameable⠀point,⠀or⠀asks⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀understanding.⠀Take⠀the⠀frame's⠀furniture⠀entirely⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world;⠀nested⠀telling⠀and⠀recurrence⠀are⠀the⠀inheritance⠀here,⠀not⠀djinn,⠀palaces,⠀or⠀any⠀particular⠀creed.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀exchange⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀stops⠀—⠀the⠀listener⠀need⠀not⠀master⠀the⠀step,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀every⠀nested⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/developmental⠀realism⠀route:⠀a⠀formation⠀narrative⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀growth⠀and⠀their⠀standing⠀inside⠀an⠀order⠀of⠀instruction⠀advance⠀together,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀credible⠀without⠀the⠀other.⠀Take⠀that⠀order⠀—⠀school,⠀workshop,⠀guild,⠀household,⠀whatever⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀establishes⠀—⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀being⠀learned.⠀Access⠀has⠀keepers:⠀someone⠀controls⠀materials,⠀teaching⠀time,⠀or⠀recognition,⠀and⠀each⠀grant⠀carries⠀obligations.⠀Establish⠀these⠀conditions⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀new⠀attempt,⠀so⠀improvement⠀is⠀measured⠀both⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀becomes⠀able⠀to⠀do⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀become⠀permitted⠀to⠀attempt.\n\nRender⠀formation⠀as⠀stages⠀with⠀consequences.⠀An⠀error⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀setback⠀to⠀be⠀erased⠀but⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀arc:⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀superior⠀corrects,⠀how⠀peers⠀position⠀themselves,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀is⠀trusted⠀with⠀next.⠀When⠀a⠀technique⠀is⠀attempted,⠀give⠀the⠀mechanism⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀reading⠀together⠀—⠀the⠀method⠀works,⠀and⠀its⠀use⠀breaches⠀an⠀expectation,⠀embarrasses⠀a⠀patron,⠀or⠀requires⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀openly⠀obtained.⠀Preparation⠀includes⠀managing⠀these⠀conditions⠀as⠀deliberately⠀as⠀rehearsing⠀the⠀skill.\n\nMake⠀advancement⠀observable⠀in⠀both⠀registers.⠀A⠀new⠀responsibility,⠀a⠀changed⠀form⠀of⠀address,⠀a⠀line⠀entered⠀in⠀the⠀order's⠀records⠀should⠀correspond⠀to⠀capability⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀develop,⠀and⠀rank⠀never⠀substitutes⠀for⠀it.⠀Alongside⠀the⠀achievement,⠀keep⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult:⠀the⠀limit⠀the⠀institution⠀sets,⠀and⠀the⠀weakness⠀the⠀practitioner⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀outgrown.\n\nMatch⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator.⠀A⠀close⠀account⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀superior⠀expects⠀inside⠀long,⠀suspended⠀sentences;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀one⠀reports⠀the⠀same⠀season⠀through⠀records,⠀results,⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀were⠀heard⠀to⠀say⠀—⠀in⠀both⠀cases⠀carrying⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀about⠀costs,⠀loyalties,⠀and⠀competing⠀commitments⠀as⠀ordinary⠀prose.⠀Take⠀the⠀institution,⠀period,⠀and⠀social⠀world⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them;⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀craft⠀route,⠀not⠀a⠀relocation⠀or⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.⠀Ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀relationships⠀share⠀the⠀space⠀with⠀training.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀examination,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀stage⠀is⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀advancement⠀into⠀an⠀inherited⠀order⠀that⠀persists⠀through⠀modern⠀machinery.⠀Before⠀any⠀new⠀skill⠀appears,⠀establish⠀the⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀family⠀claim⠀administered⠀through⠀a⠀database,⠀a⠀patron's⠀protection⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀particular⠀doors,⠀a⠀building⠀whose⠀restricted⠀floor⠀is⠀guarded⠀by⠀badge⠀and⠀by⠀memory,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀passes⠀between⠀generations⠀and⠀is⠀serviced⠀on⠀a⠀schedule.⠀The⠀practitioner's⠀current⠀capability⠀—⠀and⠀current⠀ceiling⠀—⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀that⠀arrangement,⠀whose⠀rules⠀are⠀whatever⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀established.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀practitioner⠀reaches⠀for⠀improvement,⠀render⠀cost⠀and⠀exposure⠀together.⠀Learning⠀may⠀require⠀access⠀someone⠀else⠀controls,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀arrives⠀with⠀obligation⠀attached,⠀or⠀a⠀practice⠀performed⠀for⠀one⠀audience⠀and⠀concealed⠀from⠀another.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀done,⠀what⠀it⠀consumes,⠀what⠀feedback⠀returns⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀encounter's⠀atmosphere⠀carry⠀the⠀stakes:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀lobby⠀built⠀for⠀an⠀older⠀authority,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀that⠀now⠀enforces⠀it,⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀public⠀manner⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀behind⠀it.⠀Mood⠀deepens⠀the⠀encounter;⠀it⠀never⠀replaces⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nLet⠀each⠀gain⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀order's⠀own⠀terms.⠀A⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀categorically⠀closed,⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀addresses⠀the⠀practitioner,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀previously⠀tolerable⠀arrangement⠀—⠀an⠀obligation,⠀an⠀intimacy,⠀a⠀pretense⠀—⠀newly⠀hard⠀to⠀bear.⠀Give⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀its⠀full⠀weight:⠀which⠀loyalty⠀is⠀strained,⠀which⠀desire⠀is⠀finally⠀admitted,⠀which⠀price⠀is⠀accepted⠀and⠀which⠀merely⠀postponed.⠀Not⠀every⠀intimacy⠀is⠀a⠀trap⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀elder⠀is⠀corrupt;⠀trusted⠀company⠀can⠀be⠀where⠀the⠀mask⠀comes⠀off,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀underneath⠀may⠀be⠀relief⠀as⠀easily⠀as⠀horror.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀concrete⠀and⠀causal.⠀A⠀decaying⠀stair,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀a⠀buzzer⠀panel⠀listing⠀a⠀name⠀no⠀one⠀recognizes⠀—⠀each⠀should⠀matter⠀through⠀its⠀function⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀attempt,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀private⠀interval;⠀the⠀inherited⠀order⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀resolved⠀for⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀development⠀is⠀one⠀thread⠀in⠀a⠀working⠀household,⠀and⠀capability⠀is⠀measured⠀inside⠀that⠀web⠀rather⠀than⠀apart⠀from⠀it.⠀Establish⠀the⠀web⠀before⠀any⠀improvement⠀—⠀the⠀ordinary⠀labor⠀that⠀supports⠀the⠀home,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀time,⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀deferred⠀to,⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀relied⠀on⠀and⠀at⠀what⠀cost⠀to⠀them.⠀Teachers⠀here⠀are⠀particular⠀people⠀—⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀an⠀employer⠀—⠀whose⠀hours,⠀patience,⠀and⠀goodwill⠀are⠀finite⠀resources⠀to⠀be⠀budgeted⠀like⠀any⠀other⠀material.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀is⠀attempted,⠀state⠀the⠀mechanism⠀and⠀the⠀household⠀reading⠀together.⠀The⠀method⠀works,⠀and⠀it⠀takes⠀an⠀hour⠀from⠀the⠀shop,⠀uses⠀a⠀material⠀someone⠀else⠀was⠀saving,⠀or⠀must⠀be⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀relative⠀who⠀would⠀find⠀it⠀presumptuous.⠀Preparation⠀means⠀arranging⠀these⠀conditions⠀—⠀finding⠀the⠀hour,⠀replacing⠀the⠀material,⠀choosing⠀the⠀audience⠀—⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀practicing⠀the⠀skill.⠀Let⠀private⠀reasoning⠀run⠀alongside:⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀hopes⠀to⠀protect,⠀whom⠀the⠀change⠀will⠀obligate,⠀which⠀loyalty⠀the⠀ambition⠀strains.\n\nTest⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀inside⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀conditions:⠀finish⠀alone⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀require⠀help,⠀renegotiate⠀a⠀role⠀without⠀losing⠀a⠀necessary⠀relationship,⠀refuse⠀a⠀demand⠀and⠀survive⠀the⠀refusal.⠀Alongside⠀the⠀gain,⠀keep⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀still⠀makes⠀difficult⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀improvement⠀generate⠀its⠀own⠀new⠀expectations⠀and⠀small⠀resentments,⠀since⠀capability⠀changes⠀what⠀people⠀ask⠀of⠀a⠀person.\n\nTake⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀structure⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀Let⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀as⠀ordinary⠀story⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀asides⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀domestic⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval;⠀no⠀stage⠀need⠀be⠀completed⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/psychological⠀realism⠀route:⠀advancement⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀capability⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀now⠀holds⠀it.⠀Establish⠀the⠀surroundings⠀early⠀—⠀who⠀watches⠀the⠀practitioner,⠀what⠀the⠀role⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀look⠀like,⠀what⠀success⠀and⠀failure⠀each⠀cost⠀in⠀those⠀particular⠀relationships.⠀Precision⠀and⠀omission⠀carry⠀the⠀surface:⠀a⠀small⠀visible⠀action⠀—⠀the⠀adjusted⠀grip,⠀the⠀bow⠀a⠀fraction⠀early,⠀the⠀tool⠀set⠀down⠀without⠀being⠀asked⠀—⠀can⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀commentary,⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀still⠀gives⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀in⠀full⠀as⠀ordinary⠀prose.\n\nRender⠀attempts⠀concretely.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀bears⠀on⠀an⠀attempt,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀consumes,⠀and⠀what⠀feedback⠀arrives;⠀present⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀limit⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀bites,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀glossary⠀aside.⠀Alongside⠀the⠀attempt⠀run⠀its⠀private⠀companions⠀—⠀the⠀hope⠀that⠀precedes⠀it,⠀the⠀misreading⠀beneath⠀the⠀error,⠀the⠀specific⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀frustration,⠀relief,⠀shame,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀satisfaction⠀the⠀practitioner⠀would⠀not⠀voice.⠀No⠀single⠀emotional⠀outcome⠀is⠀required;⠀write⠀this⠀person's⠀response,⠀not⠀a⠀prescribed⠀modesty⠀or⠀composure.\n\nLet⠀success⠀and⠀failure⠀split⠀into⠀outward⠀and⠀inward⠀results.⠀The⠀practitioner⠀may⠀perform⠀well⠀and⠀privately⠀recognize⠀the⠀new⠀obligation⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀skill,⠀or⠀fail⠀visibly⠀while⠀grasping⠀something⠀that⠀will⠀matter⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀attempt.⠀Test⠀advancement⠀in⠀both⠀registers:⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish,⠀how⠀superiors⠀and⠀peers⠀recalibrate,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀practitioner⠀regards⠀a⠀limitation⠀previously⠀accepted⠀as⠀natural.\n\nMatch⠀sentence⠀length⠀and⠀distance⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀teller:⠀a⠀close⠀account⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀uncertainty;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀one⠀reports⠀behavior⠀and⠀later⠀consequence⠀while⠀still⠀carrying⠀private⠀reasoning⠀as⠀ordinary⠀story⠀prose.⠀Keep⠀relationships,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀work⠀inside⠀the⠀developing⠀life,⠀and⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀social⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism/chronicle⠀route:⠀narrate⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀development⠀with⠀an⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀will⠀remember,⠀retell,⠀and⠀hold⠀against⠀them.⠀Establish⠀the⠀material⠀ground⠀first⠀—⠀the⠀work⠀available,⠀the⠀tools⠀and⠀spaces⠀that⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀obtained,⠀the⠀teacher⠀whose⠀hours⠀are⠀one⠀more⠀scarce⠀resource,⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀shapes⠀how⠀this⠀community⠀regards⠀someone⠀trying⠀to⠀rise.⠀These⠀conditions⠀are⠀not⠀scenery;⠀they⠀decide⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀and⠀what⠀any⠀new⠀capability⠀will⠀cost.\n\nWhen⠀something⠀new⠀is⠀attempted,⠀give⠀mechanism⠀and⠀material⠀consequence⠀together.⠀The⠀technique⠀requires⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀borrowed,⠀a⠀space⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀with⠀grievances,⠀or⠀hours⠀taken⠀from⠀another⠀need⠀that⠀will⠀now⠀go⠀unmet.⠀State⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀consumes,⠀and⠀what⠀feedback⠀returns,⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters.⠀Preparation⠀includes⠀the⠀economics:⠀sourcing,⠀bartering,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀dishonesties⠀or⠀generosities⠀that⠀acquisition⠀demands.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀community's⠀terms.⠀A⠀capability⠀lets⠀the⠀practitioner⠀finish⠀alone⠀what⠀used⠀to⠀require⠀help,⠀take⠀on⠀work⠀that⠀was⠀closed⠀to⠀them,⠀or⠀finally⠀meet⠀an⠀obligation⠀long⠀deferred⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀eye⠀records⠀how⠀family,⠀neighbors,⠀and⠀employers⠀respond:⠀the⠀new⠀expectations,⠀the⠀old⠀resentments,⠀the⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀that⠀begins⠀circulating⠀as⠀story.⠀Carry⠀the⠀other⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀—⠀which⠀loyalty⠀is⠀strained,⠀which⠀hope⠀is⠀admitted,⠀which⠀price⠀is⠀accepted⠀—⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀corrupt⠀or⠀every⠀success⠀a⠀betrayal.\n\nTake⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀this⠀style⠀to⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator,⠀keep⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀as⠀ordinary⠀prose,⠀and⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀an⠀attempt,⠀a⠀work⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalaban::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀attempt⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀lines⠀to⠀fix⠀where⠀the⠀practitioner⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀which⠀constraint⠀or⠀resource⠀is⠀in⠀play,⠀then⠀straight⠀into⠀the⠀doing.⠀Keep⠀staging⠀visual⠀and⠀trackable⠀—⠀when⠀the⠀practitioner⠀moves,⠀when⠀an⠀object⠀changes⠀hands,⠀when⠀someone⠀else⠀arrives,⠀put⠀the⠀new⠀position⠀or⠀possession⠀in⠀one⠀short⠀concrete⠀sentence⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀has⠀to⠀rebuild⠀the⠀scene.\n\nTeach⠀the⠀system⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀matters.⠀If⠀a⠀technique's⠀rule,⠀cost,⠀or⠀limit⠀decides⠀the⠀attempt,⠀present⠀it⠀right⠀there⠀—⠀in⠀action,⠀in⠀the⠀practitioner's⠀running⠀assessment,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀—⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀standing⠀lecture.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀done,⠀what⠀it⠀consumes,⠀and⠀what⠀feedback⠀comes⠀back;⠀let⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀become⠀clear⠀through⠀its⠀first⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀introduction.\n\nGive⠀the⠀beat⠀after⠀the⠀result⠀its⠀own⠀paragraph⠀and⠀its⠀own⠀weight:⠀what⠀the⠀success⠀or⠀failure⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀goal⠀in⠀play,⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀now⠀understands⠀that⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀before,⠀what⠀still⠀resists.⠀The⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀character⠀—⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀furious,⠀or⠀genuinely⠀funny⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀attempt⠀just⠀made,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀exclamation.⠀Keep⠀mechanism⠀and⠀reaction⠀paired:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀practitioner⠀makes⠀of⠀it,⠀including⠀the⠀part⠀said⠀aloud⠀and⠀the⠀part⠀kept⠀private.\n\nScale⠀advancement⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀newly⠀gained⠀capability⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀looks⠀like⠀—⠀a⠀shorter⠀path,⠀a⠀survivable⠀risk,⠀a⠀mistake⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀—⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀situation.⠀Use⠀clean⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀action,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀private⠀beat;⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀comedy⠀beat,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀rank⠀is⠀optional,⠀never⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nGround⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀in⠀an⠀attempt⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀difficulty,⠀a⠀chosen⠀method,⠀and⠀a⠀changed⠀result.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀currently⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀before⠀they⠀act,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀attempt⠀unfold⠀as⠀concrete⠀movement⠀—⠀the⠀hand⠀learning⠀a⠀grip,⠀the⠀breath⠀finding⠀its⠀pattern,⠀the⠀material⠀answering⠀or⠀refusing.⠀When⠀a⠀principle⠀becomes⠀execution,⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀outcome⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀restated⠀lesson.\n\nLet⠀lyric⠀form⠀carry⠀the⠀experience⠀of⠀that⠀change.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀and⠀images⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀stages⠀of⠀practice:⠀a⠀repeated⠀motion⠀gathering⠀new⠀meaning⠀as⠀control⠀improves,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀looking⠀different⠀once⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀use⠀it⠀well.⠀Unfold⠀a⠀comparison⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀attempt,⠀and⠀keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations.⠀Let⠀plain⠀statements⠀about⠀cost,⠀preparation,⠀and⠀failure⠀interrupt⠀the⠀figurative⠀movement⠀—⠀the⠀account⠀stays⠀honest⠀because⠀the⠀price⠀is⠀named⠀alongside⠀the⠀beauty.⠀Recurrence⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀gives⠀a⠀phrase⠀new⠀application;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀attend⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nKeep⠀advancement⠀uneven.⠀A⠀success⠀in⠀one⠀area⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀weakness⠀in⠀another,⠀and⠀new⠀capability⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀feel⠀strange.⠀Test⠀growth⠀through⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀been⠀impossible⠀earlier⠀while⠀leaving⠀some⠀difficulty⠀intact,⠀and⠀keep⠀resource⠀decisions⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀was⠀saved,⠀what⠀was⠀risked⠀—⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀close⠀can⠀arrive⠀mid-practice⠀or⠀between⠀attempts,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀arc⠀required⠀to⠀justify⠀stopping.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀whose⠀method⠀and⠀cost⠀stay⠀clear:⠀what⠀was⠀practiced,⠀what⠀resource⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀was⠀impossible⠀before.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀touch⠀memory⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀limit⠀—⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀once⠀required⠀help,⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀used⠀to⠀fail,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀knew⠀them⠀before⠀the⠀change.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀so⠀improvement⠀registers⠀as⠀both⠀gain⠀and⠀distance⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀meditation⠀appended⠀to⠀a⠀training⠀beat.\n\nCarry⠀that⠀double⠀meaning⠀in⠀small⠀irreversible⠀details.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object⠀handled⠀too⠀easily,⠀a⠀once-difficult⠀route⠀gone⠀short,⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀body⠀that⠀learned⠀something⠀new⠀—⠀these⠀hold⠀the⠀reflection⠀because⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Render⠀the⠀reflection⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀inward⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀—⠀attention⠀drifting⠀mid-task,⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice⠀attaching⠀to⠀a⠀movement⠀now⠀made⠀easy⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀announced⠀theme.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stays⠀pleasurable;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀glad⠀of⠀the⠀change⠀even⠀while⠀noticing⠀what⠀it⠀displaced.\n\nKeep⠀development⠀uneven⠀and⠀unfinished.⠀New⠀strength⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀weakness⠀more⠀visible,⠀or⠀a⠀solved⠀problem⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀harder⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀self⠀without⠀returning⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀pauses,⠀with⠀the⠀past⠀present⠀in⠀nothing⠀grander⠀than⠀the⠀changed⠀way⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀through⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀this⠀entry's⠀regional⠀route:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller,⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion,⠀and⠀an⠀audience⠀whose⠀presence⠀shapes⠀the⠀telling.⠀Establish⠀early⠀why⠀this⠀teller⠀relates⠀this⠀learner's⠀progress⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀occasion⠀asks⠀of⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀fit⠀the⠀teller's⠀voice⠀and⠀person⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀stock⠀narrator.⠀The⠀frame⠀lives⠀inside⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀community⠀and⠀period;⠀the⠀route⠀requires⠀no⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀particular⠀honor⠀code,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast.\n\nMake⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀knowledge⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀to⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀infer⠀stay⠀distinct,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀a⠀clause:⠀the⠀first⠀failure⠀seen⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀eyes,⠀the⠀later⠀breakthroughs⠀had⠀from⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀taught⠀the⠀learner.⠀Inside⠀the⠀frame,⠀keep⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀improvement⠀legible⠀—⠀the⠀specific⠀difficulty,⠀the⠀method⠀tried,⠀the⠀feedback⠀received,⠀the⠀task⠀accomplished⠀afterward⠀—⠀and⠀when⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters⠀to⠀an⠀attempt,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀audience⠀would⠀understand,⠀so⠀the⠀rule⠀arrives⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀past⠀the⠀audience.⠀Let⠀costs⠀and⠀choices⠀appear⠀as⠀remembered⠀facts:⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀was⠀risked,⠀what⠀the⠀learner⠀decided⠀under⠀pressure.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀do⠀dramatic⠀work.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀pause⠀to⠀address⠀the⠀audience,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀meaning,⠀or⠀admit⠀where⠀accounts⠀disagree⠀and⠀where⠀the⠀report⠀outruns⠀the⠀evidence.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀unevenness⠀of⠀real⠀development:⠀a⠀skill⠀gained⠀while⠀another⠀stays⠀weak,⠀a⠀lesson⠀bought⠀by⠀repeated⠀failure,⠀an⠀advance⠀that⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀obligation.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀audience's⠀response,⠀on⠀a⠀disputed⠀point⠀left⠀open,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀learner's⠀next⠀stage⠀still⠀to⠀be⠀related.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀one⠀meaningful⠀attempt.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀limit⠀in⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀still⠀fails,⠀what⠀this⠀attempt⠀tries⠀to⠀change⠀—⠀then⠀render⠀the⠀attempt⠀as⠀concrete⠀movement⠀and⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀short⠀and⠀visible:⠀the⠀method⠀used,⠀the⠀resource⠀spent,⠀the⠀result⠀obtained,⠀the⠀difficulty⠀that⠀remains.\n\nState⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀try⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀costs;⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀language⠀and⠀move⠀on⠀without⠀summarizing⠀the⠀whole⠀system⠀or⠀repeating⠀the⠀explanation⠀after⠀the⠀result.⠀Let⠀omission⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀deleting⠀causality:⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀can⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀damaged⠀material,⠀the⠀adjusted⠀grip,⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀action⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀announced⠀lesson.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀note⠀that⠀materially⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀attempt⠀—⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀doubt,⠀attention,⠀or⠀recalculation⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀stand⠀when⠀the⠀essential⠀thought⠀needs⠀its⠀length.⠀Spoken⠀voices⠀stay⠀individual;⠀compression⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀flattening⠀the⠀cast.\n\nPreserve⠀uneven⠀advancement⠀in⠀few⠀words.⠀A⠀success⠀exposes⠀a⠀new⠀limit;⠀a⠀new⠀capability⠀makes⠀an⠀old⠀task⠀easier⠀without⠀completing⠀the⠀character.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀result⠀or⠀at⠀the⠀interruption,⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀and⠀unnarrated.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀progression⠀as⠀one⠀sustained⠀scene⠀organized⠀around⠀a⠀specific⠀attempt.⠀Enter⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀capability⠀and⠀the⠀task⠀that⠀tests⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience⠀move⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀moves.⠀Tie⠀each⠀movement⠀to⠀the⠀attempt:⠀a⠀remembered⠀lesson⠀matters⠀when⠀it⠀shapes⠀the⠀present⠀method,⠀a⠀conversation⠀when⠀it⠀delivers⠀feedback⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀competing⠀commitment,⠀a⠀perception⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀next.\n\nMake⠀the⠀system⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀it.⠀Preparation⠀and⠀resource⠀use⠀appear⠀as⠀things⠀done⠀and⠀spent⠀in⠀the⠀moment;⠀a⠀limiting⠀rule⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀attempt's⠀difficulty⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀reasoning⠀about⠀it,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀paused⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀progression⠀system.⠀Let⠀the⠀result⠀demonstrate⠀changed⠀capability⠀—⠀a⠀task⠀impossible⠀before⠀now⠀succeeds,⠀or⠀succeeds⠀differently⠀—⠀while⠀another⠀difficulty⠀remains,⠀and⠀keep⠀values⠀inside⠀the⠀decision⠀about⠀what⠀to⠀risk,⠀spend,⠀or⠀postpone.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀reasoning⠀in⠀real⠀time⠀rather⠀than⠀reporting⠀afterward.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀shift⠀from⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀revised⠀method,⠀from⠀private⠀reasoning⠀to⠀spoken⠀feedback,⠀or⠀from⠀present⠀action⠀into⠀relevant⠀memory;⠀a⠀plain⠀transition⠀can⠀carry⠀elapsed⠀practice⠀time⠀without⠀restating⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀knows.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀between⠀attempts,⠀or⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀difficulty⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀audit⠀of⠀how⠀far⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀come.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀be⠀the⠀scene's⠀organizing⠀center⠀and⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀progression⠀happens.⠀Work⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀to⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀or⠀changed⠀capability⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀—⠀one⠀teaching⠀or⠀watching⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀shared⠀resource⠀to⠀spend⠀or⠀protect,⠀a⠀success⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀two⠀can⠀do⠀together,⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀tests⠀how⠀they⠀answer⠀each⠀other.⠀Keep⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself⠀concrete⠀and⠀legible:⠀the⠀current⠀limit,⠀the⠀method⠀tried,⠀the⠀result⠀shown⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀consequence.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀materials.⠀Private⠀language⠀from⠀the⠀premise⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀meaning⠀after⠀an⠀advance⠀or⠀a⠀setback;⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀can⠀signal⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀affection,⠀or⠀worry⠀without⠀being⠀glossed⠀for⠀the⠀reader.⠀Give⠀the⠀beat⠀room⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀—⠀a⠀held⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀first⠀success⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀arriving⠀a⠀beat⠀late⠀may⠀deserve⠀that⠀space⠀—⠀and⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀this⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀pattern⠀of⠀confession⠀or⠀jealousy.⠀Where⠀a⠀mechanism⠀affects⠀the⠀attempt,⠀keep⠀it⠀legible,⠀and⠀let⠀resource⠀costs⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀choose⠀to⠀risk⠀for⠀each⠀other.\n\nKeep⠀both⠀development⠀and⠀response⠀uneven⠀and⠀specific.⠀One⠀person's⠀improvement⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀other⠀proud,⠀envious,⠀relieved,⠀or⠀newly⠀aware⠀of⠀a⠀gap,⠀and⠀the⠀two⠀may⠀not⠀want⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀from⠀the⠀advance.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀settled⠀enough⠀to⠀feel⠀earned⠀while⠀the⠀next⠀stage⠀of⠀advancement⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀shared⠀difficulty⠀stays⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀attempts⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀of⠀the⠀learner's⠀present⠀standing⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀ahead,⠀then⠀relate⠀each⠀attempt⠀as⠀a⠀deed:⠀what⠀was⠀tried,⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀what⠀changed.⠀Present⠀any⠀mechanism⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀detached⠀explanation⠀—⠀a⠀resource⠀spent,⠀a⠀method⠀learned,⠀a⠀limit⠀overcome⠀enters⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀its⠀consequence,⠀so⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀understood⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀did.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀mark⠀the⠀stages⠀of⠀development.⠀A⠀compact⠀declaration⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀attempt⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀attempted⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀cost⠀paid⠀differently,⠀the⠀same⠀weakness⠀exposed⠀under⠀new⠀conditions.⠀Relate⠀each⠀new⠀capability⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀said⠀of⠀the⠀learner,⠀but⠀claim⠀no⠀reputation⠀unearned,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀—⠀deeds⠀witnessed,⠀deeds⠀reported,⠀and⠀deeds⠀inferred⠀stay⠀distinct,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀motive⠀can⠀remain⠀outside⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀public⠀record⠀without⠀leaving⠀the⠀story.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀story⠀establishes⠀oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds,⠀they⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀account;⠀import⠀no⠀pantheon⠀and⠀no⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀and⠀let⠀speakers⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀voices⠀rather⠀than⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀choice⠀and⠀uneven⠀growth.⠀A⠀success⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀alongside⠀a⠀failure,⠀and⠀a⠀new⠀strength⠀may⠀create⠀obligation⠀or⠀danger⠀rather⠀than⠀completeness.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀or⠀consequence⠀still⠀to⠀be⠀recorded⠀instead⠀of⠀fixing⠀the⠀learner's⠀future⠀in⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀the⠀social-⠀and⠀domestic-realist⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀tradition.⠀Advancement⠀becomes⠀legible⠀as⠀changed⠀standing:⠀who⠀trusts⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀work,⠀who⠀asks⠀them⠀for⠀help,⠀who⠀must⠀revise⠀an⠀expectation⠀formed⠀long⠀ago,⠀who⠀carries⠀a⠀new⠀share⠀of⠀a⠀household's⠀or⠀institution's⠀obligations.⠀Show⠀the⠀attempts⠀that⠀produce⠀the⠀change—the⠀practice⠀undertaken⠀between⠀other⠀duties,⠀the⠀failed⠀application⠀watched⠀by⠀people⠀whose⠀opinion⠀matters,⠀the⠀correction⠀offered⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀second⠀attempt⠀that⠀only⠀partly⠀succeeds—and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀that⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀before,⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀them.\n\nRender⠀constraints⠀as⠀the⠀practical⠀economics⠀of⠀the⠀life.⠀When⠀a⠀task⠀needs⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀time,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀recovery,⠀or⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀arranged,⠀put⠀the⠀arrangement⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀consequence⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀result.⠀Knowing⠀a⠀principle⠀and⠀executing⠀it⠀under⠀fatigue,⠀pressure,⠀or⠀social⠀scrutiny⠀remain⠀different⠀things;⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀it⠀early.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀has⠀ranks⠀or⠀formal⠀stages,⠀let⠀them⠀matter⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀let⠀a⠀person⠀do⠀for⠀others,⠀not⠀as⠀announced⠀milestones,⠀and⠀invent⠀no⠀numerical⠀scaffolding⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀growth.\n\nLet⠀relationships⠀absorb⠀the⠀change⠀unevenly:⠀one⠀person⠀welcomes⠀the⠀improvement,⠀another⠀feels⠀displaced,⠀a⠀third⠀notices⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀arises,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀this⠀needs⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀betrayal⠀or⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀socially⠀situated—the⠀viewpoint's⠀sense⠀of⠀other⠀people⠀grows⠀out⠀of⠀shared⠀work,⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀meetings,⠀and⠀conversation⠀rather⠀than⠀solitary⠀reflection—and⠀when⠀private⠀thought⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀answer⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀moment:⠀a⠀remark⠀that⠀landed⠀wrongly,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀exposed⠀a⠀gap,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changed⠀meaning.\n\nStay⠀inside⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀supplies.⠀This⠀route⠀relocates⠀no⠀one,⠀imports⠀no⠀wintry⠀reserve,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀temperament,⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀blend⠀distinct⠀Nordic⠀contexts⠀into⠀one⠀generic⠀Scandinavian⠀texture⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀draws⠀them⠀separately.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀rules⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀hold⠀on⠀the⠀telling.⠀Advancement⠀can⠀stay⠀uneven⠀across⠀a⠀life—a⠀strength⠀in⠀a⠀craft⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀negotiation⠀or⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀care⠀untouched—and⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀relationships⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀developing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀filmable⠀attempts⠀and⠀their⠀consequences.⠀Concise⠀action⠀lines⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀what⠀they⠀prepare,⠀what⠀resource⠀they⠀spend,⠀and⠀what⠀result⠀follows:⠀a⠀specific⠀motion⠀practiced⠀badly,⠀then⠀less⠀badly;⠀materials⠀laid⠀out⠀and⠀counted;⠀a⠀condition⠀checked⠀before⠀use.⠀Make⠀each⠀attempt⠀legible⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀character's⠀full⠀reasoning⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀lines.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀constraints⠀and⠀choices⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀one⠀detail⠀in⠀specific⠀terms;⠀a⠀companion⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before;⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀attempting⠀now⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀might⠀fail.⠀Tie⠀every⠀explanation⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀delivering⠀a⠀lecture,⠀and⠀when⠀a⠀mechanism⠀affects⠀the⠀outcome,⠀establish⠀it⠀beforehand⠀through⠀a⠀visible⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀speech⠀so⠀the⠀payoff⠀reads⠀as⠀earned.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀give⠀each⠀scene⠀one⠀legible⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀session,⠀from⠀preparation⠀to⠀application,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀success⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀consequence⠀that⠀follows⠀it,⠀but⠀never⠀cut⠀past⠀the⠀preparation⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀later⠀success⠀understandable.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀result⠀when⠀hearing⠀it⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀showing⠀it—the⠀thud⠀of⠀a⠀dropped⠀load,⠀the⠀steadying⠀rhythm⠀of⠀drills⠀behind⠀a⠀closed⠀door—and⠀the⠀page⠀stays⠀free⠀of⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nHold⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separated⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀heard⠀by⠀no⠀one⠀on⠀screen.⠀Use⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀competing⠀commitment⠀shapes⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀choice,⠀not⠀as⠀commentary⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀on⠀screen—a⠀task⠀finished⠀faster,⠀a⠀technique⠀held⠀together⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀resource⠀spent⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀the⠀most⠀work,⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀isolates⠀a⠀specific⠀gap—and⠀keep⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀visible⠀as⠀well.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀continue;⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀victory⠀beat⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀staged⠀physical⠀work.⠀Blocking,⠀props,⠀and⠀observable⠀business⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do:⠀they⠀cross⠀the⠀stage⠀carrying⠀a⠀load⠀they⠀once⠀set⠀down,⠀complete⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀motions⠀without⠀stopping,⠀handle⠀a⠀tool⠀with⠀new⠀precision.⠀The⠀audience⠀watches⠀the⠀attempt⠀and⠀its⠀result⠀happen⠀live;⠀no⠀one⠀needs⠀to⠀hear⠀it⠀described⠀afterward.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀improvement⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀stage⠀permits.⠀If⠀a⠀task⠀requires⠀a⠀particular⠀object,⠀a⠀cleared⠀space,⠀another⠀person's⠀assistance,⠀or⠀rest⠀beforehand,⠀establish⠀that⠀condition⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀is⠀made.⠀A⠀character⠀names⠀a⠀constraint⠀in⠀dialogue⠀when⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀their⠀choice—what⠀they⠀lack,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying,⠀what⠀they⠀expect⠀to⠀fail—and⠀the⠀explanation⠀stays⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀work⠀in⠀progress.⠀Treat⠀pauses⠀as⠀stageable⠀events⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀right:⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀motion⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀become⠀automatic,⠀and⠀the⠀disappearance⠀of⠀that⠀pause⠀where⠀it⠀used⠀to⠀be.\n\nUse⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀test⠀advancement⠀socially.⠀Someone⠀who⠀has⠀improved⠀may⠀be⠀asked⠀to⠀demonstrate,⠀to⠀teach,⠀to⠀take⠀over⠀a⠀task⠀another⠀person⠀handled,⠀or⠀to⠀work⠀beside⠀a⠀doubter.⠀Let⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀together:⠀a⠀correction⠀delivered⠀while⠀adjusting⠀a⠀grip,⠀praise⠀that⠀arrives⠀as⠀the⠀recipient⠀is⠀still⠀clearing⠀away⠀the⠀failure,⠀a⠀request⠀made⠀while⠀resetting⠀the⠀floor⠀for⠀another⠀try.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀stage⠀directions—not⠀an⠀aside⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀monologue⠀performed⠀to⠀the⠀house⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀Use⠀it⠀when⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀competing⠀commitment⠀shapes⠀the⠀next⠀staged⠀choice.\n\nLet⠀advancement⠀stay⠀uneven:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀succeed⠀at⠀one⠀task⠀and⠀fail⠀at⠀another⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀Restrict⠀directions⠀to⠀what⠀performers⠀and⠀crew⠀can⠀stage—position,⠀light,⠀sound,⠀object—and⠀write⠀no⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀keep⠀practicing,⠀with⠀no⠀obligatory⠀gathering,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀victory⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀the⠀changing⠀texture⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀moving⠀through⠀practice,⠀feedback,⠀and⠀new⠀capability.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀through⠀that⠀mind⠀as⠀it⠀attempts⠀a⠀task:⠀a⠀corrected⠀motion⠀surfaces⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀attempt;⠀a⠀failure⠀breaks⠀into⠀a⠀train⠀of⠀thought⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely;⠀a⠀success⠀feels⠀unfamiliar⠀enough⠀that⠀attention⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀advancement⠀recoverable⠀inside⠀the⠀associations.⠀When⠀a⠀constraint⠀bears⠀on⠀an⠀attempt,⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀register⠀it⠀concretely—the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀absence,⠀the⠀condition⠀unmet,⠀the⠀cost⠀already⠀paid—so⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀this⠀attempt⠀worked⠀where⠀the⠀last⠀one⠀failed.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀recite⠀the⠀principle⠀they⠀were⠀taught⠀and⠀feel⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀it⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀body⠀actually⠀does;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀association⠀dissolve⠀the⠀mechanism⠀into⠀impression.\n\nMark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀happens,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined:⠀a⠀remembered⠀session⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀current⠀attempt,⠀and⠀a⠀pictured⠀success⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀accomplished⠀one.⠀A⠀sensory⠀anchor,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀tense⠀or⠀address⠀can⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented.⠀The⠀mode⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀mind⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes;⠀other⠀characters⠀are⠀known⠀from⠀outside,⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀stay⠀determinate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recurring⠀concern⠀give⠀advancement⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀character⠀measures⠀progress⠀against⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀fear,⠀or⠀a⠀competing⠀commitment⠀that⠀keeps⠀surfacing⠀mid-practice,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀mind⠀holds⠀that⠀concern⠀changes⠀as⠀capability⠀does:⠀what⠀once⠀produced⠀panic⠀now⠀produces⠀focus;⠀an⠀achievement⠀that⠀once⠀seemed⠀unreachable⠀now⠀raises⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀it.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly⠀within⠀the⠀same⠀attention—one⠀motion⠀grown⠀automatic⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀demands⠀deliberate⠀thought—and⠀the⠀telling⠀registers⠀both⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀rank⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀stage.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀finished⠀attempt,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀thought⠀still⠀turning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀transmit.⠀A⠀learner⠀asks⠀a⠀specific⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt;⠀a⠀teacher⠀corrects⠀one⠀detail⠀in⠀plain⠀terms;⠀a⠀companion⠀confirms⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀done⠀or⠀names⠀what⠀still⠀went⠀wrong.⠀Let⠀requests,⠀offers,⠀refusals,⠀and⠀confirmations⠀carry⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀without⠀anyone⠀filing⠀a⠀progress⠀report,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀thread⠀itself⠀be⠀the⠀record:⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀once⠀asked⠀for⠀help⠀can⠀be⠀answered⠀further⠀down⠀by⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀help,⠀and⠀an⠀old⠀instruction⠀can⠀be⠀quoted⠀back⠀when⠀it⠀finally⠀applies.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀detail⠀the⠀messages⠀reveal.⠀If⠀a⠀task⠀needs⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀condition,⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀practice,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀hands,⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀asks⠀for,⠀offers,⠀declines,⠀or⠀confirms—what⠀was⠀prepared,⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀resulted.⠀Keep⠀explanation⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀need⠀rather⠀than⠀composed⠀as⠀a⠀lecture⠀in⠀text⠀form.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀transmitted⠀text⠀from⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind;⠀it⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀its⠀composition⠀matters,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀receives,⠀and⠀any⠀context⠀beyond⠀the⠀exchange⠀appears⠀only⠀when⠀needed,⠀set⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution—one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀full⠀sentences;⠀one⠀answers⠀at⠀once,⠀another⠀after⠀a⠀delay⠀the⠀transcript⠀marks⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀means.⠀No⠀habit⠀signals⠀honesty⠀or⠀deceit⠀on⠀its⠀own.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀alter⠀meaning:⠀a⠀delay⠀that⠀shows⠀hesitation,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀in⠀between,⠀not⠀a⠀marker⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀confirm,⠀request,⠀or⠀decline.⠀A⠀correction⠀that⠀once⠀produced⠀confusion⠀now⠀draws⠀the⠀follow-up⠀question⠀that⠀shows⠀understanding;⠀a⠀task⠀once⠀delegated⠀is⠀now⠀offered⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀What⠀remains⠀difficult⠀stays⠀visible—clarification⠀still⠀requested,⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀avoided,⠀a⠀resource⠀still⠀missing—and⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀answer,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unread,⠀with⠀no⠀mandatory⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀attempt⠀happens⠀and⠀the⠀condition⠀the⠀character⠀brings⠀to⠀it—the⠀space,⠀the⠀materials⠀laid⠀out,⠀the⠀person⠀waiting⠀to⠀observe—then⠀let⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀the⠀attempt⠀itself:⠀the⠀motion,⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀result.⠀Keep⠀narrative⠀beats⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀sit⠀between⠀lines⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀changes,⠀re-establish⠀place⠀and⠀participants⠀so⠀the⠀shift⠀stays⠀legible.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀advancement⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀dialogue⠀explains.⠀A⠀required⠀resource,⠀condition,⠀teacher's⠀guidance,⠀or⠀period⠀of⠀recovery⠀is⠀established⠀before⠀the⠀attempt,⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀outcome.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀state⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀might⠀fail;⠀another⠀can⠀correct⠀a⠀specific⠀detail.⠀Keep⠀every⠀explanation⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nTreat⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀that⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators⠀and⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀label⠀owed⠀to⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀draw⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀real⠀information—what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀what⠀was⠀prepared—carries⠀the⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀focal⠀narration⠀show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀interpreting⠀another⠀person's⠀reaction,⠀and⠀allow⠀that⠀interpretation⠀to⠀be⠀incomplete⠀or⠀mistaken:⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀support⠀it,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀was⠀concerned⠀with⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀consequences⠀of⠀advancement⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythm—a⠀request⠀to⠀demonstrate,⠀to⠀teach,⠀to⠀take⠀on⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀to⠀work⠀beside⠀a⠀doubter.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀accomplish⠀here:⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀faster,⠀a⠀technique⠀held⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀resource⠀spent⠀well,⠀a⠀failure⠀that⠀isolates⠀a⠀specific⠀gap.⠀Keep⠀what⠀still⠀resists⠀visible.⠀No⠀branching⠀menu,⠀player⠀decision,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀engine⠀command⠀comes⠀with⠀the⠀format;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalabbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀cumulative⠀developments⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀re-enter⠀at⠀any⠀installment.⠀Each⠀reply⠀registers⠀a⠀local⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀understanding—a⠀practice⠀session⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀specific⠀gap,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀finally⠀takes⠀hold,⠀a⠀resource⠀spent⠀that⠀alters⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀next,⠀a⠀task⠀completed⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀out⠀of⠀reach—and⠀makes⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀here,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue.⠀Progress⠀can⠀run⠀through⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀not⠀technique⠀alone.\n\nRecover⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀the⠀current⠀attempt⠀needs.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀constraint⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀one—a⠀resource⠀already⠀spent,⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀met,⠀a⠀correction⠀given⠀installments⠀ago—briefly⠀recover⠀that⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀established,⠀and⠀keep⠀preparation⠀and⠀payoff⠀connected⠀across⠀time:⠀what⠀was⠀gathered⠀earlier⠀is⠀spent⠀now,⠀what⠀was⠀taught⠀earlier⠀is⠀tested⠀now,⠀a⠀weakness⠀identified⠀earlier⠀is⠀worked⠀on⠀now.\n\nDistinguish⠀knowing⠀from⠀executing.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀instruction⠀perfectly⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀the⠀attempt;⠀let⠀the⠀installment⠀show⠀that⠀gap⠀without⠀closing⠀it⠀at⠀once.⠀Strengths⠀and⠀weaknesses⠀develop⠀unevenly—one⠀task⠀grows⠀automatic⠀while⠀another⠀still⠀demands⠀deliberate⠀effort—and⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀register⠀both.⠀Keep⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀contributes⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes,⠀and⠀let⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀work.\n\nLet⠀serial⠀duration⠀give⠀established⠀facts⠀new⠀meaning.⠀A⠀resource,⠀a⠀limitation,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀introduced⠀earlier⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀different⠀significance⠀once⠀capability⠀changes,⠀recovered⠀briefly⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀continue;⠀use⠀a⠀hook⠀when⠀a⠀development⠀genuinely⠀opens⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀request⠀stay⠀unanswered⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀span⠀turns⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀deferring⠀progress⠀forever.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀each⠀moment⠀of⠀improvement⠀as⠀a⠀practice⠀ritual⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀describe⠀without⠀counting⠀something:⠀repetitions,⠀breaths,⠀names,⠀cups,⠀scars,⠀the⠀attempts⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀clean⠀execution.⠀Let⠀the⠀count⠀carry⠀a⠀private⠀wound.⠀Each⠀rep⠀can⠀recall⠀a⠀failure,⠀a⠀dependency,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀absence⠀made⠀the⠀skill⠀necessary,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀exactness⠀about⠀numbers⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀hurt⠀shows⠀without⠀being⠀named.\n\nTreat⠀a⠀rank,⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀technique⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability,⠀not⠀a⠀cure.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀alters⠀their⠀options⠀and⠀the⠀pressure⠀others⠀place⠀on⠀them;⠀whether⠀the⠀wound⠀underneath⠀eases,⠀hardens,⠀or⠀stays⠀the⠀same⠀is⠀decided⠀by⠀the⠀events⠀you⠀actually⠀write,⠀not⠀by⠀the⠀promotion⠀itself.⠀Show⠀advancement⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀act⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀impossible⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀held,⠀a⠀blow⠀turned,⠀a⠀formula⠀finished⠀under⠀fatigue⠀—⠀and⠀attach⠀the⠀emotional⠀charge⠀to⠀that⠀act⠀as⠀shame,⠀rage,⠀apology,⠀need,⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀victory⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀same⠀beat⠀may⠀also⠀carry⠀an⠀awkward,⠀partial⠀ease;⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀share⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀fragments⠀from⠀practice⠀as⠀emotional⠀punctuation:⠀a⠀rule⠀the⠀character⠀repeats,⠀a⠀phrase⠀a⠀teacher⠀used,⠀a⠀ritual⠀of⠀washing⠀or⠀counting⠀after⠀an⠀attempt.⠀Place⠀a⠀recurrence⠀where⠀the⠀strain⠀is⠀real⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀When⠀another⠀person⠀enters,⠀work⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀specific⠀interaction⠀—⠀a⠀refusal⠀of⠀help,⠀a⠀stiff⠀apology,⠀a⠀need⠀confessed⠀only⠀after⠀two⠀failed⠀attempts⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀skill⠀and⠀relationship⠀move⠀together⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it:⠀an⠀argument⠀inside⠀sparring,⠀a⠀confession⠀after⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀stops;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀end⠀stronger⠀and⠀still⠀hurting,⠀or⠀somewhere⠀the⠀exchange⠀has⠀actually⠀earned.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀practice⠀interval⠀in⠀scannable⠀paragraphs,⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀attribution⠀for⠀every⠀spoken⠀line.⠀Open⠀on⠀the⠀submitted⠀action⠀or⠀attempt⠀in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀voice⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀uses,⠀then⠀give⠀it⠀an⠀immediate⠀material⠀consequence:⠀a⠀strike⠀that⠀lands,⠀a⠀formula⠀that⠀flickers,⠀a⠀grip⠀that⠀finally⠀holds.⠀Ground⠀improvement⠀in⠀a⠀repeatable⠀routine⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀keeps⠀—⠀steps⠀counted,⠀a⠀pouch⠀tapped,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀rule⠀recited⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀and⠀quote⠀or⠀report⠀that⠀fragment⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.\n\nGive⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀and⠀NPCs⠀their⠀own⠀limited⠀knowledge⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀display.⠀A⠀correction,⠀an⠀admiration,⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀a⠀challenge⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀expert⠀or⠀hostile:⠀a⠀training⠀partner⠀can⠀refuse⠀to⠀repeat⠀a⠀dangerous⠀drill,⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀explain⠀the⠀conditions⠀under⠀which⠀the⠀technique⠀works,⠀and⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nLet⠀self-exposure⠀surface⠀through⠀process⠀where⠀strain⠀actually⠀occurs⠀—⠀a⠀past⠀failure⠀mentioned,⠀exhaustion⠀admitted⠀after⠀a⠀clean⠀run,⠀a⠀private⠀gesture⠀after⠀the⠀drill⠀—⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract.⠀End⠀the⠀post⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀living⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀mid-drill,⠀mid-instruction,⠀or⠀while⠀someone⠀fetches⠀a⠀new⠀supply;⠀the⠀continuation⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀going⠀on,⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀forced⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀manufactured⠀choice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀martial⠀adventure⠀route:⠀the⠀progression⠀lives⠀inside⠀an⠀inherited⠀discipline⠀—⠀a⠀sect,⠀a⠀family⠀art,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀wandering⠀master's⠀teaching⠀—⠀told⠀with⠀the⠀episodic⠀momentum⠀of⠀deed,⠀consequence,⠀and⠀remembered⠀reputation.⠀Write⠀each⠀training⠀beat⠀as⠀a⠀procedural⠀lesson⠀with⠀a⠀named⠀form,⠀a⠀required⠀count,⠀and⠀a⠀material⠀consequence⠀when⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀rushed.⠀The⠀student⠀repeats⠀the⠀form⠀in⠀the⠀courtyard⠀while⠀the⠀master⠀watches,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀records⠀the⠀body's⠀exact⠀failures:⠀the⠀wobble⠀of⠀a⠀stance,⠀the⠀late⠀turn,⠀the⠀torn⠀callus.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀through⠀transmission.⠀A⠀rule⠀recurs⠀across⠀scenes⠀with⠀small⠀variation⠀—⠀a⠀senior's⠀reminder,⠀a⠀forbidden⠀shortcut,⠀a⠀phrase⠀whispered⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀attempt⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀rule⠀carries⠀a⠀debt:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀dead⠀parent,⠀a⠀slight⠀against⠀a⠀rival⠀school,⠀an⠀obligation⠀to⠀a⠀disgraced⠀master.⠀Advancement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀when⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀performed⠀under⠀real⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀night⠀duel,⠀an⠀interrupted⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀demonstration⠀before⠀an⠀elder⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀stays⠀uneven;⠀the⠀student⠀may⠀win⠀a⠀contest⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀manage⠀an⠀apology⠀to⠀a⠀sibling.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀gives⠀them⠀—⠀its⠀architecture,⠀diet,⠀transport,⠀and⠀social⠀forms,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀exotic⠀backdrop⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀tradition⠀shape⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀relocating⠀the⠀cast.⠀Let⠀private⠀cost⠀surface⠀through⠀etiquette⠀and⠀conduct,⠀the⠀way⠀martial⠀adventure⠀carries⠀feeling⠀in⠀manners:⠀a⠀bow⠀held⠀too⠀long,⠀an⠀elder's⠀dismissal,⠀a⠀junior's⠀refusal⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀technique.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀episode's⠀beat⠀rests,⠀with⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀standing⠀or⠀capability⠀legible;⠀the⠀personal⠀friction⠀may⠀persist,⠀ease,⠀or⠀deepen⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀events⠀decide.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀each⠀progression⠀beat⠀as⠀a⠀short,⠀hard⠀sequence⠀of⠀attempt,⠀result,⠀and⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀—⠀a⠀swing,⠀a⠀sprint,⠀a⠀knot⠀tied,⠀a⠀chant⠀repeated⠀—⠀and⠀record⠀the⠀exact⠀material⠀outcome:⠀the⠀callus⠀splits,⠀the⠀pack⠀slips,⠀the⠀torch⠀gutters.⠀The⠀result⠀may⠀be⠀failure,⠀partial⠀success,⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀execution;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀equipment⠀register⠀it.⠀Use⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀a⠀paragraph⠀can⠀begin⠀mid-drill⠀and⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀changed⠀grip⠀or⠀breath,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀consequence.\n\nRepeat⠀one⠀specific⠀practical⠀rule⠀or⠀fragment⠀across⠀the⠀sequence⠀—⠀a⠀count,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀routine,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀warning,⠀a⠀ritual⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀repetition⠀mark⠀the⠀character's⠀obsession⠀rather⠀than⠀float⠀as⠀a⠀tic.⠀When⠀a⠀skill⠀finally⠀executes,⠀report⠀the⠀new⠀capability⠀in⠀physical⠀terms⠀—⠀the⠀door⠀swings⠀open,⠀the⠀wire⠀holds,⠀the⠀flame⠀answers⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀remains⠀difficult⠀surface⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀recurs:⠀the⠀same⠀motion⠀under⠀fatigue,⠀the⠀next⠀rank's⠀cost,⠀the⠀need⠀for⠀someone⠀else's⠀instruction.\n\nGround⠀emotional⠀content⠀in⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀—⠀anger⠀as⠀a⠀slammed⠀buckle,⠀fear⠀as⠀a⠀checked⠀strap,⠀need⠀as⠀a⠀ration⠀shared⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀summary,⠀and⠀let⠀rough⠀speech⠀belong⠀to⠀its⠀speaker.⠀When⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀a⠀longer⠀thought,⠀keep⠀it,⠀with⠀the⠀surrounding⠀language⠀concrete.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀attention⠀ends,⠀often⠀just⠀past⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀or⠀a⠀definite⠀limit,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀moral⠀summary⠀out.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀—⠀practice⠀logs,⠀field⠀reports,⠀letters,⠀a⠀master's⠀written⠀corrections⠀—⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀author,⠀purpose,⠀and⠀moment⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀no⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀between⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀form⠀itself⠀structure⠀the⠀progression:⠀a⠀daily⠀record⠀counts⠀repetitions⠀and⠀notes⠀failed⠀attempts;⠀a⠀week⠀on,⠀a⠀new⠀entry⠀lists⠀three⠀failures;⠀a⠀month⠀on,⠀a⠀letter⠀home⠀mentions⠀the⠀technique⠀just⠀learned⠀and⠀omits⠀the⠀injury⠀that⠀came⠀with⠀it.\n\nRun⠀the⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀inside⠀the⠀documents.⠀The⠀same⠀rule⠀or⠀drill⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀in⠀the⠀log,⠀a⠀remembered⠀warning⠀in⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀standard⠀correction⠀in⠀the⠀master's⠀report,⠀and⠀the⠀formulation⠀shifts⠀with⠀the⠀writer's⠀state⠀—⠀the⠀student⠀copies⠀the⠀phrase⠀differently⠀when⠀confident,⠀exhausted,⠀or⠀ashamed.⠀That⠀recurrence⠀makes⠀the⠀advancement⠀legible⠀across⠀entries⠀without⠀editorial⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀reveal⠀and⠀conceal⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀situation:⠀a⠀sickbay⠀report⠀lists⠀the⠀broken⠀bone⠀and⠀not⠀the⠀duel's⠀cause;⠀a⠀supply⠀request⠀keeps⠀asking⠀for⠀bandages;⠀a⠀rival's⠀complaint⠀accuses⠀a⠀shortcut⠀the⠀log⠀denies.⠀The⠀cost⠀of⠀progression⠀gathers⠀in⠀these⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀defensive⠀repetitions⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀in⠀anything⠀plainly⠀stated,⠀and⠀where⠀a⠀document's⠀purpose⠀invites⠀confession,⠀the⠀confession⠀still⠀shows⠀its⠀writer's⠀defensive⠀logic.⠀Preserve⠀causal⠀continuity⠀—⠀later⠀documents⠀may⠀cite⠀earlier⠀ones⠀but⠀cannot⠀change⠀what⠀they⠀recorded.⠀A⠀log⠀or⠀letter⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind:⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀includes⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀the⠀attention⠀and⠀motive⠀surrounding⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀composition⠀still⠀get⠀written.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀training⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀of⠀care⠀and⠀deliberate⠀effort.⠀Build⠀comfort⠀from⠀concrete⠀repeated⠀details⠀that⠀earn⠀their⠀warmth⠀through⠀predictability:⠀the⠀warm-up⠀counted⠀aloud,⠀the⠀cup⠀of⠀tea⠀set⠀beside⠀the⠀practice⠀mat,⠀the⠀clean⠀cloth⠀folded⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Let⠀the⠀hard⠀rhythm⠀live⠀in⠀these⠀maintenance⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀transgression⠀or⠀shame⠀—⠀the⠀narrator⠀counts⠀breaths,⠀sets,⠀or⠀cups,⠀and⠀the⠀counting⠀steadies⠀the⠀room.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀an⠀observable⠀preference⠀that⠀shapes⠀the⠀practice:⠀one⠀always⠀tightens⠀the⠀right⠀strap⠀first,⠀another⠀drinks⠀cold⠀water⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀third⠀set,⠀a⠀third⠀hums⠀three⠀notes⠀before⠀a⠀difficult⠀form.⠀Let⠀affection⠀arrive⠀in⠀action⠀—⠀a⠀partner⠀adjusting⠀a⠀grip⠀without⠀speaking,⠀a⠀cushion⠀set⠀down⠀when⠀the⠀student⠀wobbles,⠀the⠀last⠀piece⠀of⠀fruit⠀saved⠀—⠀so⠀sincerity⠀never⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair.⠀Keep⠀the⠀progression⠀real:⠀a⠀difficult⠀technique⠀takes⠀its⠀actual⠀number⠀of⠀attempts,⠀capability⠀grows⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀difficulty⠀stays⠀difficult.⠀When⠀something⠀does⠀go⠀wrong,⠀the⠀available⠀responses⠀include⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀the⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀patient⠀re-demonstration,⠀a⠀shared⠀snack,⠀chosen⠀by⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀dispensed⠀automatically.\n\nPreserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀argue⠀about⠀form⠀or⠀refuse⠀help⠀at⠀first,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀between⠀them⠀moves⠀at⠀its⠀own⠀speed;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀anyone⠀to⠀become⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀problems⠀stay⠀in⠀place⠀without⠀turning⠀dangerous.⠀Show⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀something⠀concrete⠀—⠀a⠀longer⠀hold,⠀a⠀cleaner⠀turn⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀care⠀continuing⠀around⠀it.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀rests,⠀effort⠀and⠀ease⠀still⠀together,⠀needing⠀no⠀final⠀gift⠀or⠀declaration⠀to⠀count⠀as⠀comfort.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀progression⠀inside⠀a⠀socially⠀observed⠀ritual,⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀that⠀distance,⠀open⠀on⠀framing⠀context⠀—⠀a⠀hall⠀where⠀apprentices⠀are⠀ranked⠀by⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀they⠀first⠀kept⠀the⠀flame⠀lit,⠀a⠀family⠀whose⠀letters⠀record⠀each⠀generation's⠀first⠀successful⠀invocation,⠀a⠀city⠀that⠀measures⠀respect⠀by⠀answered⠀midnight⠀bells⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀repetitions⠀of⠀practice⠀carry⠀a⠀public⠀meaning⠀alongside⠀the⠀private⠀one.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language⠀without⠀imposing⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀on⠀every⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀procedural⠀recursion⠀as⠀architecture.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀can⠀open⠀on⠀a⠀clause⠀from⠀the⠀training⠀rule,⠀vary⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀student's⠀changing⠀understanding,⠀and⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀material⠀mark⠀left⠀by⠀that⠀attempt⠀—⠀a⠀scorch⠀on⠀the⠀wall,⠀a⠀torn⠀seam,⠀a⠀glove⠀worn⠀through.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflects,⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀move⠀through⠀social⠀history,⠀family⠀debt,⠀or⠀institutional⠀judgment,⠀connecting⠀the⠀private⠀obsession⠀to⠀the⠀wider⠀order⠀it⠀happens⠀inside.\n\nShow⠀advancement⠀as⠀changing⠀mastery⠀within⠀that⠀order,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀uneven.⠀A⠀junior⠀may⠀first⠀bow⠀too⠀late,⠀later⠀preside⠀over⠀a⠀small⠀ceremony,⠀later⠀still⠀decline⠀a⠀traditional⠀promotion,⠀and⠀each⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀shifts⠀how⠀others⠀address,⠀seat,⠀or⠀ask⠀help⠀of⠀the⠀character⠀—⠀while⠀a⠀technique⠀executed⠀perfectly⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀denied⠀its⠀rank⠀by⠀a⠀family⠀dispute.⠀The⠀cost⠀of⠀advancement⠀shows⠀in⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀private⠀obsession⠀and⠀public⠀ceremony.⠀End⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀its⠀attention⠀completes,⠀the⠀social⠀consequence⠀legible⠀and⠀its⠀settlement⠀left⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀does⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPalacah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Progression⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀progression⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀someone⠀is⠀telling⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀teller⠀has⠀an⠀audience,⠀an⠀occasion,⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀keep⠀speaking:⠀to⠀buy⠀time,⠀win⠀trust,⠀teach⠀a⠀companion,⠀justify⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀keep⠀a⠀listener⠀from⠀acting.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀stays⠀present⠀between⠀embedded⠀passages⠀and⠀changes⠀the⠀telling.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀shifts,⠀a⠀fire⠀settles,⠀a⠀door⠀closes,⠀or⠀the⠀available⠀time⠀ends,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀speed⠀up,⠀omit⠀a⠀step,⠀repeat⠀a⠀point,⠀or⠀stop⠀mid-account.\n\nMake⠀each⠀embedded⠀account⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt⠀to⠀improve.⠀The⠀teller⠀describes⠀the⠀drill,⠀the⠀mistake,⠀the⠀feedback,⠀the⠀adjustment,⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀capability⠀in⠀specific⠀physical⠀terms.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀could⠀not⠀do⠀before,⠀what⠀they⠀tried,⠀what⠀broke⠀or⠀resisted,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀advancement⠀as⠀a⠀rank-up.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀interrupt⠀with⠀practical⠀questions⠀about⠀method,⠀cost,⠀or⠀sequence.⠀When⠀a⠀question⠀lands⠀on⠀a⠀gap,⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀significance.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀deny⠀it,⠀deflect⠀into⠀another⠀step,⠀or⠀say⠀the⠀audience⠀is⠀asking⠀about⠀the⠀wrong⠀part.⠀Then⠀the⠀next⠀embedded⠀passage⠀continues⠀the⠀procedure⠀from⠀inside⠀that⠀unstated⠀gap,⠀showing⠀the⠀skipped⠀failure,⠀the⠀unexplained⠀resource,⠀the⠀teacher's⠀intervention,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀by⠀narrating⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.\n\nUse⠀Palahniuk's⠀hard⠀rhythms⠀and⠀obsessive⠀particulars⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀current⠀voice.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀short⠀rule,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀each⠀time⠀the⠀training⠀changes.⠀Make⠀the⠀repetition⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀without⠀glossing⠀it.⠀The⠀same⠀rule⠀can⠀sound⠀like⠀instruction⠀before⠀a⠀failure,⠀like⠀a⠀threat⠀or⠀promise⠀during⠀the⠀adjustment,⠀and⠀like⠀a⠀justification⠀after⠀the⠀audience⠀